<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Bugun: Good News Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Lug</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUG ro Muawie</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lug</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lug</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUG</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ro Muawie</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Hì pha miyao yi Lug è Isu yi Israel nane zab bran shii ragia rek phi pha sbang rek phi phro. Lug è yao Isu shii ne Ithong pha ragung è “Dushothek shii mua wie yao pha ho phro,” Chiih-è ai mua ne branthek shii nyie chid pha ji è ley noh phro. Chiih-è Lug shii lubo pha miyao de zey ne um ro, igobi pha nya hong dang pha jigigam shii Isu wuiiramuii ro è yao pha jigigam ro, iidohhè shii pha jigigam shii ne Isu ne hamangkhung hà dun dun pha ji zey ne um ro, Masi pha giang shii migi shii khi-èrek ne huak dun pha ji ne Blia pha jigigam shii de zey ne um ro.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichiih ne ichua nyie ro (ithoh 1-2 nane 9-19) bajo muna chab phane hì pha mua shii doh bie ro, ji è ibai pha hamangkhliie nane brogpho, Isu giak shii wuii pha, Isu yi bufuii ba shii Misiahò hà, chiih-è wie Samarithan pha najang nane san dun pha Dufuii ji pha chiang shii phaluii zey ne um ro. Mua ji pha bo gang ne misia shii rey, chiih-è Ragung So shii, chiih-è Isu pha blia hò-amuii ro, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è layogthek shii khung phi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jon khowo phi pha nane Isu ro giak nane ìu pha miyao ji ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:5">1:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:52">2:52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jon khowo phi pha bliakthek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isu ro khowo yie pha nane chuajan <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:21">3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:13">4:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isu ne Galili shii hong ne blia rek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:14">4:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:50">9:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galili re-è Jerusalem <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 9:51">9:51</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:27">19:27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Idohhè pha habda nane Jerusalem moe shii <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 19:28">19:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:56">23:56</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hòi, khia, chiih-è Ithong Hamangkhung dundun pha ji ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Bushun Theophilus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Bran bajo è gathek duchoi shii nyie rey pha miyaothek ji zey ne phi. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Ithek è hì zey pha ne, gathek è nyie yao pha ji ne igobi è hanyie è blia doh ne rai pho è mua ji gathek shii yao phro. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Chiih-è naro ilab, nyieliieshii igobi è nyie zey pha ji ne wie è tham phro. Ji è gu de na shii khriig rek yi pha chiang jia zey pha now muii ro. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Gu hì rek pha ne nathek shii nyie yoijong pha ji izai thieg pha rek phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khowo phi pha Jon giak pha miyao ji yao ramuii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1Phal 24:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Judea pha Herod saja sieng pha ishak shii, phabi wie rek pha Abija blang Zekharia beng pha phabi jia de um. Ai yiy beng ne Elizabeth ro; ai yi ji de phabithek haliing è giak pha bimi ro. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii mieg moe shii wie sieng ne rai. Chiih-è Ithong pha Iphey nane muyungthek nuii ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Aishii ani azen, nyieliiene Elizabeth ne ani azen phi, chiih-è Elizabeth nane Zekharia bajo weg reyjong ro.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Nai jia Zekharia yi awai Misiahò shii idang rek pha duiine awai phabi blia rek ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Phabithek è rek pha thiig pha Iphey duiine, sraibao shii bisi ziao pha miiran ne ai beng shii khia dun. Ji è ai misiahò iliing hà wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Ai è bisi ziao pha ishak shii bran ibrogthek ne fuang hà sia ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Hamangkhliie jia è bisi ziao pha sraibao shii ai phazoi moe shii wuii ruii. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zekharia è aishii doh mage shii, ai ne bizieng srane rum dun. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Ji shii hamangkhliie è aishii yao, Zekharia, na ne arum chid rabo! Hamangkhung-aphuii è na misia yoijong ro, chiih-è na yi Elizabeth è de dufuii jia giak ruii phro, na ne aishii Jon beng bo. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Nathek ne khama lised nane sang ruii phro, chiih-è ai giak mage shii gai branthek de bajo sang ruii phro! <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Ssb 6:3</ref></char></note>Ai ne Ithong mieg moe shii bajo boh bran rey ruii phro. Chiih-è ai ne phuii wegthek de aniing phi phro. Nyagiak dang pha idoh aishii ne Ragung So è ley dun phro, <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Chiih-è Israel pha bajo branthek shii awaithek pha Ithong Hamangkhung-aphuii moe shii idoh noh din ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref> </char></note> Ai ne chaig Elija duiine giang now ne bajo boh riichai Ithong awai pha ibi shii wuii dun phro, ai è aphuii nane aniphiing shii de òjia shii khrab din phi phro; ai è miyao anuii ne chun phothek shii dun giang noh pha lumuii hà idoh rai din yi phro; ai è Ithong pha branthek shii saro phi phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zekharia è hamangkhliie shii yao, “Hì thek rey pha gu ne khi è thieg ruii phlei? Gu ne weg sha dun ro; Chiih-è gu yiy de weg rey sha dun ro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char>
    </note> Hamangkhliie shii ji è chang, gu ne Gabyiel ro, “Gu ne hanyie è na shii hì thek pha miyao nane mua wie hì yao yi pha thoh pha Hamangkhung-aphuii rog riu muii ro, <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>hì ne ishak khriig rey shii ne izai rey ruii phro, jimagunde na ne hì pha guro mua ji izai anow. Na è migi arek pha ji è na ne miyao de ayao mua phro; nane sudoh è thiwing gu è sbang rek ne ruii pha izai arey sapho shii ne nane bi-ìe rey ne rai dun phro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Ji è rek pha ishak shii, branthek Zekharia shii khan ne rai. Chiih-è ai Misiahò hà nyama ishak nyie rek ne rai ara inow ne branthek munowthiig dun. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Ai fuang khia mage shii, ai ithek shii nyie de miyaogam ayao mua, chiih-è ithek ne thieg ai ne Misiahò hà ibang bang ara, ai nyie de miyaogam jia de ayao muluii pha rey srane jimagunde ai è ithek shii wad è phrai ne yao.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Ji è rek pha ishak shii Misiahò hà airo bliajong sha shii Zecharia awai hò hà idoh dun marui. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Ìujia pha idoh shii ai yi Elizabeth ne ani wiig, ji è habie guii thogdang pha ji pha hò shii athoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Elizabeth è yao. Idohòi shii Ithong è gu shii nong phi, “Ai è gu ro biwo ji ruang rek phi!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu giak sha pha ji yao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elezabeth yi ani wiig ne habie riig rey shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è hamangkhliie Gabyiel shii Galili pha bajarai hà Nazareth beng pha ithua hà thoh ge ro. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mth 1:18</ref></char></note>Ai è ji pha mua yi Joseph è yie pha ro è gang pha bimi jishii yao, ai ne Dawid Saja pha riing ro, ji pha bimi beng yi Mery ro. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Hamangkhliie shii è bimi jishii wuii thog srane yao, liijiing ne narog shii um ro! Ithong ne narog shii um ro chiih-è bajo boh khirzey ne na shii phi ro!<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Mery yi hamangkhliie pha mua ji è bajo diig than dun, chiih-è Mery ne ai miyaogamthek ne nyie ga inow ne wiengphleg dun. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Hamangkhliie è aishii yao, “Mery; arum chid rabo. Hamangkhung-aphuii è na shii bushun rek ro. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mth 1:21</ref></char></note>Na ne ani wiig ruii phro chiih-è dufuii giak ruii phro, chiih-è na aishii Isu beng bo. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32,33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Aij 9:7</ref></char></note> Ai ne bajo boh phro Chiih-è aishii ne bajo giu pha Hamangkhung-aphuii Dufuii rone ho ruii phro. Ithong Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii ne awai blang Dawid mirek pha ji duiine saja rab phi phro, <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Chiih-è ai ne Jakhob pha riingthek shii idang pha saja rey ne rai ruii phro, airo boh riichai ne khuchung de ajong phro!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mery è hamangkhliie shii yao, “Gu ne giang bimi ro, ji è, nyie khi-èrek ne hì rey mua phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Hamangkhliie è chang, “Ragung so de na shii wuii ruii phro, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro blu de na lakhung shii thog ruii phro. Ji pha chiang è hì pha ani So shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro dufuii rone ho phro. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Nawairo siang Elizabeth shii no mage bo. Ai è de yao gu ne ani agiak mua sha phro, jimagunde de ai ne bajo miriang habuii shii ani wiig ne habie riig rey sha ro. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Igo 18:14</ref></char></note>Ji-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è arek mua pha nyie de oi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Mery è yao: “Gu ne Ithong pha khiao ro, Na è gu shii nyie yao pha ji rey yi bo.” Chiih-è hamangkhliie è aishii thoh marui ne dun dun.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mery è Elizabeth shii si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Achia dang pha idoh shii Mery è saro srane Judea soh pha phiingduii hà riie ne jog wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Ai è Zekharia hò hà wuii srane Elizabeth shii salam phi. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elizabeth è Mery è khung ne yao pha ji nyayoi dang mage shii, ani yi ai lui iliing hà sid, chiih-è Elizabeth ne Ragung So è ley dun, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Chiih-è goh gang è yao, “Na ne zab pha hò-amuii è de bajo khirzey um ro, chiih-è na giak pha ani ji de bajo khirzey um ro! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Ithong pha amuii ne gu shii wuii ruii ne hì thek ne gu shii nyie rek ne rey ruii phlei? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Gu è na è khung ne yao pha ji nyayoi dang mage shii, gu iliing shii um pha arone chiung ne sang dun. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Ithong pha mua ji ne na shii izai rey ruii phrone yao pha ji shii migi rek pha ji è khama sang phro!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mery ro chiong pha ibai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1Sam 2:1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mery è yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Gu lubu è Ithong shii laso phi muii ro;<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Gu luruak ne . lised mua ro nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii ne garo ragia ro,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1Sam 1:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nyieliieshii gu shii ne awairo zum khiao duii rone inow phi ro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Ji è sudoh è thiwing branthek gu shii sang pha ro è ho ruii phro,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Nyieliieshii boh muna ne bajo blu Hamangkhung-aphuii pha è gu shii rek phi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Ai beng ne So ro;<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Hanyie thek è aishii lab rek arone ithek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">shii ne blang thog dang pha ai bushun doh yi phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Ai awairo blu wad ji è phia srane ithek miphia nane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">muphak rai jithek ne zab dayiingdayang rek muii phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Job 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Ai è blu sajathek shii ithek ro ithua è thazam khia muii phro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">chiih-è are-ahopho shii laziung chiing phi ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Ai è chi-iyiy pho shii ne wie muna phi ge phro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">chiih-è bukhothek shii ne wad isloi thoh ge phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Ai ne gethek achinmoithek shii sbang rek pha ji ne zab rek phi ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">chiih-è awai khiao Israel shii nong gieng pha wuii phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Igo 17:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ai ne idang athodang pha Abraham</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">nane zab airo riingthek shii nowkhlei ro!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mery ne Elizabeth rog shii habie uom thog pha rai marui ne awai hò hà dun din dun.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jon khowo phi pha ji giak pha ji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elizabeth yi ani giak pha ishak rey mage shii, ai è ani yi dufuii jia giak khlei. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Ai ro hadung-haluii nane siangthek è, aishii Ithong è khama buang pha blia wie rek pha ji yoi srane, ithek de zab ai rog shii lubo rek gieng.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:59: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ani ji yi damiley rey sha mage shii, ithek è aishii migiangkheg pha noh ne wuii dun, chiih-è ithek è ani beng yi ai aphuii beng Zekharia duiine beng pha saro. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Ji shii ai amuii è yao, “Asi! Ai beng ne Jon ruii chid phro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Ithek è aishii yao, “Jishii hì pha ibeng ne na siang hanyie shii de abeng ro!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Ji è ithek è iphuii shii wad è khoh srane sai, hì pha bufuii beng ne nyie ruii pha now lei?<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zekharia è ithek shii zey pha lubao ithileg jia lia srane zey phi, “Hì pha ani beng ne Jon ro.” Ji è ithek ne zab wiengphleg dun! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Ji è rek dang pha ji shii Zekharia de miyao yao mua dinne ai Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi pha jao. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Ji-è rek mage shii hadung-haluii pho ne zab rum dun, chiih-è ji pha mua ne zab phiingduii um pha Judea soh hà yoi thog dun. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Hanyie è ji yoi mage shii ji now srane sai, “Ji pha ani ne nyie rey pha um ga?” Hì ne izai ro Ithong pha blu ne ai rog shii um ro.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zekharia è chaig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Jon ai aphuii Zekharia yi Ragung So è ley ne, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii mua yao:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>Cho gethek ne Ithong, Israel pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi sha rai haro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Ai ne awai bran shii nong phi pha chiih-è sey ne noh phi pha wuii ro.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Ai è gethek shii awai khiao Dawid pha riing è blu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">Ragia rek pha jia phijong ro.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Ai è buyo è awairo so chaigpho ji è sbang rekjong ro<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Ji è ai ne gethek mak pho è,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">chiih-è hanyie è gethek shii snai pho pha blu è de ragia rek phi phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Ai è yao ai gethek pha achinmoithek shii bushun rek phi phro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">chiih-è awai shiinyie ug pha ji de athoh pha nowphi phro,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73-74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73-74"/>Wie rek ne gethek ro blang Abraham shii shurua thak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">ai è gethek shii gethek pha mak pho è ragia rek phi pha sbang rekjong phi ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">chiih-è gethek shii arum dang pha ai blia rek pha phijong ro,<verse eid="LUK 1:73-74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Ji-è gethek sieng pha ishak shii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">ai moe shii idang so nane gieng sieng ne rai chid phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Gu ani, nane, Bajo Giu Hamangkhung-aphuii pha chaig rone è ho ruii phro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Na ne Ithong pha ibi wuii srane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">airo lumuii rab iang phro,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Nawai branthek shii yao bo nawaithek layog</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">khungjong arone ragia rey phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Gethek Hamangkhung-aphuii ne bushun nane jum ro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">ai è ichuang phi ne giawo gethek lakhung shii thog yi phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:79: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Aij 9:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Chiih-è ai è igiia hà iy ne rai pho shii de hamangkhung è khilieng phi ruii phro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">liijiing pha lumuii hà de gethek shii gayiig noh phro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Ji pha ani ne sieng ne siu nane ragung ne gang rey dun ro, ai ne Israel pha bran moe khia pha nai athog sapho shii ne balimuang hà rai phro.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Isu giak pha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mth 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Ji pha ishak shii Bisiu Augusthus è Roman bukho boh thiig shii bran ibeng zey pha yung. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Igobi ji è rek ne bran tham ramuii pha ishak shii, Khuirinius yi Syria pha badri ro. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Zab pha branthek wuii srane awaithek ibeng zey pha awaithek thawun hà wuii dun.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Joseph de Galili pha Nazareth thawun è Judea pha Bethlehem thawun, Dawid saja giak pha ji hà wuii dun. Joseph thiisa hà wuii pha ji ne, nyieliieshii ai de Dawid saja pha riing è giak pha ji muwuii ro. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Ai de awai è gang pha Mery rog shii ibeng zey pha wuii dun, ai ne ani wiigjong ro, <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Chiih-è ithek Bethlehem hà ba shii, aishii ani giak pha ishak thog dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Ai è dufuii giak bi, chiih-è aishii yung è jiang srane rogo hà chab ne ruii, thiisa hà ne ai rai pha ùgud de oi ro.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shiishai brogphothek nane hamangkhliie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ji pha soh iring jia hà de brogphothek de nyaliak shii habiu hà de awaithek shiishai riig ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Ithong pha hamangkhliie è ithek moe shii dong khlei ruii, chiih-è Ithong pha biisiie ithek lakhung shii chuang khlei ruii. Ithek ne bajo sham ne rum dun, <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Ji shii hamangkhliie shii è ithek shii yao, “Arum chid rabo! Nathek shii phi pha gu ichiih mua wie rog shii um ro. Gu ne ichiih shii zab pha branthek shii boh lubo phi pha ji yao pha wuii phro. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Sudoh pha sud shii Dawid saja pha thiig shii, nathek shii ragia rek phi pha Ithong Masi giakjong ro! <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Ji thieg yi pha ne, ithek è ani jia yung shii jiang ne rogo iliing shii thieng ne rai pha doh ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Hamblo shii hamangkhung pha boh arming hamangkhliie rog shii wuii thog srane, Hamangkhung-aphuii shii lasothek bai phi:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Zab è giu pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii hamangkhung hà biisiie rey bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">sohnyiak hà na è hanyie shii sang pha ji shii de liijiing phi bo!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Hamangkhliie shii ithek è idoh hamangkhung hà dun marui shii, brogpho awaithek chung yao rai, “Cho gethek de Bethlehem hà wuii srane Ithong è gethek shii yao pha duiine ji rey dun pha ji riig rai.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Ji è ithek khthiie wuii dun ne Mery nane Joseph shii doh chiih-è ani yi rogo iliing shii thieng ne um pha doh. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Brogphothek è aishii doh mage shii, hamangkhliie shii è ani chiang shii nyie yao pha ji yao phi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Zab pha branthek de brogphothek miyao ji yoi ne wiengphleg dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Mery è jithek pha zab miyao now srane lubu iliing hà wie now din. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Brogphothek ne hamangkhliie shii è yao pha ji duiine yoi ne doh pha ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso bai ne idoh dun din dun.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ibeng beng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lug 1:31</ref></char>
    </note>Damiley pha idoh shii, ani ro migiangkheg pha ishak thog mage shii, aishii Isu beng, nyieliieshii ani awiig ba pha ibi shii hamangkhliie shii è yaojong.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii misiahò shii noh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22-24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lew 12:6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Joseph nane Mery shii Moses mizen marui pha Iphey duiine muhui ne sai pha ishak thog mage shii, ithek è aishii Jerusalem hà noh ne Ithong ibi shii phi. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Mul 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note> Ithong ro Iphey shii zey pha duiine, zab è igobi bufuii giak pha ani ne Ithong shii phi bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Ithek de Ithong ro Iphey miichiid duiine pharo nyi chiih-è khu-atham ichiung nyi yie srane zidphi.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ji pha idoh shii thiisa hà Simeon beng pha bran jia Jerusalem shii rai. Ai ne bajo wie nane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii rum ne rai pha bran ro, chiih-è Israel shii ragia rek phi pha ji shii khan ne rai phro. Ragung So de ai rog shii um. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Chiih-è aishii ne yaojong ro ai ne Ithong sbang rek pha Masi shii adoh sapho shii ne na a-iy phro. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Luruak è Simeon shii Misiahò hà noh ne wuii dun, ji è Iphey shii nyie khi-èrek chid pha ji rek pha ai aphuii ai amuii è Isu shii de Misiahò hà noh ne wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeon è ani ji wad shii giak srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi.<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>Ithong wo, na è nawai sbang ji rek phi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">chiih-è na nawai khiao shii liijiing è dun yi bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Gui mieg è naro giawo ne doh ge ro.<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Na è zab pha branthek miie shii rab ne ruiiphi,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Aij 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char>
    </note> Na ne muchuang de gaibranthek shii de na è yang pha ji re-è chuang phi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">chiih-è nawairo Israel pha branthek shii de biisiie rek phi.<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Simeon è ai pha miyao yao mage ne, ani pha iphuii imuii ne wiengphleg dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Ji è rek magunde Simeon è ithek shii khirzey phi ne, ai amuii, Mery shii yao, “Hì pha arone Hamangkhung-aphuii è Israel phothek buii rek pha nane giawo rek phi pha guajong ro. Ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è cheb jia mua mage ne bajo branthek è aishii gidieg rek ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Chiih-è ithek è ug ne now pha ji dong yi srane. Chiih-è duhug ne, khamriie chieg duiine na lubu shii giao ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36-37"/>Asher pha jad Phanuel idimi Ana beng pha chaig weg jia um. Ai ne gey dun ne idam miley rey ba bie shii ai ne idam samiliao è wi reyjong dun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:36-37: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ne thuh samiliao è wi dam weg reyjong; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">misiung ne amlia è wi dam.</char></note> Ai ne Misiahò shii athodang; ai ne hanai nane habiu de Hamangkhung-aphuii shii minyie nane misia sia. <verse eid="LUK 2:36-37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Ji pha ishak shii ai de thiichiih wuii thog srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi chiih-è khuchung Hamangkhung-aphuii è Jerusalem shii chie phi phro è khan pha branthek shii ani chiang ji yao phi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazareth hà idoh dun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mth 2:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ithong pha Iphey shii nyie khi-èrek chid pha ji duiine rek ched marui srane, ithek idoh Galili pha Nazareth awairo thawun awaithek hò shii thog ro. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Ani yi lasieng ne bugang rey mage srane aishii ne khani de ley um, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro khirzeythek de ai lakhung shii um.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bufuii Isu ne misiahò hà rai dun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Mul 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Iphy 16:1-8</ref></char>
    </note> Dam tham ne Hiiadun pha ji Sai pha inai shii Isu iphuii-imuii ne Jerusalem hà wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Isu ne dam snanyi rey mage shii ithek ne idang duiine buii hiia dun pha ji sai pha wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Sai pha jijong ched mage shii ithek ne idoh hò dun pha jao shii, Bufuii Isu ne Jerusalem hà rai dun. Ji-è rek pha ji yi iphuii imuii yi athieg; <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Iphuii imuii è now shii ai ne branthek rog shii rek ruii ara, jishii ithek ne hamiang è habzuang thog pha lua srane aishii thiichiih ijak nane siangthek rog shii um inow ne soh, <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>ithek è aishii adoh phi, ji è ithek ne aishii soh pha Jerusalem hà idoh wuii din dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Da-uom rey pha idoh shii aishii ne Misiahò hà Jewish masdothek rog shii dug ne, ithek miyao ji nuii srane musai sai ne rai iang pha doh ruii. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Ai miigao ne chang pha ji yoi ramuii phothek ne zab wiengphleg dun. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Iphuii-imuii de ai ji è rek ramuii pha ji riig srane, “Nowbuang dun, chiih-è imuii è idufuii shii yao, gu dufuii na è gasa shii diig nyie rek phlei? Na aphuii gasha ne munow thiig srane rum ne na shii soh.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Ai è isa shii chang, “Nasa gu shii nyie rek ne sow phlei? Nasa ne athieg bey gu ne gui ro aphuii hò shii um chid phro?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Ithek ne ai miichang ji ne agao ro.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Ji è Isu ne ithek ro miyao nuii srane ithek rog shii Nazareth hà idoh dun din gieng. Ai amuii è ji è rek pha jithek zab lubu iliing hà now ne ruii. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1Sam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Khua 3:4</ref></char></note>Hamangkhung-aphuii nane branthek pha haro mua ne. Isu ro siu nane khani ne boh sieng dun.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jon khowo phi pha muyua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mth 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrg 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Thiberius è Bisiu rek ne idam snaguii rey shii; Phonthius Philath yi Judea pha badri ro, chiih-è Galili thiig pha saja yi Herod ro, chiih-è ji pha soh Ithurea nane Thrachonithis pha saja yi Herod ikhuii Philiph ro; Chiih-è Abilene pha saja yi Lysanias ro, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Chiih-è Anas nane Khaiaphas yi Kho Phabithek ro. Ji pha ishak shii Hamangkhung-aphuii miyaogam yi balimuang hà Zekharia dufuii Jon shii thog. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Ji-è Jon ne Jordan Khamuii ring pha zab soh è dong ne lua srane yao; nathek layog è khid ne khowo yi bo, “Chiihphado Hamangkhung-aphuii è ithek layog de khung phi phro.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Aij 40:3-5</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Nyieliieshii hì pha miyao ne Aijaya jigigam shii zey ne um ro:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Bran jia balimuang shii ziak ramuii ro:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Ithong pha lumuii khriig rek ramuii ro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Ai lua pha lumuii miang rab ramuii ro!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Zab pha gaphiek um ne de lim dun phro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Zab pha phiingduii nane phiingthek lieg rab muii phro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Zab pha lumuii khi-èg um ne de miang rab dun ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Chiih-è khama pha lumuii sua um magunde neb rabjong ro.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Zab pha branthek de Hamangkhung-aphuii ro giawo doh ruii phro!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mth 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>
    </note> Bran brogthek ne Jon è Khowo phi yi pha wuii thog mage shii. Ai è ithek shii yao, “Pham nathek!” “Hamangkhung-aphuii muthoh pha lago ji è nathek ne yoh mua phrone, nathek shii hanyie miyao lei? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Jon 8:33</ref></char></note> Ji-è nathek ne layog è idoh khid rone doh yi pha bliathek rek mage bo. Chiih-è ithek ne Abraham ne ithek blang rone jao ne ayao chid rabo. Gu nathek shii izai yaodang phro, Hamangkhung-aphuii è hì pha lubao yi srane Abraham ro riingthek nyarab mua phro! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mth 7:19</ref></char></note>Thabiu ne hing iriingthek shii che pha khriig rek ne ruiijong ro, iwoi wie awoi pha hingmuii shii ne zab che ne bai shii fen muii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Branthek è aishii sai, “Ji arone, gathek ne nyie rek chid phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Ai è chang, “Hanyie shii magunde phadiig nyie um arone jia yi oi pho shii phi bo, chiih-è hanyie shii magunde michie um arone gai shii de thang bo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Lug 7:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Mijin thanphothek de khowo yi pha wuii thog, chiih-è ithek è aishii sai, “Masdo, gathek ne nyie rek chid phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Ai è ithek shii yao, “Nathek shii chua mua pha ji è huak pha athan rabo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Siphahithek è de aishii sai, “Gathek chiang shii de nyie ga? Gathek ne nyie rek chid phlei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Ai è ithek shii yao, “Hanyie shii magunde bangchiie bang ayie rabo chiih-è gai shii biidiie athe rabo. Nawai shii nyie mua pha ji shii liingsed bo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Branthek è luthong pha ji ne boh rey ruii, chiih-è ithek ne Jon ne yang ne Masi ne bey rone inow. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Ji è Jon è zab shii yao, “Gu ne nathek shii kho è khowo phi bie, jishii gu è de bajo boh bran jia wuiiramuii ro. Gu ne ai lakhia thang de se mua sbo asi ro. Ai è nathek shii Ragung So nane bai è khowo phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Chiih-è awai rog shii de dasai um ro, doh jia ai ne phiug shii sai srane igam shii yoi rek srane awai haphuii hà chab ne ruii phro, chiih-è isug shii ne khuchunde anyia pha bai hà fen muii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Bajo gai pha lumuii è rek srane Jon branthek shii Mua Wie ji yao, chiih-è ithek shii awaithek lumuii è lai bo ne khung ne yao. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19,20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mth 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mrg 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char></note> Ji shii Jon è Herod badri shii giung, nyieliieshii ai è ikhuii ro yiy Herodia shii yie, chiih-è gai awie pha bliathek bajo rek. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Ji-è Herod ne din de buii rek ne Jon shii phatheg hà chab muii.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è khowo yie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mth 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mrg 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Zab pha branthek Khowo yie ched pha idoh shii, Isu è de Khowo yie. Chiih-è ai siaramuii shii, Hamangkhung de hong ruii, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Igo 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Chng 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Aij 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mth 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrg 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Lug 9:35</ref></char></note> Chiih-è Ragung So de thazam ai siu lakhung shii pha ro duiine wuii thog. Chiih-è Hamangkhung è yao ruii, “Na ne guro miie pha dufuii ro. Chiih-è gu ne na shii sang muii ro.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ro blang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mth 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Isu è awai blia jao pha ishak shii, ai ne dam sa-uom reyjong dun. Ji shii branthek è aishii ne Heli pha dufuii Joseph ro dufuii ro inow bie, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>chiih-è Melchi ne Mathath ro dufuii, chiih-è Mathath ne Lewi ro dufuii, chiih-è Lewi ne Melchi ro dufuii, chiih-è Melchi ne Janai ro dufuii, chiih-è Janai ne Joseph ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>chiih-è Joseph ne Mathathias ro dufuii, chiih-è Mathathias ne Amos ro dufuii, chiih-è Amos ne Nahum ro dufuii, chiih-è Nahum ne Esli ro dufuii, chiih-è Esli ne Nagai ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>chiih-è Nagai ne Math ro dufuii, chiih-è Math ne Mathathias ro dufuii, chiih-è Mathathias ne Semein ro dufuii, chiih-è Semein ne Josekh ro dufuii, chiih-è Josekh ne Joda ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>chiih-è Hoda ne Jaonan ro dufuii, chiih-è Jaonan Reso ro dufuii, chiih-è Reso ne Zerubabel ro dufuii, chiih-è Zerubabel ne Shealthiel ro dufuii, chiih-è Shealthiel ne Neri ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>chiih-è Neru ne Melkhi ro dufuii, chiih-è Neru ne Adi ro dufuii, chiih-è Adi ne Khosam ro dufuii, chiih-è Khosam ne Elmadam ro dufuii, chiih-è Elmadam ne Er ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>chiih-è Er ne Joshua ro dufuii, chiih-è Jousua ne Eliezer ro dufuii, chiih-è Eliezer ne Jorim dufuii, chiih-è Jorim Mathath dufuii, chiih-è Mathath ne Lewi dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>chiih-è Lewi ne Simeon ro dufuii, chiih-è Simeon ne Juda ro dufuii, chiih-è Juda ne Joseph ro dufuii, chiih-è Joseph ne Jonam ro dufuii, chiih-è Jonam ne Eliakhim ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>chiih-è Eliakhim ne Malea ro dufuii, chiih-è Malea ne Mena ro dufuii, chiih-è Mena ne Mathatha ro dufuii, chiih-è Mathatha ne Nathan ro dufuii, chiih-è Nathan Dawid ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>chiih-è Dawid ne Jese ro dufuii, chiih-è Jese ne Obed ro dufuii, chiih-è Obed ne Boaz ro dufuii chiih-è Boaz ne Salmon ro dufuii, chiih-è Salmon ne Nohshon ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>chiih-è Nahshon ne Aminadab ro dufuii, chiih-è Aminadab ne Admin ro dufuii, chiih-è Admin ne Arni ro dufuii, chiih-è Arni ne Hezron ro dufuii, chiih-è Hezron ne Pherez ro dufuii, chiih-è Pherez ne Juda ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>chiih-è Judah ne Jakhob ro dufuii, chiih-è Jakhob ne Isakh ro dufuii, chiih-è Isakh ne Abraham ro dufuii, chiih-è Abraham ro dufuii, chiih-è Therah ro dufuii, chiih-è Nahor ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>chiih-è Serug ro dufuii, chiih-è Serug ne Reu ro dufuii, chiih-è Reu ne Pheleg ro dufuii, chiih-è Pheleg ne Eber ro dufuii, chiih-è Eber ne Shelah ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>chiih-è Shelah ne Khainan ro dufuii, chiih-è Khainan ne Arphazad ro dufuii, chiih-è Arphazad ne Shem ro dufuii, chiih-è Shem ne Naoh ro dufuii, chiih-è Naoh ne Lamekh ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>chiih-è Lamekh ne Methuselah ro dufuii, chiih-è Methuselah ne Enokh ro dufuii, chiih-e Enokh ne Jared ro dufuii, chiih-è Jared ne Mahalalel ro dufuii, chiih-è Mahalalel ne Khenan ro dufuii, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>chiih-è Khenan ne Enosh ro dufuii, chiih-è Enosh ne Seth ro dufuii, chiih-è Seth ne Adam ro dufuii, chiih-è Adam ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro dufuii.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Isu shii chuajan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mth 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mrg 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Isu Jordan è idoh dun ramuii shii Ragung So è ley srane Ragung è aishii balimuang, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>hà now ne inai sawi thog pha Ibuii è aishii bajo chuajan phi. Ji pha ishak shii ai nyie de achie dang, jijong mage shii, ai de chi-iy iy.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Ibuii è aishii yao, “Na Hamangkhung-aphuii pha dufuii chak arone, hì pha lubao shii yung ne iweb rey yi mage bo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Iphy 8:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isu è chang, “Jigigam shii izey ro, ‘Bran ne iweb ji è sieng ne arai bie phro.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Ji pha idoh shii de ibuii è aishii lakhung hà noh srane din pha zab sohjambling khoh pha ji riig yi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Ibuii è aishii yao, “Gu na shii hì thek pha zab blu nane zab nuruii na shii phi ruii phro, hì zab ne ithek è gu wad shii phijong ro, chiih-è hanyie shii gua ne ruii pha ji shii nyaphi mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Na è gu shii sia arone hì thek zab ne naro rey phro.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Iphy 6:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Isu è aishii chang, “Jigigam shii è yao ro, ‘Nawairo Ithong Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sia bie bo chiih-è airo blia rek bie bo!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Ji pha idoh è de ibuii è Isu shii Jerusalem pha Misiahò zab è lakhung pha ithua hà riu yi srane, aishii yao, “Na Hamangkhung-aphuii pha dufuii chak arone ichiih-è buzam nawai è lung mage bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10,11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Chng 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></note>Jigigam shii è yao ro, Hamangkhung-aphuii è awai hamangkhliie yung srane na shii gayiig rek phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Hì de yao, ‘Ithek è na shii awaithek wad è khoh srane na lai de labao rangde akhiia yi phro.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Iphy 6:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Isu è chang, “Jigigam shii yao ro, ‘Nawai Ithong Hamangkhung-aphuii shii achai rabo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Ibuii è Isu shii chuajan phi ched ne, ishak ìujia thog pha aishii thoh ne dun dun.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Galili shii awai blia jao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mth 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mrg 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Ji pha idoh Isu ne Galili hà idoh dun din, chiih-è Ragung So pha blu de ai rog shii um. Ai mua ji ne ji pha soh hà zab yoi dun. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Ai è Jewthek misiahòthek hà de yua, chiih-è zab pha bran è de aishii laso phi.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazareth hà Isu shii snai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mth 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mrg 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Ji è Isu ne awai giak ne sieng pha Nazareth hà wuii dun, idang duiine Jewish Thung pha Inai shii ai de Jewthek misiahò hà wuii dun. Ai è riu srane jigigam ji tham, <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Chiih-è ai wad shii chaig Aijaya jigigam ji phi, ai è jigigam ji hong shii hì izey pha ji doh ruii,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18,19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Aij 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“Ithong Ragung ne gu lakhung shii um ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">nyieliieshii ai è dusho shii mua wie yua yi pha gu shii gua ro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Gu shii ne phatheg hà chab ne um pho shii de khia yi pha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">chiih-è miegthi pho shii doh din yi pha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">chiih-è bajo diigkhui muii pho shii de yong ne noh pha yao pha thoh ge ro.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Chiih-è Ithong è awai branthek shii ragia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">rek pha ishak thog sha ro è yao pha thoh ge ro.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Isu è siog ji nim srane, ilkhi rek muii pha wad shii idoh phi srane dug din, Jewthek misiahò zab branthek ne aishii athodang pha riig ne rai, <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Ji è ai è ithek shii yao, “Sudoh ichiih tham pha jigigam itho ji ne ithek yoi pha chiang è zab izai rey ge ro.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ithek è ai è yao pha miyaogam wie ji wie nuii ne wiengphleg dun. Ithek è yao, “Ai ne Joseph ro dufuii asi bey?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Ai è ithek shii yao, “Gune izai thieg chak ro, nathek ne hì pha najang yao pha ji ne gu shii yao phro, ‘Ma pha bran na nawai shii gang phi riig bo.’ Nathek è Khaphernaum hà rek pha yoi pha ji duiine ichiih gui hò thiig shii de rek yi pha yao phro.” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jon 4:44</ref></char></note> Isu è ithek shii yao din, “Gu nathek shii hì yao, chaig shii ne awai hò nane thiig shii wie aho ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Saj 17:1</ref></char></note>Gu shii yoi mage bo, hì ne chaigthek ro Elija sieng pha ishak shii Israel hà misiung bajo um, ji pha ishak shii haphie aphie pha idam uom è khuyo thog dang pha zab soh shii diigchiao thog. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1Saj 17:8-16</ref></char></note>Jishii Elija ne Israel hà hanyie shii de athoh ge ro, jishii Sidon pha soh Zarephath hà rai pha misiung shii thoh bi ge. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2Saj 5:1-14</ref></char></note>Chiih-è Elija chaig pha ishak shii de Israel hà rai pha branthek de thiig ne awie dang pha hìa è rad pha thiisa hà bajo um; jimagunde zab pha bran ne wie arey, jishii Syrian pha Naman jia miwie bie ro.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Misiahò shii branthek è ji è yao pha ji yoi srane bajo lijieg dun. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Chiih-è ithek jai fad srane Isu shii reng ne fuang thawun hà noh srane, awaithek thiig rab pha phiingduii giu hà noh dun. Ithek è ji pha phiingduii è buzam reng pha rek, <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Ai è bran ibrog duchoi è lua srane awai lumuii hà dun marui.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bran jia shii ibuii ragung um</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mrg 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Ji-è Isu Khaphernaum pha thiig Galili hà wuii dun, thiisa hà Jewish Thung pha Inai shii ai è branthek shii yua. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mth 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note> Ithek ai muyua ji nuii srane wiengphleg dun, nyieliieshii ai ne bajo riichai um ne yao dun. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Misiahò shii awie pha ibuii ragung um pha bran jia um, ai è goh gang è ziak ne yao, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Ah! Na ne gathek shii nyie chid pha um ga, Nazareth pha Isu? Na ichiih shii buii rek pha wuii ne bey? Gu ne thieg na hanyie ga, nane Hamangkhung-aphuii pha So mua yao.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Isu è ragung shii giung, “Aro rabo chiih-è bran ji è fuang khia bo!” Ibuii ji yi ji pha bran shii buzam nyiak hà ai moe shii thud yi srane aishii nyie de buii arekdang pha khia ne dun dun.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Branthek ne zab wiengphleg srane awaithek chung yao rai, “Hì ne khi-èrek pha miyaogamthek lei? Riichai nane blu um ne hì pha bran è awie pha ragung shii giung, chiih-è ithek de fuang khia dun!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Chiih-è Isu ro mua ji ne zab ji pha thiig hà yoidun.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è bajo branthek shii gang phi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mth 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mrg 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Isu è Jewthek misiahò ji thoh marui srane Simon hò hà wuii dun. Simon ro khiing ne bajo hakhangzia ne rad ji è ithek è Isu shii ji pha hò-amuii chiang yao iang. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Ai è wuii srane hò-amuii biang moe shii riu ne hakhang jishii khia bo è giung. Ji-è giung shii hakhangzia pha ji de hò-amuii è khia dun, chiih-è ai khthiie sieng srane ithek shii chie niing pha rab phi.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Hasiang yem ched shii ijakthek è ichua ichua pha miiriie um pha ijakthek shii Isu moe hà noh thog ruii, Ai è zab shii wad ruii srane ithek shii gang phi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Ji-è rek mage shii bajo ibuiithek de bran è khia srane ziak ne yao, “Na ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro dufuii chak ro!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Isu è ibuiithek shii giung ne, ayaodang yi, nyieliieshii ithek ne thieg Isu ne Masi chak ro.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Jewthek misiahò shii yua </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mrg 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Hanaithung pha ishak shii Isu è thiig thoh ne liijiing ithua hà wuii dun. Branthek è jao ne aishii sow, chiih-è ithek è aishii doh mage shii, branthek è aishii ithek è thoh ne adun yi pha bidiang. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Ji shii ai è ithek shii yao, “Gu ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha Mua Wie ji ne gai bajaraithek hà de yao chid phro, nyieliieshii gu shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è ji è rek pha thoh ge ro.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Ji-è ai ne ji pha soh Jewish misiahò shii wuii ne yua.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Isu è igobi shii ho pha samoythek </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mth 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mrg 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mth 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mrg 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char>
    </note> Nai jia Isu yi Genesareth pha khabang ring shii riu ramuii shii branthek è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro miyaogam nuii pha ai moe shii zab reng ne wuii thog. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Ai è run nyi yi kho ring pha lakhung shii yie ne ruii pha doh; jishii ù ua pho è jithek thoh marui ne chiugthek bsang ramuii shii, <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Isu è Simon ro run lakhung shii khurog srane, aishii yao, run jishii kho ring ji è thithe hà nyong yi pha yao. Isu è run iliing shii dug srane bran ibrogthek shii yua.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Ai è yao ched mage shii, ai è Simon shii yao, “Naro run thithe khajam hà yie srane, chiih-è na nane naro ijak yi naro chiug è ù zum pha mua mage bo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:3">Jon 21:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Simon è chang, “Masdo, gathek è zab habiu chiug mua shii, jia de azum mua ro. Ji shii na è yao muii arone, gu è chiug nyamuii riig.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Jon 21:6</ref></char></note> Ithek è chiug mua mage shii, ù yi bajo phieng srane chiug de ji pha rek dun. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Ji è ithek gai pha run hà awaithek ijakthek shii wuii ne ithek shii nong gieng bo è leb ne ho. Ithek è wuii srane run nyi shii ù ley chab ched shii run yi kho iliing hà zem pha rek. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simon Phithar è nyie rey pha ji riig srane, Isu lagiung moe shii bam srane yao, “Ithong, Na gu moe è dun bo! Gu ne bajo layog bran ro!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Awaithek muzum pha ù ji è ai nane ai rog pha branthek ne zab wiengphleg dun. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Ji duiine Simon ro ijak Jems nane Zebedi pha dufuii Jon de wiengphleg dun. Isu è Simon shii yao, “Arum chid rabo; sudoh è thiwing nane branthek shii zum ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Ithek è run shii kho ring lakhung hà yie ne, zab manathek thoh marui ne, Isu rog shii luagieng.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è bran shii gang phi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mth 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrg 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Luang jia Isu yi gai pha thiig hà rairamuii shii, thiichiih shii buii saduii rek ne rad pha bran de jia um. Ai è Isu shii doh mage ne, awailum ne buzam bam srane Isu shii khung ne yao, “Masdo, na è rek yang arone, na è gu shii so nyarek mua phi phro!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">gu shii so rab bo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hì pha miiriie è ne branthek shii zia rab ruii phro.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Isu è awai wad phia srane, chiih-è aishii khoh srane. Chang, “Gu è rek pha now ro. So rey dun bo!” Ji è yaodang pha ji shii Miiriie ji de bran è thoh dun. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:1-32">Lug 14:1-32</ref></char></note> Isu è aishii yao, “Hì pha miyao yi hanyie shii de ayao rabo, jimagunde phabi shii miang wuii ne nawai shii doh yi bo, chiih-è zab pha moe shii wie ge rone doh yi bo, chiih-è Moses muyung pha duiine mizid zid phi bo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Ji shii din è de Isu ro mua ji ne lahuak bajo yoi khlei dun, chiih-è bran ibrogthek aishii nuii pha nane miiriiethek gang yi pha aishii wuii thog ruii. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Ji shii ai ne liijiing um pha ithua hà sia pha dun dun.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è slemriie bran shii gang phi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mth 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mrg 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Nai jia Isu yua ramuii shii, Galili, Judea chiih-è Jerusalem pha thiigthek è wuii pha Pharisithek nane Iphey yua pha masdothek de thiichiih shii dug gieng. Radphothek shii gang rek phi pha Ithong pha blu ne Isu shii um gieng. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Giak branthek è slem è riie pha bran jia shii lawiao rog shii han ne wuii thog ruii, chiih-è ithek è bidiang ne hò bucho hà noh ne Isu ibi shii ruii pha rek. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Jimagunde bran bajo um pha ji è, lumuii amua phi ne ithek è aishii Isu moe shii noh ne awuii mua, ji è ithek zak lakhung hà noh srane saphai hong ne, awai lawiao rog shii buzam bran ibrog um pha duchoi Isu ibi shii ziin phi. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Isu è ithek shii bajo migi um pha ji doh mage ne, ai è bran jishii yao, gu ijak “Naro layog ne khungjong phi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Ji è yao pha ji nuii srane Iphey yao pha masdo nane Pharisithek awaithek chung yao rai, “Makhak-riing yao pha bran hì ne hanyie ga? Layog khung phi pha ne Hamangkhung-aphuii jia bie ro!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Isu è ithek munow jithek thieg srane ithek shii yao, “Nathek ne hì nyie rek ne now phlei? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Hì è rek ne yao pha ji ne wie ba bey? Na layogthek ne khungjong phi ro è yao pha ji wie ba asi pha nawai lawiao chiing ne jai ne lua mage bo è yao pha ji wie bey? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Gu ne nathek shii Bran Dufuii ne sohnyiak shii layog khung phi pha riichai um pha doh yi.” Ji è ai ne slemriie pha bran jishii yao, “Gu na shii yao, jai srane, nawai lawiao chiing ne hò hà dun shabo!” <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Ji pha bran è zab pha bran moe è khthiie jaifad srane, thiichiih wiao pha lawiao yie ne awai hò hà dun srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Thiichiih um pha branthek zab wiengphleg ne rum ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi ne yao, “Sudoh gathek ne khuchung de adoh ba pha blia de doh ge ro!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Lewi shii ho </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mth 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mrg 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Ji pha idoh, Isu fuang hà wuii dun shii, mijin than pha Lewi beng pha jia yi awai ophis shii dug ne rai pha doh. Isu è aishii yao, “Gu rog shii luagieng bo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lewi è jaifad srane, zab thoh marui ne, ai rog shii luagieng.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Ji pha ido Lewi è Isu shii chie noh pha ai hò shii michie boh jia saro, chiih-è ji pha biwenthek ne bajo mijin thanphothek nane Gaibranthek ro, <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Lug 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char></note> giak Pharisithek nane ithek ro Iphey yua pho masdothek è, Isu ro samoythek shii yao, “Nathek ne mijin thanphothek rog nane gai riingthek rog shii nyie rek ne chie niing phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Isu è ithek shii chang, “Bran hanyie arad arone ma pho achid phro, jimagunde hanyie rad pho ne ma pho chid phro. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Gu ne ichiih shii ilab um pha branthek shii ho pha awuii ro, jimagunde layogthek shii ho pha wuii phro!”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minyie pha chiang shii musai sai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mth 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrg 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Giak branthek è Isu shii yao, “Jon ro samoythek ne blebbleb minyie nyie ne sia phi, chiih-è Pharisithek ro samoythek de ji duiine rek, jishii naro samoythek ne chie niing ne rai.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Isu è chang, “Phiyiy pha bufuii nya um ba shii ne biwenthek shii michie achie yi pha dun ge pha ji wie nabey? Ji ne awie phro! <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Ji shii doh jia ne ji è rek pha inai thog ruii phro phie pha bufuii ne noh dun phro, ji pha ido è, ithek ne minyie nyie ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Isu è ithek shii hì pha najang de yao, hanyie magunde yung wo è ithileg ji srane yung ihèg shii miak ne aphiog phro, ai ji è rek arone, airo yung wo ji ne ji dun phro, chiih-è iwo nane ihèg ji a-ò rai phro. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Hanyie è de jariie ihèg shii phuii nyu giog ne achab phro, nyieliiene phuii nyu ji muna rey mage shii ji pha jariie ne chui srane phuii ne zab noi dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Ji-è phuii nyu ne jariie iwo shii chab chid phro. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Chiih-è phuii weg ji niing pha idoh shii ne hanyie de phuii nyu ji aniing yang phro. Ai ne yao phro, iweg ji ne wie ba ro.<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jewish Thung pha inai pha musai sai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mth 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mrg 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Iphy 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jewish Thung pha Inai shii Isu yi phiug raig è dong srane luaramuii shii. Airo samoy pho è raig pha iwoi ji pho srane wad shii nan ne chie. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Giak Pharisithek è sai, ithek ne Iphey shii arek rabo ne zen pha duiine Jewish Thung pha Inai shii hì thek ne nyie rek phlei?<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1">1Sam 21:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isu è ithek shii chang, “Nathek ne Dawid nane ai branthek chi-iyiy mage shii nyie rek pha ji atham ba bey? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lew 24:9</ref></char></note> Ai è Hamangkhung-aphuii hò hà wuii srane, Hamangkhung-aphuii shii zud pha iweb ji yie srane chie, chiih-è awai bran shii de phi ne chie yi. Thiichiih shii zud pha iweb ne phabi michie mua bie ro, gai hanyie è ji chie pha ne Iphey shii chun pha rek phro.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Chiih-è Isu ne iidohhè yao, “Bran Dufuii ne Jewish Thung pha Inai pha Ithong ro.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wad shii slemriie pha bran jia </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mth 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mrg 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Dinpha Jewish Thung pha Inai shii Isu Jewthek misiahò hà wuii srane ithek shii yua. Thiisa hà wad phazoy shii slemriie pha bran de jia um. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Giak Iphey yua pha masdothek nane giak Pharisithek ne Isu è chun pha blia rek muii rone nin yang mage ne Jewish Thung pha Inai shii gang phi bey ne wie riig ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Ji shii Isu è ithek munow jithek thieg mage ne bran jishii yao, “Jai srane ibi hà wuii mage bo.” Ji pha bran ji è jai srane thiichiih shii riu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Chiihphado Isu è aishii yao, “Gu na shii sai, Jewish Thung pha Inai gethek Iphey shii nyie rek pha zen ga? Nong phi pha ji bey? Asi pha chun phi ji bey? Bran shii ragia rek phi pha ji bey? Asi pha chun phi pha ji bey?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Ai è ithek shii zab shan ne riig srane ji pha bran shii yao,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yao; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lijieg ne yao.</char></note> “Naro wad phia mage bo.” Ai è ji è rek, chiih-è ai wad de wie rey dun.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Ithek ne ji riig srane bajo lijieg ne Isu shii nyie rek sha pha fuang hà dun ne awaithek chung nung rai.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è snanyi shii guaphasamoy gua </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mth 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mrg 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ji pha ishak shii Isu yi phiingduii hà sia pha wuii ne thiisa hà ji pha habiu zab Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sia ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Hanai rey mage shii ai è awai samoythek shii awai moe hà ho srane snanyi shii gua, ai è ithek shii guaphasamoythek ro è beng ne ruii: <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>ithek ne Simon (hanyie shii ai è Phithar ro è de beng) chiih-è ikhuii Andrew shii; Jems nane Jon, Philiph nane Bartholomew, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Methiu nane Thomas, Alphayus pha dufuii Jems, chiih-è Simon (hanyie shii thiig moe pha bran rone ho muii pha ji), <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Jems pha dufuii Judas, chiih-è Judas Iskharioth hanyie è khlam rek pha ji thek ro.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è yua ne gang phi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mth 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Isu yi awairo guaphasamoythek rog phiing è thazam dun thog shii, ai yi ilieg pha ithua shii samoythek ibrog rog shii awairo boh pha samoythek rog shii riu, ji pha branthek ne Judea pho chiih-è Jerusalem pho chiih-è Thaire nane Sidon pha khamuii ring pha rajan phothek ro; <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>ithek ne airo miyao yoi pha chiih-è awaithek ro miiriie ji wie rek yi pha wuii phro. Chiih-è ibuii ragung è diig phi phothek de thiichiih wuii ne gang dun. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Zab pha branthek è aishii khoh pha bidiang, nyieliieshii ai blu fuang khia ne ithek shii gang rek yi pha rek.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sang nane duhug </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mth 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Isu è awai samoythek shii riig srane yao pha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Dusho nathek shii sang um ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ne nathek ro ro!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Sang bo nathek ne thiih shii chi-iyiy pho ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Nathek shii ley phi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Nathek thiih shii cho pho ne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Nathek ne siak ruii phro!<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Phth 4:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nyieliieshii Bran Dufuii chiang è nathek shii bran è amiie ruii arone, chiih-è nathek shii snai ruii arone, chiih-è nathek shii makhakriing rek ruii arone, chiih-è nathek shii awie rone yao ruii arone ithek ne sang mage bo! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Phal 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Blk 7:52</ref></char></note> Lised boh ji rey mage shii, lubo ji shii siu bo, nyieliieshii Hamangkhung hà boh lasen ne na shii ruii phi ro. Ithek blang è chaigthek shii de ji duiine rek ro.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Jishii thiih shii bukho shak pho ne khama thiig rey ruii phro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">nawaithek wie sieng pha ne siengjong ro!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Thiih ley um pho nathek shii ne khama thiig rey ruii phro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Nathek ne chi-iyiy ruii phro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">“Thiih shii siak pho nathek ne khama diig phro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Nathek ne duhug rek ne choh ruii phro!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Thiih shii branthek è nathek shii wie yao ruii arone khama thiig ruii phro; ithek ro blangthek de ji duiine khlam pha chaigpho miyao chiang è yao ruii.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suangthek shii miie bo </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mth 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mth 7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Jishii gu miyao nuii pho ithek shii yao phro: nawai shuangthek shii miie mage bo, na shii awie pha rek pho shii wie rek mage bo, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Hanyie è ithek shii muchocho arone, ithek shii khirzey phi bo, chiih-è hanyie è nathek shii gidieg rek arone ithek chiang sia phi bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Chiih-è hanyie magunde na mizia jia shii phey arone, dinne de naro yoh pha mizia hà de choi bo; chiih-è naro rugud gaithek yie dun arone naro phadiig de yie yi bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Hanyie è na shii nyie lia magunde aishii phi bo, chiih-è hanyie è naro nyie yie dun magunde idoh phi pha alia rabo. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mth 7:12</ref></char></note> Na è gaithek shii nawai shii khi-èrek yi pha now pha duiine ithek shii de ji rek phi bo.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Nathek shii hanyie è miie jishii nathek è miie bie arone? Khi-èrek ne nathek shii khirzey mua mage phlei? Layog phothek rang de ithek shii miie pho shii ne ithek de miie phi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Chiih-è hanyie nathek è ithek shii wie rek jishii wie rek bie arone, nathek ne khi-èrek ne khirzey mua mage phlei? Jine layogphothek rang de rek! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Chiih-è ithek hanyie è idoh mua pha luthong ne jishii chei bie phi arone, khi-èrek ne khirzey mua mage phlei? Nyieliieshii layog pho rang de layog phothek shii chei ne idoh yi din! <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Asi! Nawaithek mak shii miie bo chiih-è ithek shii wie rek bo; chei phi srane, idoh mua pha aluthong rabo. Chiihphado nathek shii ne boh lasen um ruii phro, chiih-è nathek ne bajo giu pha Hamangkhung-aphuii pha dufuii rey ruii phro. Ai ne laso aphi pho shii nane layog phothek lakhung shii wie phro. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Nawaithek Aphuii è bushun rek pha duiine bajo bushun rek bo.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gai shii chua </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-15">Mth 7:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Gaithek shii achua rabo, ji arone Hamangkhung-aphuii è de nathek shii de achua phro, chiih-è khi shii athe rabo, ji arone nathek shii de Hamangkhung-aphuii è athe ruii phro; gai shii khung phi bo, ji arone Hamangkhung-aphuii è na shii de khung phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Gai shii phi bo, ji arone Hamangkhung-aphuii è na shii de phi ruii phro. Hì ne izai chak ro, na shii ne briie ley pha mua ruii phro, na è nyakhoh mua ne khuchung de amuii ba pha nong ji ne na laluii shii thoi ruii phro, na è gai shii chua pha briie ji è, Hamangkhung-aphuii è na shii de chua ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mth 15:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isu è ithek shii hì pha najang è yao: “Miegthipho è miegthi shii noh ne alua mua phro; ai è noh ne lua magunde nyimanyi nyahiung hà chiih dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mth 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jon 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note> Samoythek ne masdo è boh asi ro, jishii samoythek è zab dab ched mage ne, masdo duiine nyarey mua phro.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Na nawai mieg shii iphen han srane, nawai khuii ro iphen ji riig ne nyie rek ne yao phlei? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Nawai iphen aphan bi pha nyie khi-èrek ne nawai khuiinothek shii yao phiilei? Gu khuiinothek wo! Na mieg shii iphen um pha ji ne gu shii phan yi bo. Lawasdai nathek! Igobi nane nawai mieg pha iphen ji phan bi bo, chiih-è na ne wie riig mua srane, nawai khuiinothek ro mieg iphen de wie doh ne nyaphan mua phi phro.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hingmuii nane iwoi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mth 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Hingmuii wie ne awie pha iwoi awoi phro, ji duiine hingmuii awie pha è de iwoi wie awoi phro. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mth 12:33</ref></char></note> Zab pha hingmuii ne iwoi woi ruii pha ji è thieg ruii phro; na ne khuchung magunde migem biing è iphem apho phro, chiih-è khuchung magunde migem biing è angur awoi phro. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mth 12:34</ref></char></note> Bran wie ne lubu liing hà de wie khrab ne fuang hà dun ne wie khia ruii phro; bran awie pho ne lubu liing hà awie pha khrab ne fuang hà de awie pha khia ruii phro. Ji-è lubu hà nyie now lei ne sem hà è de ji yao ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hò rung pho nyi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mth 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Gu è nyie yao pha ji ne thuh de arek ba pha rek srane, nathek gu shii ‘Ithong’ Ithong ro è yao ne nyie rek pha ho phlei? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Hanyie è gu shii wuii srane gu miyaogamthek nuii ne lubu hà ruii arone ai ne hanyie ga gu nathek shii doh yi phro. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Ai ne hanyie è sak shii icho chog ne awai hò rung pha sarong zieg pha duiine ro, khamuii è khed ne jao magunde ji pha hò ne asid phro, nyieliieshii hì ne chuh rung dun. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Jishii hanyie è gu miyaogamthek nuii srane jishii alua pho ne hanyie è awai hò rung shii sarong wie azieg pha rung pha duiine ro; khokhed ne ji pha hò shii jao mage shii hò ji ne jog chuak dun, ji è chuak mage ne zab è de awiedang pha chuakbraig dun.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Isu è Roman dumuii ro khiao shii gang phi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-15">Mth 8:5-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Isu è branthek shii jithek zab yao ched maruii shii, awai ne Khaphernaum hà wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Roman dumuii è bajo bushun rek pha airo khiao jia um; ji pha bran ye rad ne iy sha pha rek. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Dumuii è Isu ro mua ji yoi mage ne, ai è Jewish dukhothek shii ai khiao jishii gang phi pha ho pha thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Ithek è Isu shii wuii srane wie khung ne yao, “Ji pha bran ne izai naro nong chid pha um ro. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Ai ne gathek bran shii miie chiih-è ai awai è gathek shii Jewthek misiahò de rung phi phro.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Ji-è Isu de ithek rog shii wuii gieng. Ai ji pha hò è ruang asi ba shii dumuii ji awai ijakthek shii thoh ne aishii yao yi, “Masdo, nawai shii diig arek chid rabo, Na gu hò shii wuii mua pha ne gu shii ne chua oi ro. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ji è gu de na shii wuii mua sapho asi ro, nane yao bie mage bo, ji arone guro khiao ji ne gang dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Gu, è de dumuiithek boh iliing shii pha bran ro, chiih-è gu iliing shii de sandrithek um ro. Gu è jia shii ‘Wuii’ bo è yung arone, ai de wuii dun phro! Chiih-è gai shii, ‘Thawuii!’ bo è yao arone ai de thawuii phro; chiih-è gu gui khiao, ‘Shii hì rek!’ bo è yao arone ai ne rek phi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Isu è ai miyao ji nuii srane wiengphleg ne idoh rei srane ai rog shii lua pha iphiingthek shii yao, “Gu nathek shii yao, hì duiine pha migi ne thiih de adoh ba ro, chiih-è Israel shii magunde adoh ba ro!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Muapho idoh dumuii hò hà dun shii airo khiao yi gang iang pha doh.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è misiungmuii ro dufuii shii hòi din phi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Achiadang pha idoh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">khthiie pha idoh shii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne um</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ji pha inai.</char></note> shii Isu ne samoythek nane bran ibrog dog srane ithek shii gang rek yi ne Nain beng pha thiig hà wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Ai ne thiig pha gak hà nyathog dang shii, ithek bran iy jia han srane fuang hà noh ne wuiiramuii pha doh. Ji pha bran iy yi misiungmuii ro dufuii ji jia ji ro, chiih-è thiig pha bran ibrog de ji pha hò-amuii rog shii wuii gieng. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Ithong è hò-amuii shii ji è rey ramuii pha ji riig srane, ai lubu yi ji pha hò-amuii shii bajo bushun now dun, Ji è ai è hò-amuii shii yao, “Acho rabo.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Chiihphado ai è wuii srane bran iy han pha ji shii khoh mage, ji è han pha branthek de thung dun. Jishii Isu è yao, gu na shii yaodang phro, “Filiao bufuii! Sieng mage bo.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Iyjong pha bran ji è siangfad ne dug srane miyao jao ne yao, chiih-è ji pha bran shii Isu è imuii shii idoh phi din.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Ji è rek pha ji riig srane zab branthek yi rum ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii chiong, “Ithek è yao; gethek duchoi shii chaigphuii boh jia khia thog ro! Hamangkhung-aphuii ne awai bran shii ragia rek pha wuii thog ro!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Hì pha Isu pha mua ji yi zab pha soh pha ithua iring hà de zab yoi dun.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jon khowo re-è muapho thek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-9">Mth 11:2-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Jishii Jon ro samoythek è jithek pha miyao aishii yao ched shii, ai è bijiu nyi shii ho, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Chiih-è Ithong shii sai pha isa shii thoh ge, “Chiih-è Jon è wuiiramuii ro è yao pha ji bey? Asi pha gathek ne gai shii luthong chid habey?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Ai è Isu shii wuii thog mage shii, isa è yao, “Jon Khowo è gathek shii hì è yao ne sai pha thoh ge ro, Na ne Jon è wuiiramuii ro è yao pha ji na bey? Asi pha gathek ne gai shii luthong habey.”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Ji pha ishak shii Isu è branthek ro rad pha, miiriie thek nane awie pha ragungthek shii gang phi, chiih-è miegthi pha branthek shii de doh din yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Aij 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Aij 61:1</ref></char></note> Ai è Jon ro muapho shii chang, “Nasa nyie doh nyie yoi pha ji ne, idoh dun srane ne Jon shii yao bo: Miegthi pho de doh dun ro, chiih-è lai khi-èg lua ge ro, chiih-è hanyie yi awie pha diig rek ne hìa rad pha bran de so<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sang rab: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">riig 5:12</char></note> rab ge ro, chiih-è khohphang pho de yoi ge ro, chiih-è iy pho de hòi dinro, chiih-è Mua Wie ne dushothek shii yao dun ro. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Gu shii khlam rone anow pho ne bajo sang dun ro!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Chiihphado Jon ro muaphothek è thoh marui srane dun din shii, Isu è bran ibrog shii ai chiang ji jao ne yao: “Nathek è balimuang shii Jon hà wuii shii, nyie shii luthong ne wuii phlei? Nathek yi hasam è saing rab yi thenia thania pha ji riig wuii ne bey? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Nathek fuang hà nyie riig pha wuii phlei? Bran yi wie yung guii pha ji riig wuii ne bey? Bran hanyie è ji duiine guii ne sang ne rai pho ne saja hò hà doh ruii phro! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Gu shii yao riig bo, nathek fuang hà wuii srane nyie riig wuii phlei? Chaigthek shii riig wuii ne bey? Ji ne izai chak ro, jimagunde ithek ne chaig è de bajo boh jia doh yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note>Jigigam shii yao pha ji ne Jon ji chak ro, ‘Hamangkhung-aphuii è yao, gu ne gui mua pho shii naro lumuii hong yi pha na ibi thoh ge phro.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Isu è yao,” Gu è nathek shii zai yaodang phro, “Jishii idang rai pha bran è de Jon boh ba ro. Jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua shii ìu um ne de ai ne Jon è de boh ba phro.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29,30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mth 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lug 3:12</ref></char>
    </note> Zab pha branthek è aishii yoi, ithek nane mijin thanphothek dungdang ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro giang nak ne, ithek de Jon ro khowo yie. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Jishii Pharisithek nane Iphey yua pha masdothek è Hamangkhung-aphuii munow pha miyao ji snai srane Jon ro khowo de ayie.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Isu è yao din, “Chiihphado duchung pha branthek shii, khi-èrek ne chua ne yao sha phlei? Ithek ne khi-èrek pha duiine lei? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Ithek ne bajarai pha ithua shii dug ne rai pha aniphiing duiine ro. Gai ibrog è gai shii ziak srane yao, ‘Gathek ne phiyiy pha ben nathek shii khuang phi, jishii nathek è asiu! Gathek è bi-iy ibai bai shii ithek è achoh phi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Jon Khowo phi pha ji wuii thog ne, chiih-è ai ne minyie nyie srane phuii de aniing, chiih-è ithek è yao, ‘Ai iliing shii ne ibuii um ro!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Bran Dufuii yi wuii thog mage ne, chiih-è chie niing shii, ithek è yao, ‘Hì pha bran shii riig bo! Ai ne sugow ne chie niing pha jia ara, chiih-è ai ne mijin than phothek nane layogthek pha ijak ro è yao!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii pha khani è, hanyie è nuii lei ne ji ne izai chak rone doh yi phro.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ne Simon Pharisi hà um</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Pharisi jia è Isu shii ai hò hà michie chie pha ho, ji è Isu yi ji pha Pharisi hò hà wuii srane michie chie sha pha dug. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37,38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mth 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mrg 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jon 12:3</ref></char></note> Ji pha thawun shii layog rek ne sieng pha hò-amuii de jia rai. Ai è Isu ne Pharisithek hò hà michie chieramuii pha yoi, ji è ai ne rem no pha (alabasther) sumaro ley jariie yie ne wuii thog ne, <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Isu idoh shii riu srane, cho ne awai mieg kho è ai lai shii sad phi. Chiihphado è awai khaziang è ai lai shii go rek phi ne, ai lai shii khichiug ne, chiih-è sumaro rek ne aishii shun phi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Pharisithek è ji doh srane, awai shii yao, “Hì pha bran ne izai chaigphuii arone, aishii kho pha hò-amuii ji ne hanyie ga ai ne nyathieg mua phro, chiih-è hì pha hò-amuii yi khi-èrek ne layog è sieng ne rai ji de ai nyathieg mua phro!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Isu gang è aishii yao, “Simon, gu na shii nyie magunde yao pha um ro.” “Simon è chang, Masdo, Yao mage bo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Isu è jao ne yao, “Buyo buyo shii bran nyi è bang chei pho è bang chei phi, jia è aishii liiman pha sikhi wieng guii chei, chiih-è bran yoh jia ji è saguii chei. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Jishii isa è hanyie de idoh arang mua, jimagunde ai è isa ro muruii shii alia pha thoh muii, ji arone, aishii hanyie è bajo miie ruii phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>“Simon è chang,” “Gu munow arone, hanyie shii bajo bang yi pha um shii idoh alia pha thoh muii pha ji è bajo wie now phro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Isu è yao, “Na miyao ji ne izai chak ro.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Jishii ai è hò-amuii jishii rei srane riig ne Simon shii yao, “Na hì pha hò-amuii shii doh ramuii bey? Gu ne na hò hà wuii shii, na è gu lai sud pha kho de aphi, Jishii ai è awai miegkho è gu lai sud phi srane awai khaziang rek ne sad ne go phi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Na è gu shii ne khichiug srane wie aho ro, jimagunde gu nyawuii thog dang ne ai gu lai shii athodang pha khichiug bamuii ro. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Na è gu khrug shii sumaro yow è ashun phi, jimagunde ai è gu lai shii wie now pha thiiliie è shun phi. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Ji è, gu na shii yao, airo bajo miie pha ji è airo layogthek ne khungjong ge ro è doh yi ro. Jishii layog ìujia khung bie pha ne, airo miie pha de ìujia bie rone doh yi phro.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Chiihphado Isu hò-amuii shii yao, “Na layog khungjong phi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Gaithek thiibliie shii dug pho è awaithek chung yao rai, “Layog shii rang de khung phi pha hì ne hanyie ga?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Jishii Isu è hò-amuii shii yao, “Naro migi è na shii ragia rek ge ro; na ne liijiing è dun bo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Hò-amuiithek yi Isu rog shii nong gieng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Ìujia pha ishak idoh shii Isu è bajarai nane thiig ji hà lua srane, Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha mua wie ji yao. Samoy snanyi de ai rog shii wuii gieng. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2,3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mth 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mrg 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Lug 23:49</ref></char></note> Chiih-è hanyie shii awie pha ragung nane miiriie è wie rek phi pha hò-amuiithek de ai rog shii um: Mery (hanyie shii Magdalene rone ho), aishii è ibuii ragung de miley dukho fuang khia phi pha ji ro; <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Joana, ai igey Chuza yi Herod ophis pha dumuii; chiih-è Susana, chiih-è gai pha hò-amuiithek awaithek miwiang è Isu nane samoypho shii nong phi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iriiejiie pha najang </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mth 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mrg 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Branthek yi thawun nane ji pha idoh gai athodang pha Isu shii wuii; chiih-è branthek yi wuii thog srane bajo iphiing khrab mage shii, Isu è hì pha najang yao:<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Luang jia thiisa hà bran jia um ai yi iriie jiie wuii pha fuang hà wuii dun, ai è iriie yi raig shii jiie marui, giak iriie yi lumuii ring hà chiih dun, ji pha iriie shii ne thum dun, chiih-è fuii è chong ne chie muii. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Chiih-è giak miiriie yi labao surong pha ithua hà chiih dun, chiih-è iphiu sieng thog mage shii goh dun, nyieliieshii nyiak yi liing asi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Giak miiriie yi migem biing hà chiih dun, iphiu ne sieng shii chiih-è aishii lam dun. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Chiih-è giak miiriie yi nyiak wie shii chiih pha ji è; iphiu sieng srane iwoi de wie woi ruii, iwoi jia jia shii wieng thog pha woi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Chiih-è iidohhè Isu è yao, chiihphado, yoi mage bo, nathek shii khohthek um arone.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ithek è najang pha miyaosiu ji sai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mth 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mrg 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Awairo samoythek è Isu shii sai hì pha najang è shan ne yao pha miyaosiu nyie lei? <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Aij 6:9</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Chiih-è ai ithek shii chang, nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Sajathua pha khani ug ne ruii pha ji ne nathek shii phijong ro, chiih-è gaithek shii ne najang è shan ne yao chid phro, nyieliieshii ithek ne riig pha ne riig shii adoh, chiih-è yoi phane yoi shii agao.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è jiie pha najang ji miiriig è yao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mth 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mrg 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Hì pha najang pha miyao ne hì ro: Miiriie ne Hamangkhung pha miyaogam ro. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Miiriie lumuii shii chiih phro è yao pha ji ne hì ro, hanyie è ji ne nuii phane nuii shii; Jimagunde Sakhathong è wuii srane ithek lubu è yie ne dun marui, nyieliieshii migi nane ragia ithek shii arey yi pha rek phro. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Iriie yi sak lakhung shii chiih phro è yao pha ji ne hì ro, hanyie è mua ji yi nuii srane lised ne yie dun. Jishii ithek iliing shii akhud phi; ithek ne ìujia pha migi now bie ne jimagunde thiig pha ishak thog mage shii ithek ne thoh muii. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Iriie yi migem biing hà chiih phro è yao pha ji ne hì ro, hanyie è mua ne nuii, jimagunde diig now pha ji è chiih-è bokho rek pha now pha ji è chiih-è awai shii wie sieng pha now pha ji è aishii ne lam dun ro. Chiih-è ai iwoi ne khuchunde amen mua ro. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Iiriiethek nyiak wie shii chiih pha miyao ji ne hì ro, hanyie thek è mua ji wie nuii ne lubu iliing hà ruii ne, chiih-è ithek iwoi yi awai muspho shii ne zud ne rai.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ichuang pha najang </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mrg 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mth 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lug 11:33</ref></char>
    </note>Hanyie magunde ichuang shii siikhiiakhjam è phieng ne aruii ro, chiih-è biang iliing hà de aruii ro. Jishii ichuang yi iliing wuii pho shii sang doh yi pha bunthruak lakhung hà ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mth 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lug 12:2</ref></char>
    </note> Nyie ug ne ruii magunde fuang hà doh yi phro, chiih-è nyie magunde cheg ne ruii pha ji ne ichuang hà yi ne doh dun phro.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mth 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lug 19:26</ref></char>
    </note> Chiihphado, ithek khi è nuii pha ji ne “Wie gayiig bo; nyieliieshii hanyie shii ìujia um pho shii ne dinne muna phi din ruii phro, jimagunde hanyie shii nyie de oi dang magunde aishii nyie um pha ji de yie muii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ro ikhuiithek nane amuii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mth 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrg 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Isu ro amuii nane ikhuiithek aishii wuii thog, Jishii ithek è Isu rog shii athog mua gieng, nyieliieshii bran iphiing um. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Bijiu jia è Isu shii yao. “Na amuii nane na khuiithek ne na shii riig yang ne sibiang hà riu ne khan muii ro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Isu è ithek zab shii yao, gu amuii nane gu khuiithek ne ji ro, hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii pha miyaogam ji nuii srane rek pha ji ro.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è hasamkhanoi shii them yi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mth 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrg 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Nai jia Isu è awai samoythek rog shii run lakhung hà in srane ithek shii yao, “Cho gethek khabang thrang pha ithua hà wuii sharai haro.” Ji è ithek ne jao ne wuii dun, <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>ithek run bucho hà ba shii, Isu ne men dun hamblo shii hasam gashau jia khed thog ruii, chiih-è run ne kho è jao ne ley ramuii, ji è ithek ne zab bajo diig rey dun. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Samoythek è wuii srane Isu shii chun ne yao, “Masdo, Masdo, gathek ne iy sha pha rek ro!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Isu è sieng srane hasam gashau shii giung mage shii, ithek de chiih them dang dun, chiih-è thiichiih shii liijiing rey dun. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Chiihphado ai è awai samoythek shii yao, “Nathek ro migi ne khiisa lei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Jishii ithek ne wiengphleg ne rum dun, chiih-è awaithek chung yao rai, “Hì pha bran ne hanyie ga? Ai è hasamkhanoi shii de giung mage ne ithek de aishii nuii dang dun!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è ibuii um pha bran jia shii gang phi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mth 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mrg 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Isu nane ai samoythek run è in srane khabang thrang Galili pha soh Gerasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gerasa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gadara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig Mth 8:28); gai ne um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gergesa.</char></note> hà wuii thog. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Isu run è khabang ring hà lung shii, ibuii ragung um pha thawun pha bran jia aishii si, nai bajo è ji pha bran ne yung de aguii pha chiih-è hò hà de arai phi, jimagunde ai ne idang wem muang hà rai. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Ai è Isu shii doh mage shii, goh gang è choh srane ai lai shii awailum ne bam srane ziak ne yao, “Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Bajo Giu pha Dufuii Isu!” Na gu è nyie chid pha um lei? Gu na shii khung ne yao phro, gu shii lago aphi rabo <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Ai è hì yao pha ji ne nyieliieshii Isu è ibuii ragung shii ai bucho è fuang khia mage bo è giung. Aishii ne ibuii ragung è blebbleb thoh dun, chiih-è ai wad nane lai shii shiirnai rek ne joi srane phatheg hà chab ne ruii magunde ai è shiirnai ji biathiak srane ibuii è balimuang hà noh ne dun marui. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Isu è aishii sai, “Na beng nyie ga?” Ai è chang, gu beng ne 'Mob' ", ro, nyieliieshii bajo ibuii yi aishii khuddun. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Ibuiithek ji è Isu shii khung srane yao gathek shii jam nyahiung bucho hà athoh rabo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Jam ihiung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ithek ne hì ìd ibuiithek shii ne iidohhè pha lago pha sohnyiak hà zum ne ruii.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Thiisa phiingduii moe shii wak brog bajo um iang, ji è gathek shii ne Wakthek iliing shii thoh ge bo è yao ne ibuiithek è Isu shii khung ne yao, chiih ithek shii ai è ji hà thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Ithek ji pha bran è khia srane wak brogthek shii khud dun. Zab pha wak brogthek ne phiingduii è buzam ran srane khabang shii wo ne iy dun.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Wak brog shii gayiig rek ne rai pha bran ji è nyie rey pha ji doh srane, ji è ai ne bajarai nane raig shii ran srane jithek pha mua yao mage. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Branthek è nyie rey pha ji riig wuii dun, chiih-è ithek Isu shii wuii thog mage shii, ibuii fuang khia dun pha bran ji yi khani wie rey srane yung guii ne Isu lai moe shii dug ne rai pha doh, chiih-è ithek ne zab rum dun. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Hanyie ji doh pho è branthek shii yao hì pha bran ne khi-èrek ne wie rey ge ara. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Chiihphado ji pha soh pha branthek è Isu shii thiichiih-è dun bo è yao, nyieliieshii ithek ne bajo sham ne rum dun. Ji-è Isu run hà in ne dun din dun. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Ibuii khia dun pha bran ji è khung ne Isu shii yao, “Gu shii de narog wuii noh bo.” Jishii Isu è yung srane aishii thoh ge, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>Idoh dun srane nawai hò hà Hamangkhung-aphuii è na shii nyie rek phi pha ji yao bo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ji pha bran è zab pha thawun hà wuii srane, Isu è aishii nyie rek phi pha ji yao.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jairus ro idimi nane Isu ro rugud khoh pha hò-amuii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mth 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mrg 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Isu khabang ring pha gai ithua shii idoh thog mage ne, branthek aishii wie è ho, nyieliieshii zab ithek ne aishii khan ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Chiihphado è Jairus beng pha bran jia de thiichiih wuii thog; ai ne thiisa pha Jewthek misiahò pha dumuii ro. Ai awailum ne buzam Isu lai shii bam srane aishii khung ne ai hò hà wuii bo è yao, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>nyieliieshii airo idimi dam snanyi rey sha pha ji ne iy pha rek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Isu ai rog shii wuiiramuii shii ai mai pha zab ithua shii bran iphiing khrab thog dun. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Ithek duchoi shii hò-amuii jia yi grab rek ne diig ne rai pha dam snanyi rey sha; ai è awai shii nyie um pha ji zab mahpho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:43: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne hì oi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aishii nyie um pha ji ne mahpho shii phi ched muii.</char></note> shii phi srane wie rey yi pha rek shii, Jishii hanyi è de aishii wie arek mua. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Ai è ibrog shii Isu idoh wuii srane airo rugud jiu shii khoh mage, chiih-è airo grab noi pha ji ne limdang dun. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Isu è ithek shii sai, “Gu shii hanyie mukhoh lei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Zab è yao, gathek ne akhoh ro, chiih-è Phithar è yao, hanyie de akhoh ro, “Masdo, bran ibrog zab ne na shii gung ramuii ro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Jishii Isu è yao, “Hanyie lei jia ne gu shii khoh ro, gu ne thieg, blu ne gu è fuang khia dun ro.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Hò-amuii ji è shii riig shii aishii ne thieg dun, ji è ai ne sham srane wuii ne awailum ne Isu lai shii bam. Ai è nyie rek ne khoh chiih-è khi-èrek ne khthiie wie dun pha ji thiichiih ai ibi shii um phothek moe Isu shii yao. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Isu è hò-amuii jishii yao, “Gu dimi, nawairo migi è na shii wie rek ge ro, liingsed ne dun bo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Isu ji yao ramuii shii, mua yao pha bran jia dumuii hò è wuii thog. Ai è Jairus shii yao, “Naro dimi ne iy dun ro. Masdo shii dinne muna diig aphi chid rabo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Jishii Isu è nuii srane Jairus shii yao, “Arum rabo; migi now bie bo, chiih-è na dimi ne wie rey phro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Ai è hò hà wuii thog mage shii, ai è Phithar, Jon, nane James chiih-è ani ro aphuii amuii shii noh ne iliing hà wuii srane gai hanyie shii ai rog shii awuii noh. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Thiichiih shii um pha branthek è ani chiang shii choh ramuii, Isu è yao, “Achoh rabo, ani ne a-iy ro ai ne men bamuii ro!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Ithek è aishii siak, nyieliieshii ithek ne thieg ai ne iyjong ro. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Jishii Isu è aishii awai wad shii giak srane ho mage, “Sieng mage bo, gu ani!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Ai ro chai ne khid din srane thiichiih shii siangfad mage, chiih-è aishii chie pha nyie magunde phi mage bo è yao ne Isu è ithek shii yung. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Ai ro aphuii amuii ne wiengphleg dun, Jishii Isu è nathek shii yung, ithek shii nyie rey pha ji ne hanyie shii de ayao rabo.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Isu è snanyi samoythek shii thoh ge </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mth 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mrg 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Isu è snanyi samoythek shii ò ho srane ithek shii ibuii shii khia pha nane miiriie shii gang phi pha blu nane riichai phi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Chiihphado ai è ithek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ji yua pha nane radpho shii gang rek pha thoh ge, <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lug 10:4-11</ref></char></note>chiihphado ithek shii yao, “lumuii hà ithek nyie de ayie rabo: Thagieng de ayie, biiathek de ayie, michie de ayie, bang de ayie, chiih-è phadiig lai de ayiedang rabo. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Nathek shii khihà wie ho ruii, ji pha hò shii athoh sapho shii ne ithua jia shii rai bo; <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Blk 13:51</ref></char></note> Khihà magunde branthek è nathek shii wie aho arone, ji pha thawun thoh muii srane nathek lai pha nyiakphlab ji yi kham marui bo, ji ne ithek shii phriie phro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Samoythek è thiichiih shii thoh marui srane thiigthek hà lua ne Mua Wie jithek yao ne zab pha branthek shii gang phi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod ro anomuluii </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mth 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-20">Mrg 6:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7,8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mth 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mrg 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lug 9:19</ref></char>
    </note> Herod yi Galili shii bohkhoh pha ji ro, jithek rey pha ji zab yoi srane wiengphleg dun, nyieliiene giak branthek è yao Jon Khowo ne idoh hòi ne thog ro. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Gaithek è yao shii Elija ne dinne dong ro, chiih-è gaithek è yao buyo pha chaigthek ne idoh hòi ne thog dinro. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Herod è yao, “Jon ro khrug ne gu è tham sbang yi phro; jimagunde hì è yoi ramuii pha bran ji ne hanyie ga?” Chiih-è ai ne Isu shii riig pha bidiang.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è bran itham guii shii chie yi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mth 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrg 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jon 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Guaphasamoythek è idoh dun thog srane ithek è nyie rek marui pha ji zab Isu shii yao. Ai è ithek shii awai rog noh srane Bethsaida pha thawun shii wuii thog.<verse eid="LUK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Ibrogthek è ji yoi srane ithek de ai rog shii luagieng. Ai è ithek shii wie ho srane, Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ji yao srane hanyie è chid pho shii gang phi.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Hasieng yi jao ne yem sha pha rek shii, airo snanyi Samoythek è aishii wuii srane yao, “Branthek shii thoh ge bo, nyieliieshii ithek ne nyawuii mua ne thiigthek nane raigthek shii shan ne michie nane men pha ithua nya doh mua phro, nyieliieshii hì pha ithua ne hanyie de oi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Jishii Isu è ithek shii yao, “Nawaithek è ithek shii chie pha phi bo.” Ithek è chang, “Gathek zab shii ne iweb guii nane ù nyi um bie ro, na è gathek shii hì pha ibrogthek zab pha michie pheg wuii bo è now bey?”<verse eid="LUK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>(Thiichiih shii ne itham guii thog pha bran um.) Isu è awai samoythek shii yao, “ithek shii ibrog jia jia shii saguii rek ne dug yi bo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Chiihphado shii samoythek è ji è rek phi, <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Isu è iweb guii nane ù nyi shii yi srane, Hamangkhung hà riig ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi srane phed, chiih-è awai samoythek shii phi ne branthek shii thang ba yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Ithek zab cho pha chie ched mage shii, chiih-è nyie khe pha ji ne samoythek è sirid snanyi chiing.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phithar è Isu shii izai chak rog è yaothiak </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mth 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mrg 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Nai jia Isu è awai ji siaramuii shii, samoythek aishii wuii thog ruii. Isu è ithek shii sai, “Branthek è gu shii hanyie ro è yao lei?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mth 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mrg 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Lug 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note> Ithek è chang. “Giak branthek è na shii ne Jon Khowo ro è yao.” Giak è na shii ne Elija ro è yao, “Giak è na shii ne buyo pha chaig jia ne hòi ne thog din ro è yao.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jon 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note> Isu è ithek shii sai. “Chiihphado nathek ne gu shii hanyie ro è now ga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Phithar è chang, “Na ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Masi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è awairo diig nane iy pha chiang ji yao </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mth 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Mrg 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Chiihphado Isu è ithek shii phriie ne giung srane yao, hì pha miyao ne hanyie shii de ayaodang rabo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Ai è de ithek shii yao, “Bran Dufuii ne bajo diig rek srane dukhothek, boh phabithek nane Iphey yua pha masdothek è de snai muii phro. Aishii ne ua muii phro, jimagunde ai ne da-uom pha idoh shii ne hòi din ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mth 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lug 14:27</ref></char>
    </note> Chiih-è ai zabithek shii yao, hanyie de gu rog shii wuii pha now arone, ai ne awai shii bia chid phro, chiih-è zab pha inai shii awairo bai ji han srane gu rog shii luagieng bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mth 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lug 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jon 12:25</ref></char></note> Hanyie è nawai sieng pha ji shii ragia rek pha now arone awairo chai ne san dun phro, jimagunde de hanyie è gu chiang è awai shii san muii arone ai ne ragia rey ruii. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Ai è sohjambling shii mua srane awai shii san muii arone nyie phua mage phlei? Khuchung magunde arey phro. <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Bran hanyie yi gu shii wo srane gu miyao wo arone, Bran Dufuii de awairo biisiie è wuii ruii shii chiih-è Aphuii pha biisiie nane so hamangkhliiethek pha boh lubo è wuii ruii shii aishii de wo ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Gu nathek shii izai yaodang phro, ichiih um pha giak branthek de Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ji adoh sapho shii ne a-iy ba phro.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ro siu lai dun </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mth 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mrg 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2Phth 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note> Damiley pha idoh shii ai è jithek yao, Isu è Phithar, nane Jon, chiih-è Jems shii ai è noh srane phiingduii lakhung hà sia pha wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Ai yi siaramuii shii, ai mizia ne yoh lai khlei dun, chiih-è airo yung de khlieng mo chuang dun. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Hamblo shii bran nyi yi ai rog shii mulo pha doh. Ai ne Moses nane Elija ro. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Hamangkhung pha biisiie è doh yi srane ai ne Jerusalem hà iy ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro munow ji zab rek pha Isu shii muloramuii. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Phithar nane ai ijakthek yi men dun jimagunde ithek siangfad srane Isu shii riig shii biisiie nane bran nyi yi ai rog shii riu ne um pha doh. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Bran nyi ji è Isu shii thoh marui ne dun din dun shii, Phithar è aishii yao, “Masdo, Gethek ichiih shii um pha ji ne khama wie ro, gethek ne ichiih shii haliig thek uom rab pha ro, jia yi na shii, jia yi Moses shii, chiih-è jia yi Elija shii.” (Ai è de ji yi izai athieg mua ai è nyie yao pha ji ne.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Ai ji è yao ramuii shii, sakhamiing thab srane ithek ragia rog shii chiieg muii; chiih-è sakhamiing è aishii thab mage ne airo samoythek ne rum dun. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Aij 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mth 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrg 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lug 3:22</ref></char></note> Goh jia yi sakhamiing è yao ruii, “Hì ne guro Dufuii ro, gu mugua ne ruii ro, ji è aishii nuii bo!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Goh ji aro pha rey dun shii, thiisa hà Isu awai ji jia um bie. Samoythek è jithek zab aro pha rai muii srane, chiih-è ji pha ishak shii ithek è nyie doh pha ji hanyie shii de ayao.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è ibuii ragung thoh muii pha bufuii jia shii gang phi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mth 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mrg 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Ji pha thimiang ne Isu nane airo samoy uom yi phiing lakhung è thazam wuii thog shii, bran boh ibrogthek è Isu nane ithek shii si. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Bran jia yi ibrog è ziak mage, “Masdo! Gu na shii khung dang phro, gu dufuii shii riig mage bo guro dufuii ji jia bie ro!” <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Ibuii ragung è aishii khud srane hamblo shii ziak ne awailum ne chiih srane chiihphado sem è imamiung khia; aishii ne bajo duhug phi ne ruii srane diig yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Gu è na samoythek shii khia phi bo è khung ne yao shii, jishii ithek è ne akhia mua phi ro.<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Isu è chang, “Nathek ne migi arek pho nane ichiig pha branthek ara! Gu nathek rog shii khama rai dam mage phlei?” Gu khama chiieng nathek shii zud dam phi phlei? Jishii ai è bran jishii yao, “Na dufuii shii tha hà yie mage bo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Bufuii ji yi wuii mage shii, ibuii è aishii jog thoh srane aishii ne nyiak lakhung hà thud pha yi. Isu è ibuii ragung shii giung mage shii, ji pha bufuii ne gang rey dun, chiih-è ai aphuii shii idoh phi din muii. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Zab pha branthek Hamangkhung-aphuii pha gang blu ji riig srane wiengphleg dun.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Isu è awai Iy pha ji dinne yao </para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mth 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mrg 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Awai samoythek shii yao, branthek è Isu mirek pha jithek zab riig srane wiengphleg bamuii ro. <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>Gu è nathek shii nyie yao pha rek pha ji ne abia rabo! Bran Dufuii shii ne bran blu shii phi muii ro. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Jishii samoythek è ji pha miyao ne agao mua, hì pha miyao yi ithek agao yi pha ithek è ug muii, chiih-è ithek ne rum srane hì pha miyao chiang asai mua.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hanyie yi zab è boh ga </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mth 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrg 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lug 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hanyie yi zab è boh ga è sai ne samoythek awaithek chung khnaing rai. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Isu è ithek nyie now pha ji ne thieg srane, ji è ai è ani jia yi srane awai moe shii riu ba yi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mth 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lug 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jon 13:20</ref></char></note> Chiih-è ithek shii yao, “Hanyie magunde hì pha ani shii gu beng è wie ho arone, ai gu shii de wie ho phro, chiih-è hanyie è gu shii wie ho arone, gu shii thoh ge pha ji shii de wie ho ro. Ji è nathek duchoi shii hanyie ai yi zab ìu ga ai ne zab è boh ro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hanyie ithek shii gidieg arek pho ne ithek pha bran ro </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mrg 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Jon è Isu shii yao, “Masdo, gathek è bran de na beng è ibuiithek khiaramuii pha doh ro, chiih-è gathek è arek rabo è gak marui, nyieliieshii ai ne gethek rog pha bran asi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>“Aishii gak pha abidiang rabo,” Isu è Jon nane gai samoythek shii de yao, “Nyieliieshii hanyie è na shii gidieg arek pho ne nathek bran ro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samarithan thiigpho è Isu shii wie aho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Isu shii hamangkhung hà noh sha pha nui thog mage shii, Jerusalem hà wuii dang pha awai khani shii phak. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Ai è muaphothek shii awai ibi shii thoh srane Samaria thiig hà wuii ne zab khriig rek yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Jishii thiisa pha branthek è aishii wie aho, nyieliieshii ithek ne thieg ai ne Jerusalem hà wuii bie. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2Saj 1:9-16</ref></char></note>Airo samoythek Jems nane Jon è ji riig srane, ithek è yao, “Ithong, na ne ichid bey Hamangkhung è bai shii ho srane ithek shii hùb yi mage habey?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Elija mirek duiine.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Isu è idoh rei srane ithek shii giung.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne chodo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chiih-è yao, “na ne athieg khi è rek pha Ragung è khia na; Bran Dufuii ne tharothamang rai pha jishii srobro rek pha awuii, jishii ithek shii ragia rek phi.”</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Chiihphado Isu nane samoythek gai thiig hà wuii marui.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu rog shii lua mua pha ne hanyie ga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mth 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Ithek yi awaithek lumuii hà luaramuii shii, bran jia è Isu shii yao, “Na khi hà lua magunde gu narog shii lua gieng pha ro.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Isu è aishii yao, “Shaliiethek de icho um, chiih-è fuiithek shii de irungthek um, jimagunde Bran Dufuii shii ne thieng ne thung pha ithua de oi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Isu è gai bran jishii yao, “Gu rog shii luagieng bo,” jimagunde ji pha bran è yao.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">“Masdo, igobi gu shii hò hà idoh dun yi ne gu aphuii shii wieng bi yi bo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Isu è chang, “Iy-iy shii awai iy-iy è wieng yi bo. Na ne wuii srane Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Sajathua ji yua bi bo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:61: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1Saj 19:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Bran jia è de Isu shii yao, “Gu de nathek rog shii luagieng pha ro, Masdo; jimagunde igobi gu shii hò hà gui haliing pho shii de wie rai bo è yao pha thoh ge bo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Isu è aishii yao, “Hanyie magunde raig woi pha jakhokh shii wad kho srane idoh hà rai ne riig pho ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua jishii gu ne chid phro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Isu è samiley nyi shii fuang hà thoh ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Jithek pha idoh shii Ithong è bran samiley nyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">samle è nyi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">samle.</char></note> shii gua srane bijiu nyi nyi rek ne ai ibi shii awai wuii pha rek pha thawun nane ithua shii thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mth 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref></char></note> Ai è ithek shii yao, yamiing ne bajo um ro, jishii khrab pha brapho ne ìujia bie ro. Ji-è yamiing khrab pha thoh ge bo è yamiing pha muspho shii sia mage bo. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mth 10:16</ref></char></note> Wuii mage bo, gu ne nathek shii shiishaithek duiine shaluiithek duchoi shii thoh ge phro. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mth 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mrg 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lug 9:3-5</ref></char></note> Chiih-è nathek bang chab pha biia, chiih-è chayem pha buii, chiih-è lakhia de ayie rabo, chiih-è lumuii hà hanyie shii magunde wad khung ne yao pha athung rabo. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Khuchung magungde ithek hò jia shii khud dun arone igobi shii ji pha hò shii ne liijiing um bo è yao bi bo. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Chiih-è thiisa liijiing um pha bran murai arone nathek liijiing khung ne phi pha ji ai rog shii rai dun phro; ji oi arone nathek shii gu miphi pha liijiing ji idoh yie din bo. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Khor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Thi 5:18</ref></char></note> Chiih-è nathek ji pha hò shii rai bo, chiih-è ithek è nathek shii nyie phi pha ji chie ne niing ne rai bo, nyieliiene blia rek pho shii ne awai blia pha riinang phi ruii phro. Hò hò lai ne alua rabo. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Chiih-è khuchung magunde ithek bajarai jia hà wuii dun shii ithek è nathek shii wie ho ne nyie phi pha ji chie mage bo, <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>ji pha rajan hà rad pho shii gang phi bo, chiih-è thiisa pha branthek shii yao bo; Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha ishak ne nathek shii nui thog sha ruii ro. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10,11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Blk 13:51</ref></char></note> Khuchung magunde bajarai jia hà wuii thog shii nathek shii wie aho arone nathek ne lumuii hà khia srane yao mage bo, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>Chiih-è nawaithek bajarai pha nyiakphlab nathek lai shii mieg ne kham pha ji de nawaithek shii mak rek phro, Jishii nowbthan mage bo Hamangkhung-aphuii Sajathua pha ne ithek moe thog sha ruii ro! <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Igo 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mth 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mth 10:15</ref></char></note>Gu nathek shii yao, chua pha inai shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii bushun ne ji pha thawun è wie ne Sodom pha thiig shii bajo rek phi ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Migi anow pha thawunthek </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mth 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Aij 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Ezkh 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Jol 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Ams 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zekh 9:2-4</ref></char>
    </note>Khorazin nane Bethsaida! Hì è rek pha hì ne nathek shii khama duhug rey dun phro, ithek shii rek phi pha buangthek ne Thaire nane Sidon hà rek phi arone ithek khuchung mujo thulo yung guii srane siphie shun ne awaithek layog è thadoh khidjong ro è doh yijong iwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Chua pha inai shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è ne ithek è de huak pha bushun ne Thaire nane Sidon shii phi ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Aij 14:13-15</ref></char></note> Chiih-è Khaphernaum pho nathek, nathek ne Hamangkhung hà chiing yi pha now ne bey? Nathek ne thumluii hà fen muii phro!<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mth 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mrg 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lug 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jon 13:20</ref></char>
    </note> Isu è awai samoythek shii yao, hanyie è ithek shii nuii pho ne, gu shii de nuii, hanyie è ithek shii snai arone gu shii de snai phro, chiih-è hanyie è gu shii snai arone gu shii thoh ge pha ji shii snai phro.<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samiley è nyie bran idoh dun thog din</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Samiley è nyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Samle è nyi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">samle </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig 1 shii)</char></note> jithek yi bajo lubo srane idoh dun thog. “Chiih-è ithek è Ithong shii yao, ibuiithek de na beng è yung mage shii nuii dang dun!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Isu è ithek shii chang, “Sakhathong ne hamangkhung è haliao duiine bliak ne chiih pha doh muii ro. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Chng 91:13</ref></char></note> Yoi mage bo, gu è nathek shii riichai phi ro, ji è ithek phamthek, nane ragungphiethek lakhung shii de nyalua mua phro, chiih-è shuang pha bluthek è de nyayang mua phro, chiih-è ithek shii nyie è achun phro. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Jishii ibuii ragungthek è ithek miyao nuii rone asang chid rabo; ithek beng hamangkhung pha siog hà zey ne um rone jishii sang bo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è sang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mth 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:16-17">Mrg 13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ji pha ishak shii Isu yi Ragung So<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ragung so re-è; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ragung re-è; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">gai shii ne awai Ragung um.</char></note> è ley srane lubo ne yao, Aphuii, Ithong hamangkhung nane sohnyiak pha! Gu na shii laso phi, nyieliieshii na è khani pho nane ìd pho è ug ne ruii pha ji ne adab pho shii phi. Aphuii, hì ne na è nyie khi-èrek chid pha ji rey ro.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jon 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">Jon 10:15</ref></char>
    </note> “Gu Aphuii è zab manathek gu shii phijong ro. Chiih-è Dufuii shii hanyie de athieg ro Aphuii mithieg bie ro, chiih-è Aphuii shii de hanyie de athieg Dufuii mithieg bie ro, chiih-è ai è hanyie shii dong phi pha ne Dufuii è gua ne ruii.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Chiihphado Isu è idoh rei srane samoythek shii ug ne yao, “Nathek hì pha muna riig ramuii pha hì ne nathek shii ne khama pha khirzey um ro! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Gu nathek shii yao phro chaigthek nane sajathek de nathek è doh pha ji ithek de riig yang jishii ithek ne ariig mua, chiih-è nathek nyie yoi pha ji ne ithek de yoi yang pha now ne de ithek ayoi mua.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wie Samarithan pha najang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mth 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mrg 12:28-34</ref></char>
    </note>Iphey yao pha masdo jia wuii srane Isu shii ichiig sow pha bidiang. Ai è sai, “Masdo,” “Gu idang pha chai mua pha nyie rek chid phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Isu è aishii chang, “Jigigam shii nyie ro è yao lei? Chiih-è na ithek shii khi-èrek ne yua ne yao phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Iphy 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew 19:18</ref></char>
    </note> Ji pha bran è chang, “Hamangkhung-aphuii Ithong shii lubu è miie bo, chiih-è zab nawai ragung è, chiih-è zab pha nawai chua è, chiih-è zab pha nawai khani è; chiih-è ‘nawai shii miie rek pha duiine na hadung-haluii pho shii de miie rek bo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew 18:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Isu è ji pha bran jishii chang; “Na ne izai chak ro,” chiih-è “Na de ji duiine rek arone na ne sieng ne rai phro.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Jishii Iphey yao pha masdo a-ìd pha duiine rek srane, Isu shii sai, “Gu hadung-haluii pho hanyie lei?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Isu è chang, luang jia bran jia yi Jerusalem è buzam Jerikho hà wuiiramuii shii mugo pho è aishii zum srane ai manathek zab pha riao srane ikhlen rek ne iytho dang pha zuang ne thoh marui. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Ji-è rek pha ishak shii phabi de ji pha lumuii è luaramuii; jimagunde ai è ji pha bran shii doh mage ne, ai è ai moe pha yoh lumuii è lua marui. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Ji duiine lewi jia de ji pha lumuii è luaramuii shii ji pha bran shii riig srane, chiih-è yoh pha ithua è lua marui. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33,34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2Phal 28:15</ref></char></note> Jishii Samarithan jia de ji pha lumuii è lua ne ji pha bran moe shii wuii thog, chiih-è ai è aishii riig mage shii, ai lubu ne bushun now dun. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Ai è ji pha bran shii wuii srane thiiliie nane phuii è airo saduii shii shun srane yung rek ne jiang phi; chiihphado è ji pha bran shii awai bambao lakhung hà gow srane thung pha hò hà noh ne, aishii ragia rek phi. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Din pha inai shii ji pha bran è liiman pha simed nyi yie srane hò khan pha bran jishii phi marui srane yao. Aishii wie khagi rek bo ai è hò khan pha ji shii yao, chiih-è gu idoh hì pha lumuii hà de ruii shii, na è aishii khama pha phi pha ji gu na shii idoh phi din pha ro.<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Idohhè shii Isu è sai, “Na miigao è, ithek uom è hanyie yi mugo bran è zum ne ua mua pha airo hadung-haluii pho duiine hanyie munong phi lei?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Iphey yao pha masdo è chang, “hanyie è aishii bushun rek phi pha ji ro.” Isu è chang, “Chiihphado, na de, ji duiine rek bo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Martha nane Mery shii si wuii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38,39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jon 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isu nane awai samoythek awaithek lumuii è lua ne ji pha thiig hà thog shii, hò-amuii Martha beng pha bimi ji è aishii hò hà wieho. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Aishii de Mery beng pha bumuii jia um, hanyie Ithong lai luii shii dug ne miyao nuii pha ji ro.<verse eid="LUK 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Martha yi airo blia rek ba pha um pha ji è bajo diig now srane, ai è wuii thog srane yao, “Ithong na ne agayiig bey gu bumuii è zab pha blia ne gu rek bo ne ruii muii ro? Aishii yao ne gu rog shii nong gieng yi bo!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Ithong è aishii chang, “Martha, Martha! Na ne bajo shii monowthiig ne diig now ara ro, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Jishii jia hì ne mugak ro, Mery ne awairo zab è izai ji guajong ro, chiih-è hì ne ai ji è hanyie de ariao mua phro.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Isu è misia shii yua </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mth 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Nai jia Isu yi ithua jia shii misia sia. Ai misia sia ched shii, samoy jia è aishii yao, “Ithong, Jon è awai samoythek shii yua pha duiine, gathek shii de misia sia pha yua bo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Isu è ithek shii yao, khuchung magunde nathek sia arone yao bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Aphuii:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Naro so ibeng ne ilab rey bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">chiih-è naro Sajathua ne thog bo.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Gathek shii chid pha michie inai tham ne phi bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gethek ne michie chid; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">inai jia pha michie.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Gathek layog shii khung phi bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">gathek de ithek asi pha rek pha ji shii khung phi ro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Chiih-è gathek shii nang chua pha aphi rabo.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Isu awai samoythek shii yao, yangne nathek hanyie magunde jia è habiu duchoi hà wuii srane nawai ijak shii yao, gu ijak, iweb uom chei phi bo. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Gu ro ijak jia thiih shii gu hò hà wuii thog ro, chiih-è aishii chie yi pha gu shii ne nyie de oi ro! <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Chiih-è yang ne na ijak è hò iliing è chang mage, gu shii afak-afi arek rabo! Gu ro hò ne binjong muii ro, chiih-è gu ro ani nane gu ne biang hà sha ro. Gu asieng mua sha phro chiih-è gu na shii nyie de aphi mua phro, <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Wie, nyie chiihphado? Gu na shii yao na ijak sieng ne na shii iweb aphi magunde na è awo dang pha lia ne rai arone, ji è ai sieng srane na nyie chid pha ji nyaphi ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Chiih-è gu nathek shii yao: lia bo, ji arone na mua ruii phro; sow bo ji arone doh ruii phro; habin shii chokh bo ji arone na shii hong ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Chiih-è hanyie è lia jishii ne phi ruii phro, chiih-è hanyie è sow ji pha bran shii ne doh ruii phro; chok bo, chiih-è habin na shii hong phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Dufuii è ù lia shii pham phi pha aphuii ne nathek è hanyie ga? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Chiih-è ai kheri lia shii ragungphie phi ne bey? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Nathek awie pho rang de, nawaithek ani shii nyie khi-èrek wie phi chid phro è thieg. Aishii lia pho ne Hamangkhung Aphuii è ji è de muna Ragung So phi ruii phro!<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu nane Sakhathong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mth 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mrg 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Isu è miyao ayao mua pha ibuii shii gieng; Chiihphado è ibuii fuang hà khia mage shii, ji pha bran ne jao ne yao mua. Ji-è thiichiih pha bran ibrogthek de wiengphleg dun, <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mth 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> Jishii thiichiih pha giak branthek è yao, “Hì ne Sakhathong ara, ai ne ibuii pha dumuii ara, hanyie è aishii blu phi ne gieng yi pha ji ara.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mth 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mrg 8:11</ref></char>
    </note> Giak è Isu shii ichiig sow pha now, ji è hì thek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è rey pha blia chak rone gathek shii wiengphleg pha khagi rek bo. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Jishii Isu è ithek nyie now pha ji thieg srane, ai è ithek shii yao, hanyie soh shii ibrog yoh che rai ne gidieg rek arone ji pha thiig ne idang rey ne arai mua phro; chiih-è haliing chung mak rek rai arone ji de yoh rey dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Ji-è ibuii awaithek chung zab riichai shii ibrog rek ne gui rai arone, nyie khi-èrek ne hì rai mua phlei? Nathek ne yao, gu è ibuii khia pha hì ne Sakhathong è gu shii blu phi ne ji mikhia ro è yao. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Chiihphado gu ibuii shii fuang hà ji è rek ne gieng arone, nathek samoy pho yi khi-èrek ne gieng phlei? Chiih-è nawai samoy pho è hì asi ro è nya doh yi ro! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Asi gu è Hamangkhung-aphuii blu è ibuii shii gieng shii, hì è ne nathek shii doh yi phro Hamangkhung-aphuii Sajathua ne ithek shii wuiijong ro.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Bran bgang jia yi, awai rog shii migiang khriig rek srane, awai hò khan ne rai arone, ai hò shii nyie um pha ji ragia rey phro. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Jishii ai è muna bran biigang jia è aishii mak jo srane ai è yang mua arone, muspho è luthong muii pha migiang jithek ne ai è zab han srane awaithek chung ai è nyie goh pha ji thang rai phro. <verse eid="LUK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mrg 9:40</ref></char></note> Hanyie magunde gu rog shii asi pho ne izai gu shii gidieg rek ara ro; chiih-è hanyie yi gu rog shii nong ne akhrab gieng arone ai ne izai dayiingdayang rek ara.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ibuii ragung yi idoh dun thog din </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mth 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Khuchung magungde ibuii ragung yi bran è fuang khia srane, igoh soh lakhung shii lua srane thung pha ithua so. Jishii jia de adoh sha arone. Awai è awai shii yao, ‘Gu ne gui hò hà idoh dun din sha pha ro.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Ji-è ai idoh dun srane riig shii hò ne so nane khriig um iang. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Chiihphado ai ne fuang hà wuii srane dinne yoh miley awai è de awiedang pha ragung noh ruii, chiih-è ithek ji hà dun srane rai gieng. Ji è jithek rek ched ne, ji pha bran ne igobi è de lahuak awie pha rey dun.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zai sang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Isu è jithek yao ramuii shii, bran iphiing iliing è hò-amuii jia è aishii yao, “na shii giak ne na shii ram pha hò-amuii ne bajo khirzey ro!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Jishii Isu è chang, “Ji-è ne, hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii miyaogam yoi ne nuii pho ne khama sang ro!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Buang pha miyao ji nak </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mth 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mth 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mrg 8:12</ref></char>
    </note> Bran brog yi Isu moe khrab ramuii shii, ai è yao, duchung pha branthek ne bajo awiedang ara! Jona ne ithek ne buang pha blia nak ne rai. Jishii Jona ro buang pha blia ji doh bie yi ne gai ne ithek shii adoh yi phro. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Jon 3:4</ref></char></note> Ji duiine chaig Jona ne Ninewe pha cheb ro, ji è Bran Dufuii ne duchung pha branthek ro cheb ro. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Saj 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Phal 9:1-12</ref></char></note> Chiih-è chua pha inai shii sajamuii Sheba è riu ne ithek shii nin ruii phro, nyieliieshii ai ne Saja Solomon ro muyua wie ji nuii awai soh pha zab lumuii è wuii phro; ji è gu ithek shii yao ichiih shii ne nyie magunde um pha ji ne Solomon è de boh um ba ro. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Jna 3:5</ref></char></note> Che pha idoh shii ne Ninewe pha branthek è riu ne ithek shii the ruii phro, nyieliieshii ithek ne Jona muyua ji nuii srane awaithek layog è khidjong ro: Chiih-è gu ithek shii yao ichiih shii ne nyie magunde um pha ji ne Jona è de boh um ba ro!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siu pha muchuang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mth 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mth 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mrg 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lug 8:16</ref></char>
    </note> Khuchung magungde muchuang yi siikhiiakhjam bucho hà chab ne ug srane aruii;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne oi ro </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dinne shkhiiakhjam iliing chab.</char></note> ji pha chiang shii muchuang ne bunthruak lakhung shii ruii ro, nyieliieshii hacho wuii pha branthek shii sang doh yi chid. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Nathek mieg yi siu pha muchuang duiine ro. Nathek mieg yi sang doh shii, nathek siu shii de ley muchuang um ro; jimagunde nathek mieg yi awie arone, nathek siu de zab igiia ro. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Chiihphado khriig rab bo, nathek shii um pha muchuang ji igiia arey yi rabo! <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Nathek siu shii muchuang ley um arone, nathek ne igiia rog oi sha phro, ji è zab sang rey dun, muchuang yi na lakhung shii khilieng mage shii na shii de chuang dun.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Pharisithek nane iphey yua pha Masdothek shii the </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mth 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrg 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Isu ji è yao ched dang shii, Pharisithek è aishii ithek rog shii michie chie pha ho; ji è ai ne iliing hà wuii srane michie chie pha dug. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Pharisithek è Isu ne wad achun pha michie chie pha ji riig ne wiengphleg dun.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Ji-è Ithong è ithek shii yao, chiihphado, duchung pha Pharisithek nathek ne gog nane shiikhiia shii ne fuang è wie shud bie ara, jimagunde nathek ne iliing shii ne ley awie pha nane lijieg um ro. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Bi-ìethek! Hamangkhung-aphuii è fuang shii rab bie ne iliing shii arab bey? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Jishii nathek ro shiikhiia nane gog shii nyie um pha ji ne dushothek shii phi bo, chiih-è nathek shii zab so rey phro.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lew 27:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pharisithek nathek ne khama diig phro! Nathek ne marey pha ishak shii, buzo nane phadina ne jia sua Hamangkhung-aphuii shii phi, jishii nathek ne izai nane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii miie rek pha jithek shii ne snai muii. Gai shii asnai pha, hì ne nathek dab bo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Pharisithek nathek ne khama diig phro! Nathek ne Jewthek misiahò hà de ithua wie shii ong ne bajarai hà de ithek shii wad khung ne ilab phi bo è now.” <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Nathek shii ne khama diig phro! Nathek ne branthek cheb arek ba pha hanyie è athieg wieng lakhung shii lua pha duiine ro.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Ji-è yao ramuii shii Iphey yao pha masdo jia è Isu shii yao, “Masdo, na nyie yao pha ji ne, na ne gathek shii makhakriing ara!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Isu è chang, Iphey yao pho nathek shii de khama diig phro! Nyieliieshii nathek ne branthek phadung shii ithek è ahan mua pha miihan han yi, jishii nawaithek ne ragia rek gieng pha ji pha mahan shii wad rang de akhoh gieng. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Nathek shii de khama diig phro! Nyieliieshii nathek è nawaithek riing mu-ua pha chaigthek shii ne wieng de bajo wie rab phi. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Nawaithek ne thieg, nathek riing è nyie suruii rek pha ji de nathek è khriig now, nathek è chaigthek shii ua muii chiih-è nathek è ithek ro wieng rab phi.<verse eid="LUK 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Hì pha chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii khani è yao, Gu chaigthek nane muaphothek shii thoh ge, ithek è giak shii ua srane, chiih-è giak shii diigchiao phi. <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Sohjambling rab dang pha ishak è yie ne chaigthek shii ua pha chiang è duchung pha bran nathek shii lago phi ruii phro, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Igo 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2Phal 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char></note> Abel shii ua pha ji è yi ne sraibao nane So Ithua pha duchoi shii ua muii pha Zekharia ishak thog dang pha. Gu nathek shii yao, nathek chiang ne duchung pha bran nathek lago phi pha ro!<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Iphey yao pho nathek ne khama diig phro! Nathek ne khani hò pha habin hong pha ziu ne yie ne ruii; chiih-è nawaithek de iliing hà ne awuii, chiih-è ithek ne gai iliing hà wuii pha bidiang pho shii de gak muii.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Isu è ji pha ithua thoh marui srane dun shii, Iphey yao pha masdo nane Pharisithek è aishii bajo awie dang pha rek srane, bajo manathek pha miyao sai. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Ai ne suruii yao gua ino ne ithek è ichiig sow ne aishii zum pha bidiang.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Lawasdaithek shii phriie </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mth 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mth 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mrg 8:15</ref></char>
    </note> Itham bran yi òjia shii khrab thog mage shii, ithek ne awaithek chung thum rai dun. Jishii igobi Isu è awai samoy shii yao, Pharisithek ro awie pha muphak ji è nawaithek shii ragia rek bo, gu è yao pha miyao jine ithek ro lubo siie ro. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mrg 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lug 8:17</ref></char></note> Nyie magunde cheg ne ruii pha ji ne acheg mua phro, chiih-è nyie magunde ug ne ruii pha ji ne thieg dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Chiihphado, nyie magunde na è igiia hà yao ji ne isang moe hà yoi dun phro, chiih-è nyie magunde na è ùgud bin srane ji hà suak ne yao magunde hò lakhung pha zak hà ziak dun phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hanyie shii rum chid </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mth 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>Gu ijakthek, gu nathek shii yao, hanyie è na siu shii ua bie pha ji shii ne arum rabo jimagunde dinne nyie de buii arek mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Gu nathek shii riig yi hanyie shii rum chid: ua pha idoh, hanyie, shii thumluii hà fen pha blu um pha, Hamangkhung-aphuii shii rum bo. Gu shii migi now bo, nathek rum chid pha ne ai jia ro!<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Adili nyi shii fuiisrai guii aliu bey? Thiih rang de Hamangkhung-aphuii è fuiisrai jia shii ableng ba ro.” <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Nathek khrug pha khaziang rang de zab tham ne ruii phro, ji è nathek ne arum chid rabo. Nathek ne fuii è de bajo igong ro!<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuii pha nane Masi shii snai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mth 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Gu ithek shii ji yao hanyie magunde bran moe shii yaodang arone ai ne gu rog è chak ara, ji duiine Bran Dufuii de aishii Hamangkhung-aphuii hamangkhliie moe shii è rek phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Jishii hanyie è branthek moe shii gu shii snai arone, Bran Dufuii è de Hamangkhung-aphuii hamangkhliie moe shii aishii de snai ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mth 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mrg 3:29</ref></char>
    </note>Hanyie jia è de Bran Dufuii shii buii miyaogam yao magunde nya khung phi phro; jimagunde hanyie è Ragung So shii buii yao arone, khuchung de akhung phi ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11,12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mth 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mrg 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Lug 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref></char></note> Khuchung magungde ithek è nathek shii Jewthek misiahò hà nane bohkhoh pha badri, hà noh pha bidiang magunde, nawaithek shii ragia khi-èrek chid chiih-è nathek nyie yao chid pha ji ne munow adiig chid rabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ji è rek pha ishak shii nathek nyie yao chid pha ji ne Ragung So è nyayua ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bukho jia chiih-è bi-ìe pha najang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Bran jia yi ibrog iliing è Isu shii yao, “Masdo” Gu khuii shii yao ne aphuii mutho marui pha nuruii ji gu shii thang sha noh bo.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Isu è aishii chang, “Gu ijak, na sa duchoi shii nuruii thang pha chiih-è che phi pha rangsua ne gu shii hanyie miphi lei?”<verse eid="LUK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Chiih-è ai zab thek shii yao, nowbthan ne zab pha giichak pha ji è nawaithek shii ragia rek bo; nyieliieshii bran ro izai chai ne awai mana nane bukho è arab ro. Ai khama pha bukho magunde nyie achun phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Chiihphado Isu ji pha najang è shan ne yao: Luang jia bukho bran jia ro soh shii wie iwoi rey. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Ai jao ne awailum ne now, gu shii ne iwoithek ruii pha ithua de oi, ji è gu ne nyie rek sha? <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Hì ne gu nyie rek sha; ai è awai shii yao, gu ne thazan yi chuak ne boh jia rung din srane, garo nying nane zab pha mana yi jishii chab ne ruii chid. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Chiihphado gu ne gui shii yao, khirzey bran! Na shii ne idam bajo thog pha nyie chid pha de zab mana na shii um, ji è nane bajo idam liijiing è sieng ne, chie ne, niing ne, lubo rek phro! <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii yao, na ne bi-ìe ro! Hì pha habiu shii na ne nawai sieng pha ji ne thoh chid phro; ji è na è nawai shii ruii pha mana hì thek ne hanyie mua phlei? <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Chiihphado Isu è yao, “Ji duiine ji pha bran de awai shii bajo bukho rab ne ruii jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii mieg moe hà ne bukho asi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii shii migi now bo </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mth 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Chiihphado Isu è awai samoythek shii yao, chiih-è gu nathek shii yao nathek sieng ne rai pha michie chid pha chiih-è nathek siu shii guii pha yungthek shii sam diig anow chid rabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Chai ne michie re-è de bajo mugak ba ro, chiih-è siu ne yung è de bajo mugak ba ro. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Amiiethek shii riig mage bo: Ithek ne iriiethek de ahai chiih-è yamiing de akhrab; ithek shii chab ne ruii pha ùgud nane thazan de oi; jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii è ithek shii phi! Nathek ne fuii è de bajo mugak ba ro! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Ji è nathek ne hì thek samdiig srane nawai sieng pha phiang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ìujia phiang rai ba bo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ìujia phiang sieng ba bo.</char></note> nyarek mua ne bey! <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Nathek ne ididuii shii rang de khriig arek mua shii, nyie um ne nathek gai muna shii sam diig phlei? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Saj 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Phal 9:3-6</ref></char></note> Riig mage bo nyie khi-èrek ne jabiing pha ibuathek rang sieng khlei: ithek ne blia de arek chiih-è awaithek ro yung de arab. Ji-è gu nathek shii yao saja Solomon ro khama pha nuruii pha yung khie um magunde jishii ibuathek nyama khie oi ro. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Hì ne saing shii yung guii phi pha Hamangkuhng-aphuii ro hì pha saing ne sudoh ichiih shii um chiih-è thimiang ne shong ne, siphie bai hà fu muii. Ji-è ai ne ithek zab shii ai è de lahuak ne yung aguii phi habey? Nathek shii ne migi ìu um bie ara.<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Ji-è nathek ne idang ne nyie chie nyie niing pha jithek shii sam adiig chid rabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>(Ichiih sohjambling phothek Hamangkhung-aphuii shii athieg pho ne hì pha mana shii munowthiig.) Nathek aphuii ne nathek hì è chid phro è thieg phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Ji phachiang è, airo Sajathua pha ji shii sam diig now bo, chiih-è ai ne na shii jithek phi ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung hà bukho </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mth 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>Arum chid rabo, guro ìu ibrog, nathek Aphuii è nyu ne Sajathua ne nathek shii phi ro. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Nathek shii nuruii um pha ji zab liu srane ji pha bang yi dusho shii phi bo. Khuchung magunde amua pha nuruii baneb jia nawai shii khriig rab ne ruii bo, chiih-è naro nuruii ne Hamangkhung hà khrab ne ruii bo, thiisa hà nathek è de ìu arek phro, nyieliieshii mugo phothek de ayie mua phro, chiih-è dakhyem è de awie pha arek mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Khi hà nathek ro nuruii um lei ne nathek ro lubu de idang ji hà um phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gayiig pha khiao jia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>Hanyie magunde wuii ruii shii blia rek pha yung guii ne chiih-è naro ichuangthek chuang ne ruii bo. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mrg 13:34-36</ref></char></note> Khiao duiine awai ithong shii phi pha michie è khuchung idoh dun ruii pha ji khan ne habin chokh ruii shii wuii srane khthiie habin hong phi. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Khinyama sang phro ithek shii Ithong è idoh dun ne riig shii khiao ithek ne khriig sieng ne rek iang pha doh yi ne! Gu ithek shii yao, ai è awai shungkho than srane ithek shii dug yi pha yao phro, chiih-è ithek shii chie yi phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Habiu pha duchoi magunde chiih-è idoh hà dun magunde khriig rek iang pha doh arone khama sang phro! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39,40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mth 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref></char></note> Chiih-è nathek hì de khriig thieg bo, mugo pho khuchung wuii ruii pha ishak ji yi hò muspho è thieg arone, ai ne mugo pho shii awai hò amua yi phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Chiih-è ithek, wie, è saro iang bo, nyieliieshii ithek è aishii aluthong pha ishak shii Bran Dufuii ne wuii ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Migi now pha nane migi anow pha khiao </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mth 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Phithar è sai, “Ithong, hì pha najang yi gathek shii thoh ne yao ne ba, chiih-è zab shii yao ne bey?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Ithong è chang, chiihphado, hanyie, yi wie nane izai khiao ga? Ai ne chiihphado awai ithong è aishii dumuii rek ne, hò gayiig pha chiih-è gai khiao ithek chiang pha michie khriig ishak shii dong phi. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Ithong hò hà dun thog ne riig shii ji duiine rek iang pha doh arone ji pha khiao shii ne bajo sang ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Ji-è, gu nathek shii yao, ji è rek pha khiao shii ne ithong è awai nuruii shii dumuii rab ne ruii muii phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Jishii ji pha khiao ji è awai shii yao, airo ithong ne idoh dun pha bajo chia iwa inow srane gai khiao hò-aphuii thek shii nane hò-amuii thek shii zuang srane niing thiig ne rai arone, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>chiihphado khiaothek è aishii aluthong pha chiih-è ji pha ishak ithek è a-ìd shii nai jia Ithong idoh de thog srane, ji pha khiao jishii ne dumdum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:46: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aishii dumdum che muii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aishii fuang fen muii.</char></note> tham srane miyao anuii pha rek pho rog shii fen mua. <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Khiaothek shii masdo è nyie rek bo ino pha ji ìd pho ne awaithek shii khriig arek phi arone, jishii ne ithek rog shii bajo zuang phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Jishii ithong è nyie chiid pha ji khiao hanyie è athieg ba arone, chiih-è thuh midijia zuang sapho rek magunde ìu zuang bie yi pha ro. Bajo phi ne ruii pha bran shii bajo chid din ruii phro, bajo phi ne ruii pho shii bajo lia ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ne che rek wuii phro </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mth 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>Gu thiwing ne sohnyiak shii bai fuii wuii phro, chiih-è gu miiyang ji ne hùb pha jao ro! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mrg 10:38</ref></char></note>Gu shii khowo mua ba pha um, chiih-è gu ji ajong sapho shii ne khama diig shii ro! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Gu ichiih sohjambling shii liijiing phi wuii phro ithek inow ne bey? Asi, liijiing asi, gu che pha wuii phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Sudoh è thiwing haliing shii bran guii yi che ruii phro, bran uom è bran nyie shii gidieg rek ruii phro chiih-è nyi è uom shii gidieg rek ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mikh 7:6</ref></char></note> Aphuii è dufuii shii gidieg rek ruii phro, chiih-è dufuii è aphuii shii gidieg rek ruii phro; amuii è dimi shii, chiih-è dimi è amuii shii gidieg rek ruii phro; khiing è icho shii chiih-è icho è khiing shii gidieg rek ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aishii thieg bo </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mth 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Isu è branthek shii de yao, “Nathek sakhamiing shii hanaiyem bsa è rek ruii pha doh mage shii, nathek ji riig srane yao haphie phie sharuii ro è yao shii haphie phie ruii. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Chiih-è nathek khuchung magunde hanai chiu è hasam sam ruii pha than mage shii nathek è yao ijieg rey sha ruii ro, chiih-è ji rey. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Lawasdai! Nathek sohnyiak nane hamangkhung shii rang thieg mua shii; ji arone nyie rek ne nathek duchung shii ishak ji agao mua lei?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nawairo gidiegpho è khriig rek bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Nathek nawaithek shii izai ji rek pha nyie rek ne achua lei? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Yang ne ithek shii nawaithek gidieg è gui rai pha miyao yie ne wuii ruii arone nawaithek rek mua pha ji rek srane chua bsa hà anow ba pha ibi shii lumuii hà nawaithek miyao ò rai pha rek bo. Ji asi shii ne ai è na thek shii chua pho hà noh srane, chiih-è chua pho è siphahi shii phi mua, chiih-è siphahi thek è phatheg hà chab muii. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Gu nathek shii yao, nathek è bang aphi sapho shii ne na ne thiisa phatheg hà rai dun phro.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Nawaithek layog nane iy pha ji è khid bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ji pha ishak shii giak bran thiisa hà um pho è Isu shii yao Galilean phothek è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii mizid zid pha ishak shii Philath è ithek shii ua muii. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Isu è ithek shii chang, nyieliieshii Galileanthek shii ji è rek ne ua muii shii, nathek è inow ne doh bey? Nathek ne gai Galileanthek è de bajo awie pha layog rek ro? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Khuchung magunde de asi phro! Chiih-è gu nathek shii yao phro nawaithek layog è idoh akhid arone, nathek shii rek pha duiine nathek de zab iy ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Siloam shii miyao heg cho srane bran snamileo iy dun pho jishii nyie khi-èrek now lei? Nathek ne inow bey? Nathek ne Jerusalem pha zab pha bran è buii ro inow bey? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Khuchung magunde asi ro! Gu nathek shii yaodang phro nsthek è nawaithek layog è akhid sapho shii ne, ithek shii rek pha duiine nathek zab iy ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iwoi awoi pha hing muii pha najang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Chiihphado shii Isu è ithek shii hì pha najang yao: Luang jia shii bran jia è hing muii shii awai raig shii hai. Ai wuii srane ji pha hing muii shii riig shii nyie de awoi iang. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Jishii ai è awai raig riig pha bran jishii yao, riig mage bo, gu dam uom è hì pha hing muii shii iphem iwoi sow wuii shii igam jia de adoh ro, aishii chiiegmuii bo! Nyie rek ne nyiak shii thaluii sieng ne rai yi phlei? <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Jishii raig riig pho è chang Masdo, brai yi bo dinne idam jia gu hì pha hing khiing shii wie jam chog srane rawo phi pha ro. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Chiihphado è hì pha hing muii è iwoi wie woi ruii arone wie ro; ji asi arone, na nya chieg muii bo.<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jewish Thung pha Inai shii Isu è ukhu-òg hò-amuii jia shii gang phi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Jewish Thung pha Inai jia shii Isu è jewish misiahò hà yao ramuii. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Hò-amuii jia yi awie pha ragung thoh ne dam snamiliao mucho è rad ne ai yi bam srane khuchung de miang arek mua. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Isu è aishii doh mage ne, ai è aishii ho, Hò-amuii, nane nawai murad ji è wie rey saro! <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Ai è awai wad ai lakhung ruii mage shii, ai yi khthiie laziung miang riu srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9">Mul 20:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Iphy 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref></char>
    </note> Jewis misiahò pha dumuii ji è Isu ne Jewish Thung pha Inai shii gang phi pha ji riig srane lijieg, ji è ai è yao srane branthek shii yao, “Gethek shii ne blia rek pha dariig um ro; ji è ji pha naishii wuii ne gang nya rek phi bo, jimagunde Jewish Thung pha Inai shii arek rabo!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Ithong è ithek shii chang, “Lawasdai ithek! Nathek è hanyie magunde nawaithek rawoi nane bambao shii Jewish Thung pha Inai shii de kho niing yi pha se ne anow bey? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Thiihchiih shii um pha ji ne Abraham pha riing ro, ibuii è aishii ne dam snamileo è phang ne ruii mua; ji è aishii ne thung pha inai idoh shii gang arek mua ne bey?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Ai muchang ji è airo shuang pho ne awailum ne biwo rey dun, ji pha ishak shii branthek ne Isu mirek pha buang pha blia jishii riig ne sang dun.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Danaro iriie pha najang </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mth 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mrg 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Isu è sai, “Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha ji ne khi duiine lei? Gu ne nyie è aishii doh ne yao sha pha lei? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Hì ne ji duiine ro. Bran jia è danaro iriie yie srane raig shii wey pha duiine ro. Misieng yi sieng srane hing rey, chiih-è fuiithek de airo idiphak shii irung rak phro.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phiia pha najang </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mth 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Din ne Isu è sai, Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua shii gu nyie khi-èrek doh ne yao sha pha lei? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Hì ne ji duiine ro. Hò-amuii jia è phiia yi srane jariie boh miihab shii lao shii zab phiia rey dun.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Habin khog </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13">Mth 7:13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Isu thiigthek shii nane thawunthek duchoi è wuii srane branthek shii yao ne Jerusalem hà rai ne wuii pha saro. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Bran jia è aishii sai, “Masdo, bran ìu shii ragia rey bie habey?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Isu è ithek shii chang, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Nathek ne wie rek srane habin khog ji è lua pha rek bo, nyieliieshii bajo branthek ne iliing hà wuii pha bidiang dang ruii phro, jimagunde awuii mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Hò pha Ithong è jai srane habin bin muii phro; chiihphado nathek è fuang hà riu srane habin shii chokh ne yao ruii phro, ‘Masdo!’ Gathek shii de hò hong phi bo, ai è nathek shii chang ruii, ‘Gu nathek shii athieg ro nathek ne khi è wuii rai lei ne!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Chiihphado nathek è chang ruii, ‘gathek è de narog shii chie niing gieng phro; na è gathek thawun shii gathek shii yua ro!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Chng 6:8</ref></char></note> Jishii de dinne ai yao ruii, gu ne athieg ro nathek khi-è wuii rai lei ne. Ichiih gu è dun bo, zab awie pha bran nathek. <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mth 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28,29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mth 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref></char></note> Nathek shii ne fuang hà fen mage shii nathek ne Abraham, Isakh, Jakhob, chiih-è zab pha chaigthek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha ji hà doh mage shii nathek ne khama choh srane nawaithek snying khriig ruii phro! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Branthek ne bichiu nane niigo, chiih-è hakhoi nane hayang è wuii srane Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua shii dug ne michie chie ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mth 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mrg 10:31</ref></char></note> Chiihphado è thiih shii hanyie yi idoh lei ne ji ne ibi rey phro, chiih-è thiih shii hanyie yi ibi lei ne ji ne idoh rey ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Jerusalem shii miie </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mth 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ji-èrek pha ishak shii giak Pharisithek è Isu shii wuii srane aishii yao, “Na ne ichiih-è gai ithua hà dun marui bo, nyieliieshii Herod è na shii ne ua pha rek muii ro.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Isu è ithek shii chang, wuii srane ji pha sulgud shii yao mage bo: Gu ibuiithek shii fuang khia ne sudoh nane thimiang shii gang rek ba phi phro, chiih-è da-uom shii gui bliajong ba phro: <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Sudoh, thimiang, chiih-è budoh shii de gu ne lua ba pha um ro; chaig shii ne Jerusalem è gai ithua hà ua pha ji ne arey mua phro.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Nathek ne chaigthek shii de ua muii, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è thoh ge pha muaphothek shii de nathek è lubao chao! Gu khama ishak nathek shii de khemuii è awai aniphiing shii iyig iliing hà khrab ne ruii pha duiine nathek ro zab pha bran shii de gui wad ruii ne gung phi pha now shii, jimagunde nathek è gu shii arek yi. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Chng 118:26</ref></char></note> Chiih-è nathek ro Misiahò ne isloi rey dun phro. Gu nathek shii yao, hanyie yi Ithong beng wuii pho ne Hamangkhung pha khirzey phi bo è yao pha ishak athog sapho shii ne nathek gu shii dinne khuchung de adoh phro.<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Isu è bran riie shii gang phi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Luang jia Jewsih Thung pha inai shii Isu michie chie pha Pharisithek pha dumuii jia hò hà wuii dun; branthek è Isu shii bajo wie è riig ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Lai wad phieng ne rad pha bran jia Isu shii wuii thog, <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>chiih-è Isu è Pharisithek shii nane Iphey pha masdothek shii sai, “Jewish thung pha nai shii gethek Iphey shii wie nyarek mua ne ba asi arek mua ne bey?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Jishii ithek è nyie de ayao, Isu è ji pha bran jishii noh srane aishii gang phi, chiih-è aishii thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mth 12:11</ref></char></note> Chiihphado è ai ithek shii yao, “Nathek de nawaithek dufuii magunde chiih-è nathek rawoi magunde Jewish Thung pha Inai shii khabiing hà chiih dun arone nathek khthiie fuang akhia phi habey?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Jishii ithek è ji è sai pha ji shii nyie de achang muluii.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jum nane ilab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Isu è riig shii giak biwenthek ne ithua wie shii gua ne dug, ji è ai ji pha najang è nathek zab shii yao: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Khua 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char></note>khuchung magungde ithek è nathek shii phiyiy pha michie shii ho ruii arone nathek ithua wie hà gua ne adug bi rabo. Nathek è de bajo mugak pha bran shii de ho pha de um phro, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>chiih-è nathek shii ho pha bran è wuii srane yao ruii, hì pha ithua hì ne aishii dug yi bo! Chiihphado ji è yao shii nathek ne bajo wo srane zab è ìu pha ithua shii dug chid pha rey ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ji-è khuchung magunde nathek shii ho ruii arone, wuii srane zab è idoh pha ithua shii dug bi bo, ji arone nathek shii ho pha muspho è nathek shii yao ruii, “Gu ijakthek isa lakhung pha ithua wie hà wuii ne dug bo. Chiihphado nathek shii zab pha biwen moe shii ilab rey ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mth 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Lug 18:14</ref></char></note> Hanyie magunde awai shii boh rab arone, jishii ne ìu rab ruii phro, chiih-è hanyie magunde ìu rab ne rai arone, jishii ne boh rab phi phro.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Chiihphado è Isu è aishii ho pha ji shii yao, “khuchung magunde na è luthua nane michie phi shii, nawaithek ro khuiinothek ijak, siang, hadung-haluii pha bukhothek shii aho rabo ithek de na shii idoh ho dinne phi ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Khuchung magungde michie phi arone, dusho, khu-òg, laikhi-èg nane miegthi thek shii phi bo, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>chiih-è ithek shii khirzey mua ruii phro, nyieliieshii ithek ne na shii idoh aphi mua din phro. Bran Wie è iy ne hòi pha naishii Hamangkhung-aphuii è idoh phi ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Boh michie pha najang </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mth 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Bran jia yi thiibliie shii dug srane ji pha miyao ji nuii ramuii shii, ai è Isu shii yao, “Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha michie shii dug pho ne khama sang phro!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Isu è ji pha bran jishii yao, “Bran jia è michie bajo boh phi ramuii shii ai è bran bajothek shii ho. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Michie chie pha ishak rey mage shii, zab khriig rey sha rone biwenthek shii, ‘Thawuii sha bo, è ho pha awai khiaothek shii thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Jishii ithek zab jao ne jia pha idoh shii jia è wad khung ne yao, igobi pha ji è khiao jishii yao gu ne raig phegjong muii ro, chiih-è gu ne wuii srane raig ji riig pha um ro; chiih-è gu è khung hì nuii dang bo.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Gai jia è de yao, gu è de rawoi idiib guii phegjong muii ro ji è gu ne ithek shii fuang gieng pha ithek shii khi-èrek ne woi pha ji yua pha um ro; gu è khung ji nuii dang phi bo. <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Gai jia è de yao, gu ne yiy iwo yie dang ba phro, chiih-è ji pha chiang è gu de awuii mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Khiao ji è idoh dun srane zab awai ithong shii yao. Ithong ji è bajo lijieg srane awai khiao jishii yao, ‘khthiie thawun pha lumuii nane ikhi-èg hà wuii srane dusho shii, phadung khbam shii, miegthi nane laikhi-ègthek shii ho ne noh ruii bo.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Achia dang shii khiao ji è yao, na muyung ji duiine gu è noh thog ro, jimagunde thiisa hà ne ùgud oi sha ro. <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Ji-è dinne ithong è khiao jishii yao, ‘Hò ji ley rey yi pha soh pha zab lumuii hà wuii srane branthek shii ho mage bo. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Gu nathek shii zab yao ji è rek ne ho phothek shii ne hanyie jia shii de gu michie achai yi phro!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samoy rek pha igong </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mth 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Luang jia shii ibrog branthek è Isu rog shii lua gieng ramuii shii, ai è idoh rei sra ne ithek shii yao, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mth 10:37</ref></char></note> hanyie magunde gu shii wuii pho ne gu è de bajo awai aphuii amuii, yiy duii, khuiinothek, bumuii nane awai shii miie ne rai pho ne guro samoy arey mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mth 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mrg 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lug 9:23</ref></char></note>Hanyie è magunde ithek è jia yi awairo bai han ne chiihphado gu shii awuii sapho shii ne guro samoy arey mua phro.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Hanyie è magunde hò boh rung pha now arone arung ba pha ibi shii dug srane hì pha blia hì ne khama igong, chiih-è hì pha bang è siog gua asiok gua ji now phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Ai khriig arek mua arone chog ched magunde hò arung mua phro; chiih-è zab nyie rey pha ji ne branthek è aishii riig srane siak phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>Ithek è yao ruii phro! Hì pha bran è jao phane jao shii ajong mua ara.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Itham ichiig bran um pha saja rog shii itham sua bran um pha saja è mak rek pha wuii arone igobi shii wie dug srane mak rek pha khriig siog pha chua um a-um ji wie phak phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Arey mua arone gai saja awuii ba pha ibi shii awai muaphothek shii thoh ge ne liijiing rek pha miyao ò rai. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Ji duiine, Isu è yao, Hanyie magunde nawaithek shii nyie um pha ji athoh sapho shii ne guro samoy arey muii phro.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Arem pha suruii </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mth 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mrg 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>Suruii ne wie ro, jimagunde airo rem ji shand dun arone, dinne suruii rem arab mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Hì ne nyiak shii de awie chiih-è rawo shii de awie; hì shii ne fen mua. Ji-è, nathek shii nuii pha khohthek um arone, nuii mage bo!<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">San pha Shiishai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mth 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1,2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29">Lug 5:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:30">30</ref></char>
    </note> Luang jia bajo mijin thanpho nane layog branthek Isu miyao ji nuii pha wuii thog, <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Pharisithek nane Iphey yao pha masdothek jao ne mushiiy, “Hì pha bran ne riing ìuthek shii de wie ho chiih-è ithek rog shii de chie!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Isu è ji pha najang è ithek shii yao:<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>Nathek è hanyie shii magunde wieng jia shiishai um shii, chiih-è jia yi san dun arone ai nyie khi-èrek phlei? Ai ne gai sadigey è digey shii ne ilieg hà thoh marui srane jia san dun pha ji shii adoh sapho shii ne sow ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Ai è doh mage shii, ai ne bajo sang srane ai è awai baphig shii nuang <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>chiih-è idoh han ne hò hà dun. Chiihphado ai è awai ijak nane awai hadung-haluii pho shii ò ho srane ithek shii yao, gu ne bajo sang ro gu ro san dun pha shiishai ji doh ge ro. Cho gethek ne lubo rek sharai haro! <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Ji duiine gu nathek shii yao, hanyie jia magunde layog è khid arone sadige è dige ilab rai pho hanyie yi akhid chid pha ji è de huak ne Hamangkhung è ne aishii bajo lubo phro.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">San dun pha sikhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Din ne hò-amuii jia shii hayang sikhi sua um shii, airo hayang sikhi jia yi san dun arone ai nyie khi-èrek phlei? Ai ne muchuang ichuang srane awai hò shii sasriing rek ne big ne adoh sapho shii ne zab pha ithua shii wie è soh phro. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Ai è doh mage shii, ai ne awai ijak nane hadung-haluii pho shii ò ho ne yao, gu ne bajo sang sha ro gu ro sikhi san dun pha ji ne doh ge ro. Cho gethek ne lubo rek sharai haro. <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Gu nathek shii yao, ji duiine, hanyie magunde zea layog è khid arone Hamangkhung-aphuii pha hamangkhliie è aishii huak ne sang ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dufuii san dun pha ji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Isu è yao din ramuii, “Luang jia thiisa hà bran jia dufuii nyi um. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Iduno ji è aphuii shii yao, ‘Gu chiang pha nuruii thuh gui shii phi sha bo.’ Ji-è ji pha bran ji è nuruii yi ai dufuii nyi pha duchoi shii dong phi. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Iù jia pha inai idoh shii ai dufuii iduno ji è awairo nuruii yi liu srane hò thoh marui ne bang rog shii rek dun. Ai gai ruang pha soh hà wuii srane, airo bang ne thaluii rek ne rai bsa hà mua marui. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Aishii nyie um pha ji zabjong ched shii, chiihphado è ji pha soh hà diigchiao thog mage, chiih-è aishii ne nyie de aled dang pha rey dun. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Ji è ai ne blia rek sha pha thiig pha bran jia shii wuii thog, bran ji è wakthek riig yi pha raig hà thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Ai awai è ino gu ne wakthek chie pha skhong pha mabin ji è lui nyalumuii mua, jimagunde de aishii hanyie è de chie pha aphi. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Idohhè shii awai khani shii now srane yao, ‘zab pha gu aphuii ro braphothek ne khama chie mua pha ji chie, chiih-è ichiih shii gu ne chi-iyiy ne iy sha pha rek ro! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Gu ne jai srane gui aphuii shii dun ne yao pha ro, aphuii, gu è Hamangkhung-aphuii nane na shii buii rek muii ro. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Gu ne dinne na ro dufuii yao mua sapho ne asi ro; gu shii de naro riinang pha bliapho jia duiine ruii bo.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Ji-è ai jai fad srane jao ne idoh awai aphuii hò hà dun din.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Ai ne hò è ruang ba shii, ai aphuii è aishii doh mage ne; iphuii lubu ne bajo bushun now dun, chiih-è ai ran srane, awai wad è dufuii shii giak srane, chiih-è khichiug. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Dufuii ji è yao ‘Aphuii, gu-è Hamangkhung-aphuii nane na shii buii layog rek muii. Gu shii ne na dufuii yao mua pha ne asi ro.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>‘Jishii aphuii è awai khiao shii khthiie ho srane!’ Ai è yao! yung wie yie srane aishii guii phi bo. Ai wad bieng shii giinad nad phi srane lai shii e lakhia khia phi bo. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Chiihphado è igong swuii jia yie ne ua mage bo, chiih-è gethek ne michie rog shii luboh rek sha rai haro! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Hì pha gu ro dufuii ne iy dun shii, jimagunde ai ne hòi din ge ro; ai ne san dun shii, jimagunde thuh ai ne doh ge ro. Chiih-è ithek ne lubo rek pha jao.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Ji-è rek ramuii pha ishak shii dufuii kho ji yi raig hà. Ai raig è iidoh dun ne, hò hà thog ramuii shii, ai è benkhuang pha nane gasiu siu pha yoi. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Ji-è ai è awai khiao jia shii ho srane shii sai, nyie rey ramuii lei? <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>‘Khiao ji è chang’ na ikhuii ne iidoh dun thog ro, ‘chiih-è na aphuii è Igong swuii de jia ua phro, nyieliieshii ai aphuii è aishii ne wie ne mua ge.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>“Ai ro ibam ji è bajo lijieg srane hò bucho hà de adun pha rai muii; ji è ai aphuii è fuang hà wuii srane khung ne hacho hà dun bo è yao. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Jishii ai è aphuii shii chang, ‘riig mage bo, gu ne nyama idam shii khiao duiine naro blia rek phi, chiih-è gu na muyungthek shii anuii pha de arek. Na è gu shii nyie phi ga? Gu ijakthek rog shii michie chie pha sphin jia rang de aphi! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Jishii hì pha naro dufuii è naro nuruii zab siulao bimi shii mua marui, chiih-è ai iidoh hò hà thog mage shii, na è Igong swuii aishii ua ne phi’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Iphuii è chang, gu Dufuii ‘na ne idang ichiih gu rog shii rai, chiih-è gu shii nyie um pha ji ne zab naro ro. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Jishii gethek ne lubo rek ne sang chid phro, nyieliieshii na khuii ne iy dun shii, jimagunde thiih shii ai ne sieng ro; ai ne san dun shii, jimagunde thiih shii ai ne doh ge ro.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Khua khiao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Isu è awai samoythek shii yao, Luang jia shii thiisa hà bukho bran jia shii airo nuruii riig pha khiao jia um. Chiih-è bukho bran jishii yao naro khiao ne bang ne zab mua ramuii ro, <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>ji è aishii iliing hà ho srane yao, na chiang gu è yoi ramuii pha ji nyie lei? Na wad shii ruii yi pha zab nuruiithek gui shii iidoh sasab phi din sha bo, nyieliieshii nane dinne khiao rek mua sapho asi sha ro. <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Khiao ji è awai shii yao, gu ithong è gu shii ne blia è khia muii sha pha rek, gu ne nyie khi-èrek sha gua? Gu ne nyiak hiungthek chog mua sapho gang de oi, chiih-è gu ne chayem than pha de wo muii. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Thiihchiih gu ne thieg sha ge gu ne nyie rek chid! Ji-è gu ro blia yie dun pha iidoh shii gu shii hanyie è ai hò hà ho arone, gu ne jishii ijak rek pha ro. <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Ji-è ai ithong shii muruii um pha zab branthek shii ho. Ai è Igobi jia shii sai. Na è guro ithong shii khama muruii phi pha um ba lei? <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Ai è chang, sumaro thiiliie yow biig wieng jia phi pha um ba ro. Khiao ji è aishii yao; ichiih shii naro sasab um ro, dug srane nawai siog shii saguii zey mage bo. <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Chiihphado è de ai gai jia shii de sai, chiih-è naro khama phi ba pha um lei? Ai è de chang, phiug thulo itham jia muruii phi pha um ro. Khiao i ji è aishii yao: Naro sasab ichiih shii um ro, wem miliao zey mage bo.<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Ji è rek pha chiang shii ithong è khlam pha khiao è khua rek pha ji shii laso phi; nyieliieshii ichiih sohjambling pha branthek ne awaithek blia shii rey yi pha ne sang hà rai phothek è ne khua ba ro.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Chiih-è de Isu è yao, ji è gu nathek shii yao: Nathek sohjambling pha nuruii rog shii nawaithek ijak rab bo, ji è na shii khia muii magunde, na shii idang pha hò hà wie ho ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Hanyie magunde ìujia nyie shii migi um arone, ai ne boh shii de migi um ruii phro; hanyie magunde ìujia shii khlam rek arone, ai ne boh shii de khlam rek phro. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Chiihphado è, ithek soh pha nuruii shii rang de isiie è akhoh mua arone, nyie khi-èrek ne ithek shii izai pha nuruii shii khoh yi phlei? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Chiih-è na ne gai ro nyie um pha ji shii rang de isiie arey mua arone, na shii nyie um pha ji ne hanyie è phi mage phlei?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mth 6:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Khiao jia è ithong nyi ro blia arek mua phro; ai ne jia shii miie arone jia shii ne amiie phro; ai ne jia shii isiie rek ne jia shii ne isiie arek phro. Nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha blia nane bang pha blia shii ò arek mua phro.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è yao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mth 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mrg 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Pharisithek è ji zab yoi mage shii, ithek è Isu shii siakjo mage, nyieliieshii ithek ne bang shii miie. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Isu è ithek shii yao, nathek ne jia ro bran mieg moe shii ne izai chak ro è doh yi, jimagunde Hamangkhung-aphuii ne nathek lubu ne thieg ro. Nathek shii branthek miphi pha boh phua pha ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii moe shii ne nyie de aphua phro.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mth 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref></char>
    </note>“Moses ro Iphey nane chaigthek mizey ji ne Jon Khowo phi pha ishak shii chun ge ro, ji è mujo Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha Mua Wie ji yao ramuii ro, chiih-è zab gang è ji pha bucho shii khud ramuii.” <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mth 5:18</ref></char></note>Jishii Hamangkhung nane sohnyiak san dun magunde, Iphey pha ìu miyao ji ne san pha ne diig phro.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mth 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1Khor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char>
    </note>Bran hanyie magunde awai yiy shii thoh srane gai hò-amuii shii yie arone ai ne siulao rek phro; Chiih-è hò-aphuii è de gey thoh muii pha hò-amuii shii yie arone ai de siulao rek phro.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bukho bran nane Lazaras</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Luang jia thiisa hà bukho bran jia yi yung de bajo igong um pha yungthek guii srane nai tham ne bajo sang ne rai.” <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Thiisa hà Lazaras beng pha hìa è kheg muii pha dusho bran de jia um, aishii ji pha bukho bran habin moe shii noh ne ruii, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>bukho thiibliie lakhung è idum chiih ruii pha ji chie pha luthong, choi rang de ai hìa jishii liak wuii. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Dusho bran ji iy dun shii chiih-è hamangkhliiethek è noh srane Hamangkhung hà Abraham laluii shii dug ba yi. Bukho bran ji de iy ne wieng muii, <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>chiih-è thumuluii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Khjaithek: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iy pha sohjambling.</char></note> ai ne bajo riie pha thumluii bucho hà, ai è laziung hà riig shii bajo ruang hà lazaras yi Abraham laluii shii um pha doh. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Ji-è ai è ho mage, Aphuii Abraham! Gu shii de bushun rek bo chiih-è Lazaras shii thoh ge srane ai wad jiu è kho shii wo srane gu ri shii chen ne chei rek yi bo, nyieliieshii gu ne hì pha bai è bajo shud muii ro!<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>“Jishii Abraham è yao, ‘Now mage bo’ Gu dufuii, na sieng pha iidoh shii ne zab pha wie muna ne na shii phijong ro, ji pha ishak shii awie pha muna ne zab Lazaras shii phi. Jishii ai ne thuh shii ichiih lubo rek ramuii ro, nane hì pha ishak shii riie ramuii ro. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Jithek rey magunde, thiisa hà gethek duchoi shii ne Jam ihiung um ro, ji è hanyie è thawin hiia ne isa wuii yang magunde awuii mua phro, ji è gathek è thiwing ithek moe hà wuii yang magunde awuii mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Bukho bran ji è yao, chiihphado gu na shii wadkhung, aphuii Abraham, Lazarus shii gu khi hà guro khuiino guii um pha guro aphuii hò hà thoh ge bo. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Aishii wuii ge yi ne ithek shii phriie srane, hì è diig ne riie pha ithua shii adun yi rabo. <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abraham è yao, naro khuiinothek shii ne Moses nane chaigphothek phriie phro; ji è na khuiinothek ne ithek è nyie yao pha ji nuii yi bo. <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Bukho bran ji è chang, ‘Ji è ne acho ba ro, aphuii Abraham! Jishii i-iy è hòi srane ithek shii wuii arone, chiihphado ithek ne awai mirek pha layog è khid ruii phro.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Jishii Abraham è yao, ‘Ithek è Moses nane chaigphothek shii rang de anuii arone, ithek ne iy ne hòi ne wuii pha ji shii de anuii phro.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Layog </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mth 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-33">21-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mrg 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Isu è awai samoythek shii yao, “Branthek ne layog rey pha miyao ne idang yao, jimagunde hanyie è ithek shii ji rey yi pha ne khama diig phro! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Hanyie magunde ìujia shii awie pha layog rek arone, ji liak shii ne yua shii rathak boh jia phang srane khamuii bucho hà wo muii pha ji wie liak ro. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mth 18:15</ref></char></note> Ji-è na nyie rek pha ji riig mage bo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Na khuiino è layogthek rek arone giung bo, chiih-è ai layog è iidoh khid arone, aishii khung phi bo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Ai è inai jia shii miley chiieng layog rek magunde, ai è na shii nyawuii khi ne yao, gu ne layog è khid din pha ro è yao arone, na aishii khung phi bo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Migi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Guaphasamoythek è Ithong shii yao, “Gathek ro migi shii boh rab phi bo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Ithong è chang, nathek shii danaro iriie nyama de boh migi um arone nathek hì pha mulbery hingmuii shiide nyayao mua phro nawailum iriing è hug dang ne khamuii bucho hà dun ne sieng ne rai bo! chiih-è ji de ai nyanuii phro.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khiao ro blia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Yangne hanyie magunde ithek ro khiao jia yi raig chog ne shiishai riig. Ai yi raig è dun thog mage shii, ithek è aishii khthiie hì pha michie chie sha bo è yao habey?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Khuchung magunde de ayao phro! Ji phachiang shii, na è aishii yao, guro michie saro sha phi bo, chiihphado è gu achie aniing ched sapho shii ne na nawairo yung wie guii srane gu shii ragia rek bo; chiihphado è na de chie bo. <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Khiao è khama pha blia rek magunde airo muyung nuii rone aishii laso aphi phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Hì duiine na shii de ro; nathek shii nyie yung pha ji zab ji rek ched bie arone, yao bo, gu ne thaluii pha khiao ro; chiih-è gu ne nyie yung pha blia ji rek bie phro.<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è bran sua shii gang phi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Isu awai yi Jerusalem hà rai ne wuiiramuii shii, ai è Samaria nane Galili pha sohthug è dong ne lua. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Ai yi thiig è wuiiramuii shii awiedang hìa è riie pha bran sua shii si. Ithek yi ai è ìujia ruang hà riu ne um, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>chiih-è ziak mage, “Isu! Masdo! Gathek shii de bushun rek bo!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew 14:1-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Isu è ithek shii riig srane ithek shii yao, “Nathek phabi shii wuii srane riig yi bo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Lumuii hà ithek shii so rab phi ro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">So rab bo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Riig bo 5:12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Ithek jia è riig shii ai ne gang rey sha, ai iidoh dun srane goh gang è ziak ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Ai awailum ne buzam Isu lai shii bam srane aishii laso phi. Ji pha bran yi Samarithan ro. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Isu è yao, “Bran sua ne gang reyjong pha ji è; digey ne khi hà lei? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Nyie um ne hì pha fuang pha bran awai ji jia iidoh wuii srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi phlei?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Chiih-è Isu aishii yao, “Jai srane dun mage bo; nawai migi è na shii wie rek phi ro.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung pha Sajathua wuii sharuii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mth 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Giak Pharisithek è Isu shii sai Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ji ne khuchung thog ruii phlei. Ai è ithek shii chang, “Hamangkhung-aphuii pha riichai ne doh yi ne awuii phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Hanyie jia è de ayao mua phro, riig bo, hì ne ichiih um ro! Chiih-è, hì ne thiisa hà um ro; nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ne nathek duchoi shii um ro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nathek rog shii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">din ne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nathek duchoi shii, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">din ne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hamblo shii nathek duchoi hà dong ruii phro.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Chiihphado ai è awai samoythek shii yao, “Ai thog ruii phro” Nathek è Bran Dufuii wuii pha naishii ne luang jia riig yang phro, jishii ithek adoh phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Thiihchiih shii ithek è nathek shii yao ruii phro thiisa hà riig mage bo! chiih-è riig mage bo! Ichiih shii! Jishii nathek wuii srane ariig rabo. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Hamangkhung è haliao jia bliak ne soh iring jia è gai iring jia shii thog pha chuang ruii phro, Bran Dufuii ro inai de ji pha iidoh duiine phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Jishii ai ne igobi ji pha inai shii bajo diig rek srane branthek è aishii ne snai muii phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Igo 6:5-8</ref></char></note> Noah pha ishak ji duiine yi Bran Dufuii pha inaithek de rey ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Igo 7:6-24</ref></char></note> Noah yi run bucho hà akhud sapho shii ne branthek chie niing ne yiy gey ne rai, chiih-è kho khed thog srane zab shii ua muii. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28,29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Igo 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:25">19:25</ref></char></note> Hì ne Loth pha iidoh shii duiine phro. Zab pha branthek chie niing ne, chiih-è pheg liu ne, hai rung ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Ji pha ishak shii loth Sodom è khia dun shii, Hamangkhung è bai nane arem pha now pha chiih srane zab branthek shii hùb ne ua muii phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Hì nyie khi-èrek rey pha ji ne Bran Dufuii dong mage shii de rey ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mth 24:17</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mrg 13:15</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref></char>
    </note> Ji pha naishii hanyie magunde hò pha zak lakhung hà um iang arone nawaithek mana yi pha buzam alung rabo; ji duiine hanyie magunde raig hà um arone iidoh hò hà adun rabo! <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Igo 19:26</ref></char></note> Loth ro yiy shii now mage bo! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mth 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mrg 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lug 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jon 12:25</ref></char></note> “Hanyie magunde awai chai shii ragia rek pha bidiang arone ai ne iy phro; hanyie magunde awai chai shii mua muii arone ragia rey ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Gu nathek shii yao, ji pha habiu shii, bijiu nyi biang jia shii ò men magunde: jia shii ne chiing ne noh dun phro, Gai shii ne thiihchiih thoh marui phro. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35-36"/>Hò-amuii nyi yi phiug ò sui ne rai magunde: Jia shii ne chiing ne noh dun phro, gai jia shii ne iidoh thoh marui phro.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:35-36: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giak shii 36 chodo ro: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bran nyi ne raig shii ò blia rek ruii phro: jia shii ne chiing ne noh ruii phro, gai shii ne iidoh thoh maruii phroth </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig Mth 24:40) </char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:35-36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Samoythek è aishii sai, “Ithong ji ne khi hà lei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Isu è chang, “Khi hà bran iy um lei ne, ji hà biichiingthek de um ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Misiungmuii nane chua pha najang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Chiihphado Isu è ji pha najang è awai samoythek shii idang sia ne lubu ìu arek rabo ne yuaphi. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Thawun jia shii Hamangkhung-aphuii shii de arum chiih-è bran shii de ilab aphi pha chua pha jia um. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Chiih-è ji pha thawun shii misiungmuii de jia rai, ai è aishii nyawuii lumua ne khung ne yao, guro rangsua jishii gu mak pha gidieg è ragia rek phi bo! <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Nai phrak jia ne chua pha bran ji è ji pha blia rek pha anuii phi, iidohhè shii awailum ne yao, gu Hamangkhung-aphuii shii arum magunde chiih-è bran shii lab arek magunde, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>nyieliieshii thiih thog pha hì pha misiungmuii è gu shii diig phi muii, gu airo rangsua ji awai mua yi pha riig chid phi phro. Gu ji arek phi shii ne, ai nyawuii lumua ne iidohhè gu shii jid yi phro!<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Chiih-è de Ithong è yao, nuii bo awie pha chua pha bran ji è nyie yao. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Ji-è hanyie è aishii nong lia srane hanai nane habiu choh srane lia arone, Hamangkhung-aphuii è awai nyu pha bran shii aphi ne bey? Aishii nong rek phi pha ne chia ne bey? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Gu nathek shii yao, ai ne awai nyu pha ji shii ne khthiie chua ne rek phi phro. Jishii Bran Dufuii sohnyiak hà wuii shii migi doh ne bey?<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pharisithek nane mijin thanpho pha najang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Isu hì pha najang yi hanyie è awai shii ne wie ro è yao, chiih-è gaithek shii ne awie ro è yao ne snai ji pha bran shii yao. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>Luang jia shii bran nyie yi Misiahò hà sia pha wuii dun: jia yi Pharisi, chiih-è gai yi mijin thanpho pha ji ro. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Pharisi ji è riu srane awai lubu shii sia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">awai shii yoh riu rone chiih-è sia; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jai srane nawai shii sia bo.</char></note> gu na shii laso phi, Hamangkhung-aphuii, ji è gu ne agiichak ro, anuii pha de arek, chiih-è ithek gai duiine siulao de arek, gu na shii laso phi, nyieliieshii gu ne mijin thanpho duiine de asi ro. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Gu ne habda jia shii danyi minyie nyie phro, chiih-è gu miwiang pha zab ji è de na shii jiasua phi ro.<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Jishii mijin thanpho pha ji è ruang hà riu srane mizia Hamangkhung hà de ahù dang pha awai lubutho shii phe srane yao, Hamangkhung-aphuii layog gu shii de bushun rek bo! <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mth 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lug 14:11</ref></char></note>Isu è yao, gu nathek shii yao, “Ai nyi è hò dun shii Pharisi shii asi pha, mijin thanpho pha ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii rog shii rangsua rey dun. Ji-è hanyie magunde awai shii boh rek arone aishii ne ìu rey ruii phro, chiih-è hanyie magunde awai shii ìu rek arone aishii boh rab ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è aniphiing shii khirzey phi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mth 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mrg 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Giak branthek è aniphiing lakhung shii wad ruii ne khirzey phi yi pha Isu shii noh thog. Samoythek è ithek mirek ji riig srane ithek shii giung, <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Jishii Isu è aniphiing shii awai moe hà ho srane ithek shii yao, aniphiing shii gu hà wuii yi bo, chiih-è ithek shii agak rabo, nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha boh Sajathua pha ji ne hì è rek pho ro ro. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Hì now mage bo! Hanyie-magunde Hamangkhung-aphuii pha boh Sajathua pha ji shii aniphiing duiine acho arone ji pha iliing akhud mua phro.<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bukho bran </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mth 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mrg 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Jewish pha dumuii jia è Isu shii sai, “Wie Masdo, khuchunde a-iy pha chai mua pha gu nyie rek chid phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Isu è aishii yao, “Gu shii nyie re ne wie ro è ho phlei?” Hanyie de wie asi ro, wie ne Hamangkhung-aphuii jia bey ro. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Mul 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Iphy 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Mul 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Iphy 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">Mul 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Iphy 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:16">Mul 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Iphy 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Mul 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Iphy 5:16</ref></char></note>Na ne muyungthek thieg, siulao arek rabo; khishii a-ua rabo; mugo agow rabo; chiih-è hanyie shii de biidiie athe rabo; chiih-è aphuii amuii shii ilab rekbo.<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Bran ji è chang, “Gu ne filiao mujo è hì thek pha miyao ne nuii ne lua phro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Isu è jithek yoi ne, ai è aishii yao, “Thiih de nane blia jia rek chid ba pha um ro. Na shii um pha jithek zab liu srane bang yi dushothek shii phi muii bo, chiih-è na gu rog shii luagieng bo; ji arone nane Hamangkhung hà bajo bukho rey ruii phro.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Jishii ji pha bran è ji pha miyao yoi mage ne, ai ne bajo duhug rey dun, nyieliieshii ai ne bajo bukho.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Ai bajo duhug rek pha ji Isu è riig srane yao, “Bukho branthek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ji hà khud pha ne khama nang ro! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Bukho branthek è Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua hà khud pha ji shii ne ùd è simen cho shii khud pha ji wie liak ba ro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Ai miyao nuii pha branthek è aishii sai, “Chiihphado, hanyie shii ragia rey phlei?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Isu è chang, “Bran è nyie arey mua pha ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è nya rey mua phro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Phithar è yao, riig mage bo! gathek ne hòthek thoh srane na iidoh shii lua gieng.<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Isu è ithek shii yao, gu nathek shii izai yao, hanyie magunde hò, yiy khuiino, aphuii, amuii, ani thoh srane Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha ji shii sow arone <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>duchung pha idam shii de bajo mua ne dinne thog ruii pha idam shii de idang pha chai mua ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è awai iy pha miyao ji uomchiieng yao sha </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mth 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mrg 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Isu è awairo snanyi samoythek shii yoh pha ithua hà noh srane ithek shii yao, “Yoi mage bo! Gethek ne Jerusalem hà wuii sha pha ro, thiisa hà chaigthek è Bran Dufuii chiang shii zey pha ji ne zab izai rey phro. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Aishii ne gai branthek wad shii phi muii chiih-è ai mirek ji nui ne, chiih-è aishii chan cho phro. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Ithek è aishii zuang srane ua muii phro, chiih-è da-uom pha iidoh shii ne chai hòi din phro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Jishii samoythek è ai nyie yao pha ji yi nyie de athieg mua; miyaogamthek sbang ne ithek è ug dun, ji è Isu è nyie yao pha ji agao muii gieng.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è miegthi chayem shii gang phi </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mth 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mrg 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Isu yi Jerikho hà wuiiramuii shii, lumuii hà miegthi jia chayem than ne rai iang. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Ibrogthek yi ai è rek dun pha yoi srane, ai è sai, “Hì nyielei?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Ithek è aishii yao, “Nazareth pha Isu rek ramuii ro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Chiih-è ai choh srane yao, “Isu, Dawid pha dufuii! gu shii de bushun rek bo!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Thiichiih ibi shii um pha branthek è aishii giung srane aishii yao aro dang rabo, jimagunde ai è dinne de ji è lahuak bo ziak ne yao, “Dawid pha dufuii! Gu shii bushun rek bo!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Ji-è Isu thiihchiih riu srane yung, ji pha miegthi shii gu moe hà now mage bo. Ai yi nui hà wuii thog mage shii, Isu è aishii sai, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Gu è na shii nyie rek phi bo è now lei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Ai è chang, “Masdo,” “Gu dinne doh pha now ro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Isu è aishii yao, “Chiihphado doh mage bo! Nawai migi è na shii wie rek ge ro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Thiihchiih shii ai ne doh muii dang dun, chiih-è ai ne Isu rog shii lua gieng srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi. Ibrogthek è ji riig srane ithek de zab Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Isu nane Zakhaeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Isu yi Jerikho è dong ne wuiiramuii shii. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Thiisa hà Zakhaeus beng pha mijin thanpho pha boh bukho jia um. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Ai è Isu hanyie lei ne riig pha bidiang, jimagunde ai ne bran dum buii ne Isu shii ariig mua, nyieliieshii bajo ibrog um. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Ai yi ji pha lumuii è dong ne wuiiramuii rone, ji è ai ne Isu shii riig pha ibrog è ibi hà ran srane sykhamor hingmuii shii wiu. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Isu è ji pha ithua shii wuii thog mage shii, ai laziung riig srane Zakhaeus shii yao, “Khthiie buzam hà lung bo, Zakhaeus, nyieliieshii, sudoh gu ne na hò shii rai pha ro.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zakhaeus è khthiie nyiak hà lung srane bajo lubo ne aishii wie ho. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Zab pha branthek è ji riig srane jao ne mushiiy, “Hì pha bran ne biwen rek ne layogthek hò shii wuii dun ara!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zakhaeus è riu srane Ithong shii yao, “Yoi bo, Masdo! Gu shii nyie um pha ji ne khoyo yie srane gu dushothek shii phi muii pha ro, chiih-è gu hanyie shii magunde nyie khlam ne yie magunde gu iidoh wirang rek ne rang din pha ro.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Isu è aishii yao, “Sudoh ichiih pha hò shii idang pha giawo thog ro, hì pha bran ai de, Abraham pha riing ro, <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mth 18:11</ref></char></note>Bran Dufuii ne shand dun pha ji shii sow pha nane ragia rek wuii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">San sikhithek pha najang </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mth 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mth 25:14-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Branthek yi nyanuii bamuii shii, Isu è athodang pha ji pha najang è dinne ithek shii yao. Ai yi Jerusalem hà thog sharuii, ithek è now shii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua ji ne thog sha ruii ro. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Ji-è ai è yao, luang jia shii bran boh rek pha jia yi gai ruang pha soh hà saja rey ne iidoh hò hà dun din pha phak. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Ai awuii ba pha ibi shii, awai khiao suathek shii ho srane san sikhi ji jia phi srane ithek shii yao, riig bo gu wuii dun pha ishak shii nathek hì pha rog shii Khinyama wiang mua pha ji wiang iang bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Thiih shii awai thiig pha branthek è aishii amiie sha, ji è iidoh aishii yao pha ithek è muaphothek shii thoh ge, gathek ne hì pha bran shii gathek saja rek pha achid sha ro. <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Ji pha bran ne saja rek marui srane iidoh dun thog din. Ai è khthiie awai khiao shii yung srane ai moe shii wuii mage bone yao, nyieliieshii ithek è khama wiang lei ne ji riig pha ho ro. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Igobi shii jia è wuii thog srane yao, ‘Masdo, gu è na miphi pha san sikhi jia rog shii sua wiang doh ge ro.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Ai è yao, wie rek ge ro ‘Na ne khiao wie ro! nane ìu blia shii rangde bajo isiie rek phi, ji è gu na shii rajan sua shii dumuii khoh yi pha ro.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Din ne khiao jia è de wuii thog srane yao, ‘Masdo, gu è na miphi pha san sikhi jia rog shii guii wiang doh phi ro.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Jishii de ai è yao, na shii de rajan guii shii dumuii rek yi phro. <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Gai khiao jia è de wuii thog srane yao, ‘Masdo, naro san sikhi ne ichiih um ro; gu è yung thilek è pham srane ug ne ruii phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Gu ne na shii rum, nyieliieshii nane bajo nang bran ro. Na ne naro asi pha ji de na è yie muii, chiih-è na è ahai magunde na è riug ne yie muii.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Ai è aishii yao, nane awie pha khiao ro! Gu ne nawai sem pha miyaogamthek ji è nawai shii the ruii phro! Gu ne nang ro è nane thieg, chiih-è gu ro asi magunde gu è yie muii, gu miihai asi magunde gu è riug maphi. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Chiihphado na gu ro bang shii nyie rek ne beng hà achab aruii phi lei? Chiihphado gu iidoh dun thog shii gu ne ji pha rog shii phua mua ne iidoh nya yie din. <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Chiihphado shii ai è hanyie thiichiih riu ne um phothek shii yao, ‘San sikhi ai è yie srane hanyie shii sikhi sua um pha ji shii phi muii bo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Jishii ithek è aishii yao, ‘Masdo, aishii ne sikhi sua umjong ro!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mth 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mrg 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lug 8:18</ref></char></note>Ai è chang, gu nathek shii yao ‘Hanyie shii um magunde aishii ne dinne phi din ruii phro, jimagunde hanyie shii oi magunde aishii ìujia um pha ji de yie din muii phro. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Thuh shii, hanyie guro mak phothek è gu shii ithek saja rey bo è achid pho shii de gu moe shii noh srane zab ua muii bo!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bohlubo rek ne Jerusalem hà thog</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mth 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mrg 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Isu è ji yao ched pha iidoh shii Isu yi ithek ibi Jerusalem hà wuiiramuii. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Ai è sumaro pha phiing Bethphach nane Bethany hà wuii thog mage shii, ai è samoy nyi shii yung srane ibi thoh ge: <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>Ibi pha thiig hà wuii mage bo chiih-è iliing hà wuii thog shii, thiisa hà hanyie de a-in ba pha bambao jia phang ne um pha doh ruii phro. Ji pha bambao shii sey ne isa yie ruii bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Nathek shii hanyie magunde ji pha bambao shii nyie rek pha sey phlei ne sai ruii arone nathek è aishii yao bo, hì ne Masdo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Masdo shii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ji ne muspho.</char></note> è chid muii ro.<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Ithek thiisa hà wuii dun shii Isu è nyie khi-èrek yao lei ne ji duiine mua. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Ithek yi bambao phang ne um pha ji sey ramuii shii, ji pha muspho è ithek shii sai nathek ji nyie rek pha sey phlei? <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Ithek è chang, “Ithong è chid muii ro,” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Chiih-è ithek è bambao shii Isu hà noh ne dun thog. Chiihphado shii ithek ro yung bambao lakhung shii gow srane Isu shii in pha nong ba yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Ai è lakhung shii in mage shii, ithek è ibi lumuii hà yung wiao phi iang. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Ai Jerusalem hà sumaro um pha phiing buzam hà wuii pha lumuii shii thog mage shii, ai samoythek è zab blia bohthek doh pha ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii laso phi ne chiih-è aishii goh boh è ziak srane chiong phi: <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Chng 118:26</ref></char></note>“Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie yi Ithong beng è wuii pho shii ne khirzey phi bo! Hamangkhung hà liijiing nane Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biisiie rey bo!” <verse eid="LUK 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Chiihphado shii ibrog è giak Pharisithek è Isu shii yao. “Masdo,” ithek è yao, “Naro samoy shii aro rabo è yung mage bo!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Isu è chang, “Gu nathek shii yao phro ithek è aro pha rai arone, lubaothek awailum ne jao ne ziak ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Jerusalem shii choh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Ai ji pha rajan moe hà wuii thog mage shii, chiih-è ai ji pha rajan shii riig srane choh, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>ne yao, nathek sudoh shii liijiing ne khama mugak ji thieg arone! Jishii thuh shii nathek ne ariig mua sha phro! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Nathek gidiegpho è nathek shii zab pha ithua gung srane nathek lumuii shii de zab bin maphi pha ishak de thog ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Ithek è nathek shii zab mua muii phro chiih-è branthek è nathek ro chan muthua shii de chuakbraig srane ji pha ithua shii lubao jia de aruii phro, nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii è ithek shii ragia rek wuii shii ithek è ishak athieg!<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Misiahò hà wuii dun </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mth 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mrg 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Chiihphado è Isu Misiahò iliing hà wuii srane chong rek pho shii fuang hà gieng mage, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Aij 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jeri 7:11</ref></char></note>Ithek shii yao, “Hamangkhung-aphuii miyao ji ne ichiih jigigam shii zey ne um ro, Guro Misiahò ji ne sia pha hò ro è yao phro. Jishii ithek è mugothek ug ne rai pha hò rab muii!” <verse eid="LUK 19:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Lug 21:37</ref></char></note>Nai tham ne Misiahò shii yua, phabi wegthek, Iphey yao pha masdothek, chiih-è dumuii branthek è aishii ua pha now, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Jishii ithek è aishii ji è rek pha nyie lumuii adoh phi, nyieliieshii zab bran è miyaogam jia de amuii yi pha airo miyao ji isiie è yoi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Isu ro riichai chiang pha mushai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mth 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mrg 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Nai jia Isu yi Misiahò shii yua srane Mua Wie yao ramuii shii, boh phabi nane Iphey yao pha masdothek nane dukhothek branthek sha hà ò shii wuii thog ruii <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>chiih-è ithek è aishii yao, “Gathek shii yao riig, na shii hì pha blia rek pha rangsua hanyie miphi lei?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Isu è ithek shii chang, “Gu de nathek shii mushai sai riig. Yao riig, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Jon Khowo phi pha rangsua ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è wuii ne ba asi pha bran è wuii ne ba?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Awaithek chung jao ne khnaing rai, gethek nyie khi-èrek chang sharai pha lei? Gethek è ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è wuii phro è yao arone, ai ne gethek shii yao din ruii, nyie rek ne, ji arone, ithek Jon shii migi arek lei? <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Jishii Jon ne bran è wuii phro è yao arone ichiih um pha bran phiing è gethek shii ne labao rek ne chao phro, nyieliieshii ithek ne Jon shii ne chaig ro è thieg. <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Jishii ithek è chang, gathek ne athieg ro Jon ro rangsua ne khi è thog.<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Chiih-è Isu è de ithek shii chang, ji arone, gu de nathek shii ayao phro, Gu è hì pha blia nyie rangsua è rek pha ji.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Raigphothek pha najang </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mth 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mrg 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Aij 5:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chiihphado shii Isu è branthek shii ji pha najang ji yao: Luang jia shii bran jia è raig shii angur hai srane, chiih-è raig rek pha gai bran shii raig chui marui srane ruang hà wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Angurthek khrab pha ishak thog mage shii ai è awai khiao jia shii raig chei phi pho shii airo mathang yamiing yie pha thoh ge. Jishii raig chei pho è khiao jishii ne zuang srane nyie de aphi pha iidoh thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Ji-è gai khiao jia shii thoh ge; jimagunde raig chei phothek è aishii zuang srane, chiih-è biwo yao srane aishii de isloi iidoh hà thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Chiihphado shii dinne awai khiao yoh jiashii de thoh bage ba, chiih-è raig chei pha bran è aishii de bajo zuang srane, chiih-è fuang hà fenmuii. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Chiihphado, angur raig muspho è yao, gu nyie khi-èrek sha phaga? Gu gui ro bushun dufuii shii thoh sha ge phro; ji arone ithek aishii ne ilab phi rek! <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Jishii raig chei pho è aishii riig mage ne awaithek chung yao rai, hì ne raig ithong pha dufuii ro. Ji-è cho gethek ne aishii ua muii haro, chiih-è airo nuruii ne gethek ro rey phro! <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Ji-è ithek aishii angur raig è fuang hà noh srane aishii ua muii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Isu è sai, ji è rek mage shii ji pha raig muspho è raig chei phothek shii nyie rek phlei? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>“Ai ne wuii srane ji pha branthek shii ua muii phro, chiih-è angur raig yi gai raig chei phothek wad shii phi muii phro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ithek è ji yoi mage shii, ithek è yao, “Ji duiine arey dang rabo!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Chng 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isu è ithek shii riig srane sai, “Chiihphado, hì pha jigigam ne nyie zey phlei? ‘Rung phothek è lubao shii awie ro è snai muii pha ji ne dinne zab è bajo mugak lubao rey din.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Hanyie magunde ji pha lubao lakhung shii chiih arone ismed rey dun phro; chiih-è ji pha lubao è hanyie lakhung shii chiih magunde, aishii ihab rey dang pha chao dun phro.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mijin phi pha chiang pha musai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mth 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mrg 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Iphey yao pha masdothek nane boh phabithek Isu è ji pha miyao ne ithek shii gidieg rek ne yao phrone thieg ne ji pha ithua shii zum pha bidiang, jimagunde ithek ne branthek shii rum. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Ji-è ithek ne jo mua pha ji riig ne rai. Ithek è giak branthek shii Lugu phi ne ithek shii bran isiie rone doh yi, chiih-è ithek è jithek shii Isu shii mushai sai ne ichag sow pha thoh ge, ji è ithek è aishii ne Roman Badri pha blu nane riichai shii phi muii pha rek. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Ji pha bujuiiphothek è Isu shii yao, “Masdo, gathek ne thieg na è nyie yua nyie yao pha ji ne izai chak ro, chiih-è gathek ne thieg nane bran boh ìu um ne de achua, jimagunde nane Hamangkhung-aphuii è branthek shii nyie chid pha izai ji yua. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Gathek shii yao riig bo, gathek è Roman Bisiu shii mijin phi pha ji ne Iphey shii zen ne ba, asi azen ba?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Jishii Isu è ithek mirek pha ichiig jishii wie riig srane ithek shii yao, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>Gu shii liiman pha sikhi jia riig yi mage. Hì shii hanyie midong nane hanyie beng zey ne um lei? Ithek è chang, hì ne Bisiu beng zey ne um ro. <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Ji-è Isu è yao, “Chiihphado, wie, nyie yi Bisiu ro awai shii phi bo, chiih-è nyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii ro awai shii phi bo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Thiihchiih branthek ibi shii aishii azum mua, ji è ithek aro dang pha rai srane, Isu muchang ji nuii ne wiengphleg dun.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iy ne hòi din pha chiang shii sai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mth 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mrg 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Blk 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chiihphado bran yi iy ne ahòi din phro è yao pha ji shii izai anow pha giak Sadusithek wuii thog srane Isu shii yao, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Iphy 25:5</ref></char></note>Masdo, Moses è hì è yao ne gathek shii zey ne zen marui: bran jia iy dun shii ai yiy yi ani agiak ba pha thoh marui arone, ji pha misiungmuii shii ne ji pha bran ikhuii è yie ne ani nya giak mua phro ji pha arone iy dun pha bran pha ani rey phro. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Luang jia ithek khuiino miley um shii; zab è dukho ji è yiy yie srane ani agiak ba pha iydun, <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>chiihphado è ji pha hò-amuii shii sulong nyi pha ikhuii è ji pha hò-amuii shii yie din, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>chiih-è dinne uom pha ji è de ji è rek, ji duiine zab khuiino miley shii de ji è rey dun ne ithek ne ani agiak pha iy dun, <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>iidohhè shii ji pha hò-amuii de iy dun. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Ji-è iy ne hòi din pha inai thog mage shii, ithek miley è yiejong pha hò-amuii ji ne hanyie ro yiy rey phlei?<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Isu è ithek shii chang, “Sieng pha ishak shii ne hò-aphuii hò-amuii ne ayiy agey rai phro, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Jishii giong hò-aphuii hò-amuii dinne thog pha ishak shii iyjong hòi din mage shii ne ayie agey sharai phro. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Ithek ne hamangkhliie duiine rey dun phro chiih-è khuchung de a-iy mua phro. Ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha dufuii rey sha phro, nyieliieshii ithek ne iy pha ji è hòijong ge ro. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Mul 3:6</ref></char></note> Chiih-è iy ne hòi din phro è Moses è wie doh yijong ro, jigigam shii de zey ne um ro ai è baihang pha jabiing shii Ithong pha miyao ne Abraham pha Hamangkhung-aphuii, Isakh pha Hamangkhung-aphuii, chiih-è Jakhob pha Hamangkhung-aphuii, shii yao. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ai ne sieng pha Hamangkhung-aphuii ro, iy pha asi ro, ai pha chiang è zab sieng mua phro.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Iphey yao masdo giak è yao, “Masdo, wie chang ro!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>ji è ithek ne aishii dinne miyao asai mua.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi chiang mushai sai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mth 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mrg 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Isu è ithek shii sai, hì ne nyie khi-èrek ne Masi ne Dawid riing ro è yao mua phlei? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42,43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Chng 110:1</ref></char></note> Dawid awai è sthun jigigam shii yao, Ithong è gui Ithong shii yao: Gui phazoi shii dug bo. <verse eid="LUK 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>Gu è na mak pho shii na lai iliing hà aruii sapho shii ne. <verse eid="LUK 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Dawid è aishii Ithong ro ho; chiihphado, khi-èrek ne Masi ne Dawid ro riing rey phlei?<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Iphey yua pha masdothek shii phriie </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mth 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrg 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Branthek zab aishii yoi ramuii shii, Isu è awai samoythek shii yao, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>Iphey yua pha Masdothek è nowbthan ne rai bo, ithek ne yung phiang guii srane lua yang bie ne bajarai hà ithek shii khung ne ilab phi pha ji shii bajo miie; chiih-è Jewish misiahòthek hà de ithua wie gua ne dug, chiih-è michie chie pha ishak shii de ithua wie shii gua ne dug. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Hanyie thek ne misiungthek è phua srane ithek hò shii riao maphi, chiih-è briig yi pha misiathek de bajo phiang sia! Ithek shii ne zab awiedang pha lago phi ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Misiung muii pha mizid </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mrg 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Isu è shan ne riig ramuii shii bukho branthek de Jewthek misiahò pha mizid japho ji shii lasen chabramuii pha doh, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Ai è bajo dusho misiungmuii de thama sikhi ididuii nyi chabramuii pha doh. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Ai è yao, gu nathek shii yao phro, ithek gai è de ji pha dusho misiungmuii è bajo chab ba ro. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Ithek miphi pha ji ne awaithek bukho rey ched ne khe pha ji è phi phro; jimagunde ai ne dusho magunde awai shii nyie um pha ji zab phi muii phro.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Misiahò chuak pha ji yao </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mth 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mrg 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Giak samoythek è Misiahò pha chiang ji yao ramuii, hì pha wie pha lubao nane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii lasen zud pha ji ne khama khie dohramuii ro. Isu è yao. <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>Zab pha nathek dohramuii pha ji ne doh jia ichiih pha ithua shii iphen jia rang de aled pha ishak thog ruii phro; zab shii buzam chuak dun phro.<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duhug nane diigchiao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mth 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mrg 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Ithek è sai, Masdo, “Hì ne khuchung rey ruii phlei? Chiih-è ji pha ishak thog sha ro è nyie khi-èrek ne doh yi phlei?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Isu è yao, “Nowbthan ne rai bo; nathek shii akhlam yi rabo. Gu beng è bajo branthek wuii ruii srane yao phro, gu ne ai ro! Chiih-è, Ai ne thog ro, jimagunde ithek miyao anuii rabo. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Chiih-è mak rek rai ne gui rai dun pha yoi magunde nathek arum chid rabo, jithek ne igobi rey ruii pha chak ro, jimagunde jithek è jong pha ishak arey pha ro.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Ai è yao ramuii, thiigpho chung de mak rek rai phro; zab riichai pho awaithek chung de mak rek rai phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Jishii, sajiib de awiedang pha sam ruii phro, chiih-è chie niing pha oi pha rey ruii phro, chiih-è muathek thog ruii phro, chiih-è hamang è de khuchung de adoh ba pha nane rum pha blia doh ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Hì thek rey pha ibi shii, gu chiang è nathek shii zum srane diig phi ruii phro; Nathek shii Jewthek misiahò hà miyao che ne sai ruii phro chiih-è phatheg hà de chab muii phro; nathek shii sajathek nane bohkhohphothek ibi shii noh ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Jine Mua Wie yao ithek ro pha chua ro. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14,15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Lug 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char></note>Nawaithek khani shii khriig rek bi ne nawaithek shii khi-èrek ne ragia rek chid pha ji ne munow athiig chid rabo, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>nyieliieshii gu naro mak phothek è achang mua dang pha miyaogamthek nane khani phi ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Nathek shii ne nawaithek aphuii amuii, nawaithek khuiinothek, nawaithek siangthangthek, chiih-è nawaithek ijakthek shii phi muii phro; chiih-è nathek giak shii ne ua muii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Gu chiang è nathek shii khiijai pha rek ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Jishii nathek ro khrug è khaziang iphen jia de ashan yi phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Chuh è riu bo, ji arone nathek ne ragia rek mua phro.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu è Jerusalem chuak dun pha miyao ji yao </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mth 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mrg 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>Nathek Jerusalem shii armingthek shand ne riu pha doh arone nathek ne thieg bo Jerusalem ne jog chuak dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Chiihphado è Judea shii um phothek ne phiingduii hà yoh chid phro, chiih-è hanyie rajan shii um phothek ne ji pha rajan ji thoh chid phro, chiih-è hanyie yi soh è fuang hà um pho ne ji pha rajan iliing hà awuii rabo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref></char></note>Ji ne lago pha inaithek ro, jigigam shii nyie zey pha ji ne izai rey yi phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Ji pha inai shii ne lui shii ani wiig pha hò-amuii nane ani ìu um pha amuiithek ne khama diig rey ruii phro! Chiih-è soh lakhung shii diig thog ruii phro, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro lago ne jipha branthek shii thog ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Giak shii ne khamriie è ua muii phro, chiih-è giak shii ne zum srane phatheg hà chab ne zab pha soh hà noh dun phro; chiih-è nathek ishak athog sapho shii ne Jerusalem hà Hamangkhung-aphuii shii athieg pha branthek lai iliing hà ruii muii phro.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bran dufuii wuii ruii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mth 24:29</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mrg 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Aij 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezkh 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Jol 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Dng 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref></char>
    </note> Thiisa hà hasiang, habie nane dadiang de khuchung de arey pha ji rey dun phro. Ichiih sohnyiak pha zab soh ne nyie arek muluii pha khamuiiboh munoi ji è de rum dum phro, chiih-è khamuiiboh mujiiao ji de boh boh rey dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Chiih-è ithek è rum srane sohnyiak shii diig thog ruii pha miyao ji khan srane iytho rey dun phro, hamangkhung pha bluthek pha ithek ro blia de sid dun phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Dng 1:7</ref></char></note>Chiihphado Bran Dufuii ne bajoboh blu nane biisiie rog sakhamiing è wuii ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Jithek pha ishak jao ne rey mage shii ithek jaifad srane khrug laziung hù bo, nyieliieshii ithek giawo ne nui sha ro.<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iphem hingmmuii pha muyua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mth 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-32">Mrg 13:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Chiihphado Isu è ithek shii ji pha najang è yao, Iphem hingmuii shii nane gai pha hingmuiithek shii now mage bo. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Nathek è ithek irab jao ne nyiu pha doh mage shii haluadam ne nui rey sha rone ithek ne thieg. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Ji duiine, nathek è ji rey pha doh mage shii nathek de thieg iang bo, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Sajathua ji ne nui thog sha ruii ro. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Now bo, hì thek pha zab miyao ne arey sapho shii ne ichiih rai pha branthek a-iy ba phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Hamang nane sohnyiak ne san dun phro, jimagunde gu miyaogamthek ne khuchung de ashan phro.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Riig chid phro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Nawaithek shii nowbthan ne rai bo, ithek bajo chie niing pha nane hì pha shud nawaithek sieng pha muno diig ne bajo ong ne aruii rabo, chiih-è ji pha ishak ne nathek shii zum pha ji ne hamblo è thog ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Hì è rek phane zab pha sohnyiak pha branthek shii thog ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Nowbthan ne idang sia ne chuh rey ne nyie rey ramuii pha ji è nathek yi ragia rek ne Bran Dufuii ibi shii riu mua pha rek bo.<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lug 19:47</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isu è ji pha inai ishak phi srane Misiahò shii yua, chiih-è habuzuang rey mage shii ji pha habiu shii sumaro phiing hà rai pha wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Hamiang rey mage shii branthek Misiahò hà airo miyaogam ji yoi pha wuii dun.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Branthek è Isu shii gidieg rek </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mth 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mrg 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Mul 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sai ne Phiia ajiie pha Iweb chie pha ishak nui thog shii, nyie yi Hiiadun pha ji ro. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Khophabi nane Iphey yua pha masdothek ne branthek shii rum, chiih-è ithek ne ug ne Isu shii ua muii pha lumuii mua bidiang.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas è Isu shii zum pha nuii </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mth 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-14">Mrg 14:10-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Chiihphado sakhathong è Judas iliing shii khud, snanyi Samoythek è jia shii hanyie shii Iskharioth ro è beng muii pha ji ro. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Ji-è Judas yi boh phabi shii nane misiahò khan pha dumuiithek shii wuii srane Isu shii nyie khi-èrek ne zum mua ne ithek shii phi mua pha ji yao.<verse eid="LUK 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Ithek ne sang ne aishii bang phi pha ro è yao. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Judas è ji nuii srane jao ne soh, chiih-è branthek è athieg yi pha chua wie shii Isu shii zum ne ithek shii phi pha rek.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hiìadun pha ji shii chie pha michie saro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mth 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mrg 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Sai ne Phiia ajiie pha iweb chie pha inai thog mage shii Hiìadun pha ji shii chie pha shiishaiduiithek ua. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Isu è Phithar nane Jon shii airo Hiìadun pha michie ji khriig rek iang bo è yung ne thoh ge.<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Ithek è aishii sai, na è gathek shii khi hà khriig rek bo è yang lei?<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Ai è chang, nathek rajan iliing hà wuii thog shii, hò-aphuii jia kho jariie han pha si ruii phro. Ai khi pha hò shii khud lei ne ai iidoh shii khud gieng bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Chiih-è hò muspho jishii sai bo, Masdo è yao muii ro, ithong nane samoythek Hiìadun pha michie chie pha ùgud khi hà lei? <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Ai è nathek shii lakhung pha iiguno hà boh wie ùgud jia doh yi phro, thiisa hà zab khriig rek ne ruii pha mua phro. <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Isu è ithek shii nyie khi-èrek yao lei ne ji duiine doh chiih-è ithek Hiìadun pha michie deb rek iang.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ithong ro michie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mth 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:23-25">Mrg 14:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Ishak thog mage shii, Isu è awai rog shii boh pha samoythek noh ne thiibliie shii dug. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Ai è ithek shii yao, guro diig rey pha ishak athog ba pha ibi shii gu ithek rog shii dug ne Hiìadun pha ji chie pha now ro! <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Ji-è gu nathek shii yao, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Sajathua pha miyao ji izai arey sapho shii ne gu dinne achie phro.<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Chiihphado Isu è gog ji chiing srane, Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi ne chiih-è yao, “Hì pha gog yie srane nawaithek chung thang ne niing bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Gu nathek shii yao phro Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Sajathua pha ji athog sapho shii ne gu hì pha phuii aniing phro.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Chiihphado ai è iweb dum jia chiing srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi ne ji srane, ithek shii phi ne yao, “Nathek shii phi pha iweb hì ne guro siu ro. Gu shii now pha hì rek bo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jeri 31:31-34</ref></char></note>Ji duiine iweb pha ido shii ai è ithek shii gog phi ne yao, nathek shii thoi ramuii pha hì pha gog ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro iwo shiinyie shii guro ifai è cheb rek ne phi phro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne Isu Idoh pha miyaogam oi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hine guro siu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">19 shii, chiih-è zab ne 20 shii</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Chng 41:9</ref></char></note>“Jishii riig bo! Hanyie è gu shii zum yi pha rek pha ji ne ichiih gu rog thiibliie shii dug ne um ro! <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Bran Dufuii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è yang pha duiine iy phro, jimagunde gu shii zum pho ne khama diig rey ruii phro!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Chiihphado awaithek chung jao ne sai rai, hì è rek ramuii pha ji ne hanyie lei?<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Boh chiang shii khnaing rai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mth 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mrg 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Lug 9:46</ref></char>
    </note>Chiih-è ithek duchoi shii hanyie boh lei ne sai srane awaithek chung khnaing rai. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25,26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mth 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mrg 10:42-44</ref></char></note> Isu è ithek shii yao, Hamangkhung-aphuii shii athieg pha sajathek ne branthek lakhung shii blu rek, chiih-è bohkhohphothek è yao gathek ne branthek pha ijak ro. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mth 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mrg 9:35</ref></char></note> Jishii hì duiine nathek ne arek rabo; ji è nathek duchoi shii hanyie boh ji ne zab è ìu rey ruii phro, chiih-è dumuii ne khiao rey phro. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Jon 13:12-15</ref></char></note>Chiih-è boh ne hanyie ga, chie ne dug pha ji boh ba, chiih-è michie phi pha ji boh ba? Dug pha jia ji boh ro. Jishii gu ne ithek duchoi shii khiao duiine ro. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Nathek de gu diigchiao rek shii gu rog shii um gieng; <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Chiih-è gu aphuii è gu shii bohkhoh pha rangsua phi pha duiine, nathek shii de gu è ji duii pha rangsua phi phro. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mth 19:28</ref></char></note>Nathek de guro Sajathua hà guro thiibliie shii chie niing ne rai ruii phro, chiih-è nathek ne biangthek shii dug srane Israel pha snanyi jadthek shii bohkhoh ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phithar è athieg ro è yao pha ji Isu è chaig </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mth 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-37">Mrg 14:27-37</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Simon, Simon! Yoi mage bo! raigpho è phiug shii igam è isug shii yoh rek pha duiine ithek shii wie è awie pha ji è yoh rek pha Sakhathong è rangsua muajong ro. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Jishii Simon, naro migi è achiih yi pha, gu na shii siajong phi ro, chiih-è na ne gu shii iidoh khid shii na nawai khuiinothek shii migi chuh rek noh bo.<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Phithar è chang, “Ithong, gu de narog shii phatheg hà wuii ne narog shii iy gieng pha deb ro!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Isu è yao, gu na shii yao, Phithar, “Khe a-ìo ba pha ibi shii na è gu shii athieg ro è uom chiing yao ruii phro.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biia, baneb nane khamriie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mth 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mrg 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Lug 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char>
    </note>Chiihphado Isu è awai samoythek shii sai, gu è nathek shii biia, baneb nane lakhia ayie yi pha thoh ge pha ishak shii ithek asiok pha rey ne bey? Ithek è chang, gathek shii nyie de diig arey ro. <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>“Jishii thiih” shii ne, Isu è yao, hanyie shii biia nane baneb um phothek yie ruii bo; chiih-è hanyie shii khamriie oi arone nawaithek yung liu srane muduii pheg ne yie ne wuii bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Aij 53:12</ref></char></note>Ji-è gu nathek shii yao, jigigam shii yao pha duiine, aishii ne mugo pho rog shii luajong muii ro. Gu shii nyie yao pha ji ne izai rey phro, nyieliieshii jigigam shii zey pha ji ne izai thog ruii ro.<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Samoy jia è yao, riig mage bo Ithong! Ichiih shii khamriiethek nyi um ro, ai è chang,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:38: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hì khriig; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hì nama.</char></note> ji nyia ne khriig sha phro.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu samaro phiing hà sia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mth 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrg 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Isu ji pha rajan shii thoh srane idang awai mirek pha ji duiine sumaro phiing hà wuii dun, chiih-è samoythek de ai rog shii wuii gieng. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Ithek ji pha ithua hà thog mage shii, ai è ithek shii yao, “Nathek shii chuajan hà achiih yi pha sia bo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Chiihphado è ai ithek è lubao fen shii nyathog mua sapho ruang hà wuii srane lagiung niing ne sia. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>Ai è yao, “Aphuii,” Na è yang arone hì pha diig gog ne gu è yie muii bo. Jishii gu miiyang è asi ro, na miiyang ji rey bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Hamangkhliie shii jia è wuii thog srane aishii chuh rek phi. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Din ne de ai lubu bajo diig now srane bajo gang è siaramuii shii; airo hanyua ne ifai chen pha duiine nyiak lakhung shii chenramuii ro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne oi ro 43-44.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Ai sia ched srane iidoh dun shii, airo samoythek yi duhug rek srane men pha doh. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Ai è ithek shii yao, nathek nyie rek ne men phlei? Nathek sieng srane chuajan hà achiih yi pha sia mage bo.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii zum </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mth 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrg 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jon 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Isu ji yao ramuii shii snanyi Samoythek è jia Judas beng muii pha ji è bran iphiing shii noh srane, Isu shii wuii ne ai mizia shii khichiug. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Jishii Isu è yao, “Judas, nane mizia khichiug srane Bran Dufuii shii zum ne bey?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Hanyie ai rog shii um pha samoythek è nyie reyramuii pha ji riig srane, ithek è Isu shii sai, “Ithong khamriiethek rek ne ithek shii che mage habey?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Chiih-è samoy jia è Kho Phabi pha khiao jia shii airo phazoi pha kho hab chie mage.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Jishii Isu è yao, “Ji khriig sha phro!” Ai è ji pha bran kho shii khoh srane gang phi.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Chiihphado Isu è boh phabi shii chiih-è Jewthek misiahò ragia rek pha dukhothek nane ragia rekpho nane kho thiihchiih aishii sow pha wuiiphothek shii sai, nathek gu shii mugo pho ro è now srane khamriiethek nane muchang yie ne wuii ne bey? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lug 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note>Gu ne idang nathek rog Misiahò shii rai, jishii nathek è gu shii zum pha abidiang. Igiia pha blu è bokho mage shii, jishii nathek ishak ne hì bey?<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phithar è Isu athieg ro snai </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57">Mth 26:57</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Mrg 14:53</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jon 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Ithek è Isu shii zum srane kho phabithek hò hà noh dun shii Phithar de ruang è ai iidoh luagieng. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Sibiang pha duchoi shii bai fu srane ithek ang ne rairamuii shii Phithar de ithek rog shii bai anggieng. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Khiao bimi jia è ai thiihchiih shii ithek rog shii dug ne rai pha doh mage shii ai è wie riig srane yao, hì pha bran de Isu rog shii um phro.<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Jishii Phithar è asi ro è yao, “Hò-amuii jishii yao, gu ne aishii athieg ro!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Iùjia pha iidoh shii bran jia è Phithar shii riig srane yao, “Na de ai rog shii um phade ne!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Jishii Phithar è ji pha bran shii chang, “gu asi ro!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Chiih-è ishak jia rey pha iidoh shii gai bran jia è de sriid è yao, hì pha bran de izai Isu rog shii um chak ro, nyieliieshii ai de Galili ro.<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Jishii Phithar è ji pha bran shii chang, na nyie yao ramuii pha ji ne gu athieg ro!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Ai ji nya yao ramuii shii khthiie khe de èo dang phro. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Ithong è Phithar shii rei srane wie riig mage shii, Phithar shii Ithong è aishii sudoh biu khe phuii a-ìo ba pha ibi shii na gu shii uomchiieng athieg ro è yao ruii phro è yao pha ji now khlei. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Phithar fuang hà wuii srane bajo khiwegkho ne cho.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii zuang srane makhakriing rek </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mth 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mrg 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Isu shii ragia rek pha bran ji è aishii zuang srane ai mirek jithek nui. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Ithek è ai mieg shii chiieg srane aishii sai, na shii hanyie muzuang lei? Than riig bo! <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Ithek è aishii bajo makhakriing yao.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii limiang moe hà noh </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mth 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mrg 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Hamiang rey mage shii, dukhothek, boh phabithek nane Iphey yua pha masdothek ò si, chiih-è Isu shii limiang moe hà noh. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Ithek è yao, “Gathek shii yao riig bo,” Na ne Masi bey? Ai è chang, gu è nathek shii yao magunde, nathek è gu shii migi anow phro; <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Chiih-è gu ithek shii musai sai magunde nathek gu shii achang phro. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Jishii sudoh è thiwing Bran Dufuii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Bohblu pha ji pha phazoi shii dug ruii phro. <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ithek zab è aishii yao, “Chiihphado, na ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Dufuii bey?” Ai è ithek shii chang, nathek è yao arone gu ne ji chak ro.<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Chiih-è ithek è yao, “Gathek ne na chiang shii dinne a-ìd chid sha, ai è nyie yao pha ji ne gathek è yoi jong.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Isu shii Philath ibi hà noh </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mth 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mrg 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jon 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Zab pha ibrog è jai srane Isu shii Philath ibi hà noh ne, <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>ithek è jao ne aishii the, hì pha bran è gathek bran shii asi pha lumuii hà noh ne Bisiuthek shii de mijin athan chid rabo è yao phro chiih-è awai shii Masi, saja ro è yao pha chiang è zum phro.<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Philath è aishii sai, “Na ne Jewthek pha saja bey?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Na è ji è yao arone gu ne ji chak ro.<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Chiihphado Philath è boh phabi nane bran ibrogthek shii yao, gu ne hì pha bran shii the mua pha nyie ichiig adoh phi ro.<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Jishii ithek bajo sriid è yao, ai awairo muyua ji è zab pha Judea pha branthek shii srobro rek. Ai Galili hà jao srane thuh shii ichiih de wuii thog sha dun ro.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii Herod ibi shii thoh ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Philath è ji yoi srane, ai è sai, “Hì pha bran yi Galilean chak bey?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Ithek è Isu ne Herod è bohkhoh pha ithua pha ro è thieg mage shii, ithek è aishii Herod hà thoh ge, ji pha ishak shii awai de Jerusalem shii um. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herod è Isu shii riig mage shii bajo sang, nyieliieshii ai è ai chiang yoi srane ai Isu shii bajo inai è riig yang. Ai ne luthong ne Isu ro buang pha blia riig yang. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Ji-è Herod è Isu shii mushai bajo sai, jimagunde Isu è nyie de achang phi. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Kho phabi nane Iphey yua pha masdothek è dinne sriid rek srane Isu shii gidieg rek ne gang è the. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herod nane airo siphahithek è Isu makhakriing srane the yao; chiihphado ithek è aishii yung wie guii phi srane iidoh Philath shii thoh ge. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Ji pha iidoh shii Philath nane Herod de ijak rey khlei dun; ji pha inai ibi shii awaisa chung de shuang ro.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii iy yi pha yao </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mth 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mrg 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Philath è kho phabi shii, dumuiithek shii nane branthek shii ò shii ho, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>chiih-è ithek shii yao, “Ai è branthek shii asi pha lumuii shii noh ne lua phro è yao ne ithek è hì pha bran shii gu hà noh thog. Thiih, ichiih shii nawaithek de gu moe shii gu è aishii bujuii shii, chiih-è ithek è aishii the pha ji è ne ichiig adoh phi ro. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Herod è de aishii nyie ichiig adoh phi, ji è ai ne iidoh gathek shii thoh ge. Hì pha bran shii iy yi sapho nyie ichiig oi ro. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Ji-è gu aishii zuang srane dun ge yi pha ro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne lao 17: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">shii iy yi sbo nyie ichiig oi ro</char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig Mrg 15:6)</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Hiìadun pha ishak shii idang Philath è ithek ro phatheg pha bran jia shii thoh.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Zab pha ibrogthek è gang ziak, “Aishii ne ua muii bo è yao! Chiih-è Barabas shii thoh ne gathek shii phi bo!” (<verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barabas shii phatheg hà chab pha ji ne ai è rajan shii awie pha blia rek chiih-è bran shii ua, ji è aishii ne phatheg hà chab phro.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Philath è Isu shii sey ne thoh yang srane ji è branthek shii wie è yao. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Jishii de ithek è iidoh ziak dinne yao, “Aishii zun muii bo! Aishii zun muii bo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Philath è ithek shii uomchiieng yao sha, jimagunde ai ne nyie buii blia rek mua lei? Gu ne aishii ua sapho nyie ichiig adoh phi ro! Gu aishii zuang srane thoh mua pha ro.<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Jishii ithek è bajo gang è ziak srane yao, Isu shii ne zun chid phro. Chiih-è iidohhè ithek miziak ji ne yang ge. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Ji-è Philath è ithek è Isu shii zun bo è lia pha ji shii ruii mua. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Ai è ithek chid pha bran jishii sey ne thoh phi hanyie è buii rek srane bran shii ua mua pha chiang è phatheg shii chab mua, chiih-è ai è nawaithek nyie rek yang pha ji rek bo è yao srane Isu shii ithek wad shii phi mua.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ne zun muii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mth 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mrg 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Siphahithek è Isu shii noh ramuii shii, Simon beng pha Khyren soh pha rajan è wuii ramuii shii ithek è aishii si. Ithek è zum srane aishii de bai ji han yi ne Isu iidoh shii lua ba yi. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Bran iphiingthek de ai iidoh shii luagieng, ithek duchoi è giak hò-amuii è Isu shii bushun now srane cho ne luagieng. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Isu è iidoh rai srane ithek shii yao, “Jerusalem pha hò-amuiithek! Nathek gu chiang è achoh chid rabo, jimagunde nawaithek shii nane nawaithek aniphiingthek shii choh bo. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Irek pha inai thog ruii phro branthek è yao ruii, ‘Hanyie hò-amuii è khuchunde ani oi pho ne, hanyie shii khuchunde ani agiak pho ne, chiih-è khuchunde ani niu awang pho ne khama khirzey ro!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Dng 6:16</ref></char></note>Ji pha ishak shii ne branthek è phiingthek shii yao ruii phro, ‘Gu lakhung shii chiih mage bo!’ Chiih-è phiingduiithek shii de yao gu shii ‘Ug phi bo!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Hing isieng ba shii rang de hìthek rey hing gow dun pha ishak rey mage ne nyie rey phlei?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Gai bran layog rek pha nyi shii de Isu rog shii ua pha noh dun. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Ithek Gadong rone beng pha ithua shii thog mage shii, ithek è Isu shii thiihchiih zun muii, chiih-è layog rek pha bran nyi shii de jia shii ai phazoi hà zun chiih-è jia shii ai phawik hà zun muii. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Chng 22:18</ref></char></note>Isu è yao, “ithek shii khung phi bo, Aphuii, ithek nyie rekramuii pha ji ne ithek ne athieg ro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne oi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isu è yao, “ithek shii khung bo, Aphuii! ithek ne athieg ro awaithek nyie rek ramuii pha ji shii.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Ithek è siok fen srane airo yung yi awaithek chung thang rai. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Chng 22:7</ref></char></note>Bran thek thiichiih riu ne Jewish dumuii thek è aishii biwo rek pha ji riigramuii, “Ai è gai shii ragia rek phi; ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii mugua pha Masi chak arone awai shii ragia rek yi bo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Chng 69:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Siphahi jia de aishii biwo rek: ai è de wuii srane aishii igong thoh pha phuii wang, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>chiih-è yao, “Na ne Jewthek pha saja chak arone nawai shii de ragia rek riig bo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Ai lakhung shii hì pha miyaogam zey ne um ro: “Hì ne Jewthek pha saja ro.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Thiichiih zun pha Layog rek pha bran jia de aishii biwo bajo rek ne yao: na Masi asi bey? Nawai shii de ragia rek bo chiih-è gasa shii de ragia rek mage bo.<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Gai jia ji è aishii giung, “Na ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii arum bey? Na shii de ai mirek ji duiine mua ne bey. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Giisa shii mua pha ji ne rangsua chak ro, nyieliieshii giisha nyi mua ne sapho ichiig rek pha ji mua phro; jimagunde ai ne nyie ichiig de arek.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Chiih-è ai Isu shii yao, “Isu na Saja rey mage, gu shii de now bo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Isu è aishii yao, gu na shii sbang rek phro sudoh na de Hamangkhung hà gu rog shii um ruii phro.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu iy dun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mth 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mrg 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Mul 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hì rek pha ishak yi snanyi è uom ishak thog dang pha hasieng asiang pha soh zab biak rey dun; chiih-è Misiahò shii rang pha yungshaig ji de nyi rang ji dun. <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Chng 31:5</ref></char></note>Isu goh gang è yao, “Aphuii wo! Gu ragung na wad shii ruii phro!” Ai ji è yao srane iy dun.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Arming dumuii è nyie rey pha ji jithek riig srane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii chiong srane, yao, ai ne izai bran wie chak ara ro.<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Branthek thiihchiih shii nyie rey pha ji riig pha khrab thog mage shii jithek doh srane ithek duhug rek ne awaithek lubutho phey ne iidoh hò hà dun dun. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Lug 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char></note>Khinyama phothek è Isu shii thieg, chiih-è Galili pha hò-amuii hanyie è Isu rog shii luagieng pha ji lua dang ne, ithek de ìujia ruang shii riu ne riig ramuii.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu wieng muii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mth 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrg 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Thiisa Judea pha Arimathea thawun pha bran Joseph beng pha jia um. Ai yi wie nane ilab um pha bran ro, hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Sajathua wuii ruii pha ji khan ne rai. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Ai ne limiang pha de dumuii ro, ai ne ithek munung nane ithek blia shii de anuii phi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Ai è Philath moe shii wuii srane Isu ro siu iy ji lia. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Chiihphado ai è siu iy ji thazam yie srane yung wie è jiang srane, sak gang è chog ne hanyie de aruii ba pha wieng jishii ruii. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Hì yi sugrubari inai shii ro, chiih-è Jewish Thung pha Inai yi jao sha pha rek ro.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Galili pha hò-amuii hanyie è Isu rog shii luagieng pha ji de wieng shii Isu ro siu iy ji khi-èrek ne ruii lei ne riig pha Joseph rog shii wuii gieng. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Mul 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Iphy 5:14</ref></char></note>Chiihphado è ithek iidoh hò hà dun srane wie no pha nane siie yie ne siu iy jishii shun phi pha saro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Jewish Thung pha Inai shii Iphey shii yao pha duiine ithek thung ne rai.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Isu dinne hòi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mth 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mrg 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Deobari pha hamiang bajo riang hò-amuiiphiingthek è saro pha sei nane wie no pha ji yie srane wieng hà wuii dun. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Ithek shii riig shii wieng cho ji bin pha lubao ne hong dun pha doh. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Ji-è ithek iliing hà wuii srane riig shii; jimagunde ithek Ithong Isu ro siu iy ji adoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Ithek ne thiihchiih shii ji riig srane ayaomuluii ne riu ramuii shii, hamblo è bran nyi yi yung imo chuang srane ithek moe shii riu thog mage. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Bajo rum srane, hò-amuiithek è nyiak lakhung shii bam, bran ji è ithek shii yao, “Nyie rek ne nathek ne bran sieng shii iydun rone sow phlei? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6,7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mth 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mrg 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note>Ai ne ichiih shii oi ro; ai ne hòijong ro. Ai ne Galili hà ba shii ithek shii nyie yao pha ji now mage bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Bran Dufuii shii ne zum srane layog bran shii phi ne bai shii zun muii phro, chiih-è da-uom shii ne hòi din phro.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Chiihphado shii hò-amuiithek è ji pha miyao now, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>wieng è iidoh dun ne, jithek pha miyaogamthek ji zab samoy snajia shii nane gaithek shii de yao. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Ji pha hò-amuii thek yi Mery Magdalene, Joana, Jems amuii Mery; ithek nane gai hò-amuiithek rog pha ji è boh pha samoythek shii yao. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Jishii samoythek è hò-amuiiphiingthek miyao ji yi thaluii ro è now, chiih-è ithek shii migi arek. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Jishii Phithar è jai srane wieng hà ran dun; ai jiing ne riig shii aishii jiang pha yung ji ne um, jimagunde gai ne nyie de oi. Chiihphado ai iidoh hò hà dun srane nyie rey dun ro è wiengphleg dun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne azey oi 12.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emaus shii Lua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mrg 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ji pha ishak shii Isu ro samoy nyi yi Jerusalem è snajia labiang è ruang Emaus hà wuiiramuii shii, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>chiih-è isa chung jithek rey pha miyao ji yao ramuii. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Ai è yao ne muloramuii shii, Isu yi wuii thog srane isa rog shii luagieng; <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Ai è aishii doh, jimagunde de isa è aishii athieg mua. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Isu è isa shii yao. “Nawai sa ji lua srane, nyie mulo raimuii lei?” Ai thiichiih shii mizia duhug rey srane riu dun. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Khleophas, beng pha jia ji è, aishii sai, “Na ne ichiih Jerusalem shii biwen wuii ne bey, ìujia pha nai ibi nyie rey pha ji ne na athieg ba bey?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Ai è sai, “Nyie rey phiiga?” Ithek è chang, Nazareth pha Isu shii rey pha ji ro. Ji pha bran ji ne chaig ro, ai nyie yao pha nane nyie rek pha ji ne bohblu um rone Hamangkhung-aphuii nane branthek è de yoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Gathek ro boh phabi nane bohkhoh phothek è aishii ne zum ne ua muii pha phi muii, chiih-è aishii ne bai shii zun muii phro <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Chiih-è gathek muluthong ne ai ne jia phro Israel shii lam phi pha ji ne! Hì thek zab rey pha ne sudoh da-uom rey sha ro. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Gathek ibrog pha giak hò-amuiithek è ithek buzam wieng hà wuii dun shii, gathek shii de wieng ba yi, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Jishii airo siu iy adoh. Ithek iidoh dun srane yao ithek è ibang shii hamangkhliie shii doh phro, hanyie è yao ai ne isieng ro. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Gathek è giak ibrogthek è wieng hà wuii srane hò-amuiithek miyao ji duiine riig shii, jimagunde ithek è aishii adoh phi.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Chiihphado Isu è ithek shii yao, “Nathek ne khama bi-ìe ro, ithek ne chaigthek miyao jishii zab migi rek pha khama rasey ara ro! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Masi ne diig rek srane awairo biisiie shii khud pha mugak asi bey?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Chiih-è Moses mizey pha jigigam ji è jao ne chaigthek mizey pha jigigam ji è yie srane awai shii khi è yao ne zey ne um pha miyao Isu è ithek shii isiie è yua.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Ithek wuiiramuii pha thiig ji nui thog mage shii, Isu yi ai è ibi wuii pha now; <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Jishii isa è aishii gak srane, yao, “Ga sa rog shii rai bo, inai jong ne igiia rey shii pha rek ro.” Ji-è ai iliing khud srane isa rog shii raigieng. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Ai de chie pha isa rog shii duggieng srane iweb yie khirzey sia; chiiphado è ai iweb ji srane ithek shii de phi. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Chiihphado è isa mieg de hong srane Isu shii thieg ge, jimagunde ai ne ithek mieg è ruang rek muii. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Ithek chung yao rai, ai è lumuii hà gethek shii jigigam ji wie è yua srane yao shii bai duiine gethek shii ahang bey?<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ai jai srane Jerusalem hà iidoh dun din shii, thiisa hà samoy snajiathek yi ò khrab ne gai rog shii um iang <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>chiih-è yao, “Ithong ne izai hòi dinro! Ai ne Simon shii doh yi!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Chiih-è isa nyi è lumuii hà nyie rey pha ji nane iweb chie shii khi-èrek ne Ithong shii thieg pha jithek ithek shii wie è yao.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu awai samoy pho shii doh yi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mth 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mrg 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Blk 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Ji pha bran nyi è jithek yao ramuii shii, hamblo è Ithong awai yi ithek shii riu thog srane ithek shii yao, “Liijiing ne nathek rog shii um bo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne azey oi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chiih-è ithek shii yao, “liijiing de nathek rog um bo.”</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Ithek ne rum dun srane, inow ithek ne bi-iy riigramuii. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Jishii ai è ithek shii yao, nathek nyie rek ne sham ne rum phlei? Nyie rek ne nathek khani shii è rek ne now phlei? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Guro wad nane lai shii riig mage bo, hì ne gui chak ro, gu shii hìog srane riig bo, ji arone nathek thieg ruii phro, bi-iy shii ne ibey nane izaing oi phro, jishii nathek riig bo gu shii ne um ro.<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Ai hì è yao srane ithek shii awai wad nane lai shii riig ba yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:40: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne azey oi 40.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Jimagunde ithek è migi arek mua, ithek ne bajo lubo ne wiengphleg dun shii; ai è ithek shii sai, “Ichiih nathek shii nyie magunde chie pha um bey?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Ithek è aishii ù dau jia phi, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Ai è yie srane ithek moe shii chie. <verse eid="LUK 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Chiihphado ai è ithek shii yao, “Hì thek zab miyao ne gu nathek rog um ba shii yao mujo phro: Gu chiang shii Moses pha Iphey shii chaigthek è zey pha ji nane suthun shii zey pha ji ne izai rey ro.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Chiihphado shii ai è ithek shii jigigam pha miyao ji gao yi pha khani hong phi, <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>chiih-è ithek shii yao, “Hì ne nyie zey ga: Masi ne diig rek srane iy ne da-uom shii hòi din phro, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Ai ibeng pha mua ji è lubukhied pha nane layog è khung phi pha Jerusalem è jao ne zab riing pha shii yao chid phro. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Nathek ne hì pha miyao khagiphothek ro. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Blk 1:4</ref></char></note>Chiih-è gu aphuii è gu shii nyie sbang rek pha ji ne gu nathek shii thohge phro. Jishii lakhung è thazam nathek lakhung shii blu athog sapho shii ne rajan shii khan bo.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii Hamangkhung hà noh dun </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:19-20">Mth 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Blk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:50,51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Blk 1:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chiihphado shii ai è rajan thoh marui srane Bethany hà noh dun, ai wad laziung phia srane ithek shii khirzey phi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Ai ithek shii khirzey phiramuii shii, chiih-è aishii ithek è che srane aishii Hamangkhung hà noh dun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne azey oi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chiih-è hamangkhung hà chiing pha.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Ithek aishii sia srane bajo lubo rek ne Jerusalem hà iidoh dun din dun. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Chiih-è Misiahò shii awaithek ro zab ishak yi Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
